5,'I have tried a handful of natural deodorants, and none seem to work well for me. To list a few I have tried Toms, Arm & Hammer, some salt rock, and one other I can’t remember the name to. I gave up and went back to deodorant with aluminum because I get a little sweaty for my liking. However, I decided to give this brand a try. I have been using it for a week and it has kept me dry and free from stink after a working out as well. It has a nice scent that isn’t overbearing. It’s a little thick and hard to get on if you are really dry, so I like to put it in soon after coming out of the shower. After a days wear I’m fresh and not sweaty. If you’ve been looking for a natural deodorant, you might want to give this one a try.',B07TN3W1KX,AEH3YLRE6QAS6B76BTNSDBLJUQCA
