5,'I am in my late 40\'s and can\'t see up close without my reading glasses. I recently purchased a vanity mirror for my bathroom with 5x magnification. I was horrified with what I saw! The wrinkles didn\'t bother me - that goes along with age. But I have lots of blackheads on my temples! I couldn\'t see them before. I have used the acne tools - the ones that look like dental tools and they work okay, but those often leave behind temporary redness. And you have to be precise about the location because of the small tips. I found this ultrasonic cordless skin scrubber to be much more effective at getting rid of the blackheads! And it doesn\'t leave behind any redness! The end of it is about an inch and a half wide and it is able to scrape out the ugly blackheads. You can see the dirt and grime on the tip after you\'ve used it. Gross! Now as far as the scrubber goes, it comes with a charger. Once it is on, it has a vibration thing going on. It heats up a little bit, but not to the point where it is too hot to use or it burns. I just can feel a little heat from it while it is in use. There\'s a silicone cover to go over the metal end when it is not in use. I am thrilled to have found this!<br /><br />*I received this for free in exchange for my honest &amp; unbiased review. My thoughts &amp; opinions are my own.',B01DVKS3I6,AHV6QCNBJNSGLATP56JAWJ3C4G2A
5,'Love these gloves. I got my first pair from my mother-in-law. I will never be able to go back to anything else. I can pull out any type of weeds and not get any stickers in my hands and I have an eaiser time pulling them out because the gloves are so grippy. They feel like a second skin and are so comfortable.  I would recommend these to everyone.',B002673O9E,AFYKZ23ZTOJHN4ZV3JQ3Y33C3IHQ
4,'I think this works a bit. I bought it to help anti-fog the lenses on my Oculus Quest 2 VR headset. When I get playing an intense workout style game and start sweating then the lenses will fog over. If I apply this before my session then it helps it from being so bad. I still get some fogging after 15 minutes or so and have to clean them again. But it\'s better than it was before and sometimes I can hold off at least until the boxing match is done.<br /><br />It did come with a pretty nice little micro fiber tower and I do think the spray will last quite awhile. I use it about every other day and am only about 25\% of the way through the first bottle after a couple months.<br /><br />Would buy again.',B085S7QW3Z,AEVAXJQN3F5ZUAS7BAQA6PDRTT5A
