5,'Sweet jesus. This thing is a miracle!! I was so excited to get this after reading all the great reviews, and it worked even better than I hoped it would! For the first time in years, my feet didn\'t scratch the sheets when I got in bed. When I got out of the shower and stepped on the tile floor in the bathroom, I thought, &#34;Wow, this floor is cold!&#34; I hadn\'t truly felt it before because of the thick calluses on the ball of my foot and the dry skin on the heels. I walked across the bathroom floor silently -- my bare feet didn\'t make noises like I had flip-flops on. I didn\'t have dragon feet before and I get pedicures pretty regularly but the calluses persisted and would never go away completely, no matter how much I used a pumice stone or any other product. The instrument was very easy to use. I\'m glad I ordered extra rollers, I went through two on my first use.',B00FB3DHTC,AFQTTRVM5QLQK7MMH6SZIQTT55EQ
