5,'I take turmeric every day as an anti-inflammatory and pain reliever.  I swear this stuff is darn near magical!!  My teenager also takes it and notices that she is more sore from tennis when she takes a couple of days off.  I have even started giving it to my cat in very small doses as she is getting old and arthritic!!<br />This turmeric has vegetarian capsules, so if you are vegetarian or vegan, this is the turmeric for you.  In addition to the turmeric, this comes with BioPerine (black pepper extract).  BioPerine helps your body absorb the turmeric more efficiently than plain turmeric, making it more effective. I have no problem taking this supplement, but some can experience stomach issues, and if you are taking blood thinners, make sure that you ask your doctor about this as it does thin the blood.<br />The capsules are of average size and quite easy to swallow, but if you have a problem swallowing pills, they are easy to open, and you can pop them in a flavored drink.  Great stuff<br /><br />I received this product at a free or reduced price in return for my honest and unbiased  review.  All opinions expressed above are my own!',B01DWHJJ3G,AHZNFGV2QZEHXG5V3LAYWON6J3OA
