5,'I drink a gallon of water a day while I\'m losing weight. As a result, it is important for me to replenish my electrolytes. I have tried four flavors because I get tired of drinking the same flavor everyday. One thing to note, I put one scoop in 24 ounces, not 16 ounces as recommended on the container. It tastes too strong in 16 ounces, but just right in 24 ounces. The four flavors that I have tried are lemonade, raspberry, cherry pomegranate, and orange. The only flavor I don\'t like is orange because it tastes like Tang. If you like Tang, however, you will like the orange flavor. One thing to note, it takes a few minutes to fully dissolve in water. I have found that if I leave it for a few minutes after mixing in my water bottle, it will dissolve.',B076BVQYJR,AHWRIQGMJVMZQIVHTWOWJXPD6ZDQ
