4,'I have read about the potential health benefits of Humic and Fulvic Acids and was interested in finding a supplement that contained them. Trace Minerals appears to be a trusted and well recognized brand that makes high quality supplements so I was interested in this Liquid Gut Health supplement. Fulvic acid has a list of potential benefits ranging from inflammation to immunity to brain function to metabolic health and more. But there is not a lot of great research comparing dosages and offering proper recommendations. This liquid contains only 10mg per serving of 1 tsp. The rest of it is just water. It tastes and looks just like water. And after taking it for over a week, I can\'t notice any difference. But if you\'re looking for a pure and tasteless means of supplementing with fulvic and humic acids, this is certainly a worthy option.',B09Q9CYZWF,AEKMZRFI24IXTBXMZOKENNL3VFBQ
