5,'I’ve been using these patches for over a year, and can’t believe how well they work! I’ve used patches that have cost 💲70 for 8 patches, and these are so inexpensive and work better than the expensive ones! They go to work fast, within 15 -20 minutes and lasts about 6-8 hours. I do not recommend keeping on for long periods of time, as they can be difficult to get off, for example, putting it on your arm At 8pm and then go to bed at 10 and wake up at 8am. But if need for night time put on right before you go to bed and take off as soon as you wake up!',B01ET1OE70,AEUAPQUR4CEDS2KAHVYWFUA7J2NQ
