5,'Awesome plugs for noise of any kind. Personally, loud instruments have caused many a problem with my hearing. I think these are a fantastic product, especially for the price, when it comes to saving your precious hearing. The product arrived in standard cardboard and plastic packaging, with the instructions printed on the back of the box.<br /><br />I really enjoyed the fact that there are two levels of protection included in this package. The BLUE plugs are perfect for me, because they allow me to hear my instrument clearly, without allowing too much noise in. The WHITE plugs, in my opinion would be better suited for shooting or construction work as they filter out a greater level of sound. They are very easy to clean with warm water and mild dish soap (please do this! As a healthcare provider, I could go on and on about the risk of infection/hearing damage should you not clean your earpieces)... The only thing I did not like about these plugs, is the carrying case. I think they meant well, but the case is a little too small to easily store the plugs. Well, I should say you can get the plugs in, but they are incredibly hard to remove from the case once you get them in, but it does serve it\'s purpose... Overall, these are the best reusable earplugs I\'ve ever used, and will definitely use them daily and purchase them again if they should fail. I recommend these to musicians, laborers, marksman, husbands/wives of loud snorers, and anyone looking to cut out the noise in their lives. Keep your ears safe with these things, you won\'t regret the buy.<br /><br />I received this product at a reduced price in exchange for my honest, unbiased review. I would never alter my opinion of a product (especially one that protects your health) nor am I affiliated with any company or organization that profits from the sale of this product or any of the products I have reviewed.',B01F04ZDUC,AE6OM2TCFWI6RCEVIDU7ZQ4PMKDQ
