2,'Did some thorough research to find a good eco-friendly deodorant and came across this one.<br /><br />Scent-The bar itself had a nice subtle lavender scent. Once applied to your skin , still very subtle.<br /><br />Deodorizing capabilities- none. Sadly, my pits seemed more odorous with using this and I usually don\'t produce a strong odor after working out<br /><br />Sweat prevention- none. Again, I\'m not the biggest sweater but whenever I used this, my pits where more moist than usual with this product<br /><br />Application- difficult. The bar does not glide on skin whatsoever. I tried to apply more pressure and ended up breaking the bar. I tried to use the smaller piece and it just kept breaking until I ended up with just a bunch of crumbled pieces.<br />No easy way to apply this without getting the deodorant all over your fingers and under nails.<br /><br />Skin sensitivity- none. It did not irritate my skin.<br /><br />Packaging- paper box with a paper wrapping around the bar.<br /><br />Product transfer- it will get on your shirt,  like most deodorants , if you don\'t carefully avoid your pits after applying earlier in the day and you decide to make a wardrobe change<br /><br />Overall - would not recommend',B07TN3W1KX,AEKOZXISK6ATPPNWT7FSMA5D44IQ
