5,'I bought this to get out stains from my baby girl\'s clothes, but I wanted something that would be gentle on her skin. I have sensitive skin so I figured her skin is probably even more sensitive. I\'m happy to report that it has gotten out the toughest stains and she hasn\'t had any skin reactions. It also has no smell which I like too.<br /><br />I mainly bought this for the blow out diapers she was having practically every day. This stain remover has got it out every single time. I try to treat the stain right after, but there have been a few times I didn\'t get to it until the next day and the stains still came out. It helps to rinse it with water first and make sure all the poop is out. Then make sure to really rub the stain remover into the garment where the stain is and let it sit for at least 5 minutes before washing.<br /><br />My sister-in-law accidentally spilt some strawberry juice on my daughter\'s shirt the other day and I didn\'t treat and wash it until the next day and it still came out completely.<br /><br />I will update later after my daughter starts eating solids and let you know if it gets all the different food stains out as well.',B00JR3M6EY,AHVU65FHYSCTVQBWDT22INVDHDHA
