5,'I ordered this for my five-year-old son who was having some trouble with his fine motor skills, especially handwriting. It was recommended by and OT at his school and it was a great recommendation. He was unable to hold his pencil properly and this really helped. He used it for a few months before he was ready to hold his pencil correctly without it. We haven\'t looked back. We didn\'t have a choice of color and we did end up with a purple wrist band with a purple dolphin. Some boys may not appreciate the color purple, but my son didn\'t care. We only used this at home as the OT gave him one to use at school.<br /><br />I will probably hold on to this until my younger son (almost one year old) is ready to start writing, just in case he needs assistance. It\'s a great tool.',B001GXPH76,AGQ4XIWZTFHWTF4IKWEKCUZQL7EA
