1,'These were given to me, and now I know why. I made these for my daughter, my friend, and myself for lunch. The pita crust itself isn’t horrible, though it isn’t good.. and it doesn’t smell appealing. The sauce, once it hits your tongue, has a bit of a zing, then immediately fades away into, simultaneously completely flavorless, and an awful aftertaste. The ‘cheese’ they include doesn’t even melt so I’m confused as to what it is. I added my own cheese, and then tried it. Still tasted like crap. I then added some garlic salt and fresh mozzarella. Still awful. I’m SO thankful I didn’t spend my own money on these. Hard pass.',B07HJG3GLT,AHWFWWKHUXKKITV266IQ5FRI7RTQ
