5,'I purchased the top 4 knee sleeves from different brands at the same time, so that I could compare them head to head. This Li-Ning sleeve is my favorite. My girlfriend has tried them all on as well and agrees with me. It provides the most comfortable support and pressure on the whole knee under the sleeve. It does not pinch on top or bottom and does not cut off the circulation like several others do. The even pressure on the knee is very comforting and pleasant, and I find that I actually enjoy wearing it. I would like to mention that it is a little thick, so has potential for generating sweat in warm weather. I have used it in a soccer game on a turf field and it does a great job of staying up and providing support. After the game my knee felt great and I was able to get away without icing it.<br />So I am sending the rest of the sleeves back and ordering a couple more of these Li-Nings for my other knee and for my girlfriend.',B01CRYQJ8S,AFHARCRG7QDTFSEKU4TGVO6MMMOA
