5,'I think this is a hospital grade lancet, based on how it is packaged/sold and it\'s performance.  I test myself 5-10 times a day, every day, and most lancets I have tried are junk.  Either the spring is too weak or it falls apart after a few weeks.<br /><br />The first one of these I got, I opened the package and started using it.  It worked so well that I wanted to pick up a few more in case it broke.  However the brand name is not on the actual device, just on the packaging.  So a year later when the pen cap broke after I left  it in the washing machine, I tried to repair it with epoxy and ruined it.<br /><br />Since the brand name wasn\'t on the device, It took me awhile to find another one, and I promptly bought several.<br /><br />If you test a lot, get one of these.  You will never want any other brand after you have used it.',B003MWQ8TA,AFZLI2EUYLVECIE6Z5I545O7CEAA
