5,'We love this stuff! We’ve had a terrible time with holding tank odor and bad sensor readings in our current motorhome. It was so bad we finally took it to a repair place to have it cleaned. That’s where we were told about this product. Now we’ve found a routine that works. We use Piranhi as directed (a little goes a long way) and occasionally add hot water to fill the holding tank before driving to our destination, then dump on arrival. Since we’ve been doing this we’ve had no more faulty sensor readings and no more stench from the holding tank. A big plus for me is that here’s no chemical “porta potty” smell. The scent reminds me of clove/cinnamon.',B00ZPR7A60,AE53TKSZGRSRLR7YB7QKXHWKAD2Q
