5,'I\'m allergic to nickel and even small amounts of nickel  in a white gold necklace can give me a rash. Costume ear rings are the worst, leaving my ear lobes red and itchy after a short amount of time. After researching ointments to relieve itching from heavy metals, I found Skinfitique and after reading so many positive reviews, I decided to order the 3 piece kit that includes a cleanser, moisturizer and barrier cream. I used all three products before going to bed and when I woke up the next morning there was a noticeable difference in the rash on my neck! It was a lot less red, itchy and inflamed. By day two my rash was gone. I use all three products daily and I haven\'t had any more flair ups. I love this product and I highly recommend it!!',B01MQWDTJO,AH6G4OJ2PE7YSMMAQ3HJXRRDDEVA
