5,'This right here is the truth. My baby is 8 months old and gets sick quiet often due to low white blood cells (anti bodies that fight off infections) because he has a congenital issue so he takes medication for but brings other side effects....<br /><br />This right here is the truth. Buy this if you can find it. If you can’t get here, go to local Dominican store and more than likely they will have this. My mother bought me this for a virus my baby had. He had this virus for a week and wasn’t getting better. I gave him this in two days he was getting back to himself. Literally you see the phlegm in the poop. Love this stuff! If your baby is under 6 months and over give them this three times a day. About .05mls- about ten drops. My baby is 8 month this is how much I give him. It also doesn’t taste bad at all.',B005TWHG38,AHBAEIQVJMEUQTDTILM2LPPW2RXA
