5,'[[VIDEOID:790c9a69b1e9e0da1c97fe6f615f548]] [[VIDEOID:6080477645dcfabc2e61641293b27e7e]] The Vyver Essential Best 6 Aromatherapy Blends Set is the best set of aromatherapy blends I have tried.  The set comes with  Stress Relief, Head Ease, Health Shield, Breathe, Deep Muscle, Good Night. These oil blends are wonderful.  I love to put Good Night in the diffuser by my bed at night. It really helps me get a good nights sleep.  Deep Muscle is good to rub into muscle aches. I mixed a few drops with some jojoba oil and put it into a roller ball and it works good.  Head ease works well for me when I place it on my temples.  It is nice and relaxing. I love to come home and put stress relief in my diffuser after a long hard day at work.  This is a really nice set and the first set I have seen with blended oils in it.<br /><br />Here is what you get in this set.<br />  Stress Relief - Decompress After A Long Day &amp; Keep Worries At Bay!<br />  Head Ease - Fight Off Headaches &amp; Migraines, Naturally<br />  Health Shield - Fortify Your Immunity<br />  Breathe - Decongest Your Airways &amp; Find Relief From Respiratory Infections<br />  Deep Muscle - Stimulate Muscle Tissue Through Massaging, Allay Pains &amp; Cramps<br />  Good Night - Ease Disturbances, Bring About Restorative Sleep &amp; Sweet Dreams!<br /><br />Good Night and Stress Relief so far are my favorites.<br /><br />Disclaimer - I received this product at no cost in exchange for my honest opinion and review. No compensation was received for this review.',B0190Q9ENI,AFFQQIQV5B3UE6YQC6OBUKWIS4LQ
