1,'I don\'t know what 10 quot by 15 quot is but it is not 10 inches by 15 inches. The measurement is more like 9.75 by 13.75.<br /><br />I could deal with the product if it was a little smaller than advertised but the product is also cheap. The under-side is made of a flimsy terry cloth that looks like it might not last more the a few uses. The blue felt cover has a spongy undercover and it too looks like it won\'t last more than a few uses. The two velcro straps are okay but they are no more durable than a sturdy ace bandage.<br /><br />There might be some value to the engineering of the product but there is simply no way this cover is worth more the 5 dollars.<br /><br />In fairness - the all temp hot/cold pack does fit inside this cover. But I am still not a happy buyer.',B0048GRLM2,AH4SPLYQNZH47YKYA5SXLOBKNZZA
