5,'This maternity belt is awesome.  It has velcro-like edges on both sides of the strap so nothing hangs down.  If you are needing a tighter fit, it also has an additional 2 elastic straps to help lift baby up out of your pelvis. There is some boning in the back that gives extra support to the lower back and lessens the desire to tilt your pelvis too far forward to support the weight of your baby.<br /><br />I was suffering from some major joint pain that flared up when I would lift my legs, get up from sitting or lying, and sometimes just walking.  I am only 5 months along and had been suffering from the pain intermittently since about 3.5 months (before I was even showing).  Once the pain progressed and wouldn\'t go away, I was concerned.  I ordered the belt initially to help until I could get to my next doctor appointment.  Within a couple of hours of wearing this belt, the pain was alleviated entirely.  I wore it consistently for 5 days, and today I didn\'t need to wear it and had no aches all day at work!  So relieved and happy that I made this purchase! This is the one purchase I will be recommending to everyone!',B01JO6O9WA,AFLF45FIHNEPYCYTCFCCZGCHB4PQ
