4,'Scale is consistent in it measurements within about .5 pounds and most times about .2.  It weighs about .2 to .4 pounds heavy.  I weighted my dumb ells 12 =  11.8, 15 = 15.2, 27 =  27.2, 30  = 30.4, 45 = 45.2 really close for a bathroom scale.  The KEY is it is more consistent.  I weigh myself, have someone else weigh, then I re-weigh and it is either exactly the same (much of the time) or within about .2 pounds.<br /><br />Other scales I have used weighed pounds different, some times as many as three pounds if you stepped on it, cleared it with a different weight, and re-weighed.',B073W64CY8,AEEADSMFLR5TAHABVVZPK4FVCLYA
