3,'I have tried Capella\'s Cinnamon Danish, and French Vanilla and was very pleased with them so when I saw Pumpkin Pie I thought mmmm sounds good. I was very disappointed to find that there is little flavor in the Pumpkin Pie Drops. I only need about two drops with the other flavors, but I need about ten drops with this flavor, and still can\'t taste much pumpkin pie.',B000PF6QXU,AGCSFTA4CLRFN4M5D6JCJ4EKJA2Q
5,'Whoever invented this deserves an award!!! First of all, I buy so much on Amazon, I do not have the time to review everything that I buy but, this deserves a review to hopefully help others out there who have suffered as much as I have. My partner snores... mouth open. Very loud guttural sounds! He\'s a very heavy sleeper and I often find myself punching or pinching him in the arm to finally get him to roll over. Ahhh... relief! I think that the snoring is over, but it\'s not! Now that he\'s on his belly, it\'s only a different sound but just as loud. I was wary but willing to get him just about anything (including surgery), so that I could have a decent nights sleep without thinking that I\'m on the set of The Walking Dead. I decided to start with nasal strips... no luck. His snoring is not in his nasal area, it\'s in his mouth dropping open, sucking in that air and letting it out with more force than you can imagine. This chin strap is amazing!!! First night... he snored and I was bummed... planning his surgery as I tried to fall asleep. Cut the vocal cords were in my thoughts!!! Next day, I realized that he wore it wrong. I still had hope. That night, I put it on him... not a very attractive look but my hopes were for good nights sleep. Hallelujah! It worked! He\'s been wearing it for a week now and I\'m sleeping through the night without dreaming of The Waking Dead! Thank you, thank you, thank you!!! I LOVE this chin strap! In addition, he has no complaints... it\'s very comfortable for him and he feels better knowing that he\'s not snoring. This is a must for mouth snorers!!!',B07B6SL3T8,AHTGXH7Z4K7ODDFMFTQMS67XFNGQ
