4,'Just got this today and have already used it.  The motor isn\'t as powerful as I was expecting, so the sanding disc doesn\'t spin as fast as I want it to, but it does get the job done.  Just takes longer than I\'d like.  I use a pumice sponge on my feet in the shower and Miracle Feet lotion after I get out.  But I\'ve gotten lazy about putting lotion on my feet every night before bed, and it was starting to show! I was also starting to get some cracks on my heels.  Ended up having to use one sanding disc per foot, but now that the worst is filed, I\'ll only need to use one disc per filing session.  I also filed the callouses on my hands, and that went really fast! Maintenance should be much less time consuming.  I still have some areas I want to file smoother, but my feet are much softer and less calloused than they were before!',B077NWXSRY,AFUDWYUKCTM5YXZ4QZVCHOJ5K6NQ
