4,'So far so good. This is my first shaving brush so I don\'t have others to compare it to. That said, after about six uses everything seems to be normal. Not quite scent free yet but not bad by any means. Still loses the occasional hair but nothing that I didn\'t expect. It seems stiff enough to work the lather but feels soft on my face. I certainly haven\'t had any problems and Adam is Johnny on the spot with emails and tips for proper use. Given that our local shave shop had their lowest end brushes with a starting price of $60 and quickly going up from there, I am very happy with what I paid for this brush and would steer anyone this direction. Maybe someday I\'ll try a silvertip and realize what I was missing but...I doubt I\'m missing much.',B00QFXVOL0,AGH6FW3HHKBATB7AOUOCOKOD2Y7Q
