4,'I couldn\'t have received this in the mail at a better time. I walked a very active and strong dog last night and it literally pulled my arm so hard that within an hour or so my elbow and surrounding area was quite painful to movement. I slept with it straight all night. My ThermaChill arrived in the mail today (fast shipment). I sprayed it on but got a lot in one place so I used my fingers to spread it around. It has a pleasant smell but it is like the old people smell of bengay. It is very cold on my arm but I am not getting a lot of pain relief, some but not a lot. I do like that this product is Paraben free, aerosal free and has mostly natural ingredients, Arnica, eucalyptus, tea tree, vitamin e, aloe, not all are organic but some are. I like this as an alternative to oral pain killers or smelly tylenol rub. I usually use traumeel which is very expensive, this is $15, so average priced for a topical pain reliever. I got this product for free via AMZRC',B01BMHEFM8,AGQRR4CO4HR3KN5PZVWUGU744XPA
