5,'I have to admit, I was hesitant at first to try out this product, which I received at a discount for purposes of providing an unbiased, honest review. As a rule, I prefer lotions or cremes. However, I really needed something to help combat what I call my &quot;lizard skin&quot; legs, and to help protect my forearms, which have begun to suffer from skin tears( e.g., small skin scrapes that occur when I bump something, etc). I am really too young for these conditions, which seem in hardly instead to be medication related. Nothing has worked, until now. This oil is a miracle-worker. I put the lotion on for the first time, and it penetrated through several layers, and actually plumped up my skin. I use it twice a day now, and couldn\'t be happier with the results. My skin is still healing, but I would say that at this point, my hands already look 5 years younger, if not more. My legs don\'t have<br />lizard skin&quot; anymore, anywhere, either. Nothing--and I mean- NOTHING ELSE has ever worked like this. I predict that I will be buying it in bulk!',B01DAKDW42,AH3DFYQYYJNED656B7RYBKARGQBQ
