1,'So... Like the other reviewer I was looking for a savory flavor protein bar instead of the usual fruity or candy bar flavored.  My goal is to increase protein intake as part of a weight loss dietary change. This product tastes absolutely terrible.  The beef flavor and texture reminded me of the beef Frank\'s MRE from my time in the Army. That kind of processes and pressed meat texture. Then comes the ginger wasabi flavoring. These are usually flavors that I enjoy. In this product they were not enjoyable in the slightest. The one and only bite I had of this bar was so bad I had to fight to swallow it. Now I understand taste is all based on personal preference. Perhaps my particular bar had gone bad or something because that\'s what came to mind as I was chewing it. If you absolutely must try this, buy a single serving from the grocery store first.',B00J3JXBIM,AHSGE452NNNJA2ALHLA4LAAVSWDQ
5,'Our family loves tools and health = but this is a new one on me.<br />HAD to see for ourselves how well this product works.<br />And as it turns out - a pretty clever and useful idea.<br /><br />>>> Fits - DEWALT CORDLESS jig saw DCS331B (bare tool)<br />The adapter shaft is designed the same as Dewalt saw blades - which lock in<br />by two humps - (one each side of the blade) for a solid hold.<br /><br />>>> The adapter also works with my older - SEARS CRAFTSMAN auto scroller - #917227.<br />because a blade for that tool is held in by a set screw.<br />A Sears saw blade has a hole in it where the screw sets in for a firm hold.<br />> BUT this adapter doesn\'t have a hole = SO the set screw butts up against the shaft<br />and holds the adapter in that way. And seems to hold firmly.<br />The center of the set screw is approx 1/4\" from the end of the shaft.<br />(Of course - if desired - one could drill a hole, and solve that issue)<br /><br />A typical - short sabre saw blade (of various brands) is 3\", so this 3 3/4\" adapter works well.<br />The tip being hard metal (aluminum) = one needs to tread softly to not overdue / affect / hurt ones body.<br />But I was very surprised how effective = with GENTLE CARE - the adapter is.<br /><br />Dr. Flex kit - includes a Titanium adapter shank = one end fits the jig saw,<br />(depending on which one you have, doesn\'t fit all jig saws)<br />the other end is threaded for the massage tip to screw onto.<br /><br />Includes an optional use O-ring, which seems to help the tip from jarring loose.<br />Comes with a felt (drawstring) bag, in a sturdy cardboard box for storage.<br />Interesting product = 5 stars',B07XJS9NV9,AGNUU44ETNXLBOUB53LJGFJP3SQA
