5,'They are perfect for their description.  I read some reviews felt they were too large, however all you need to do is adjust the Velcro.  Also, for outdoor activities they are perfect for rolling up placemats.  Nothing brightens a table quite like sunflowers!',B07RZZKL4T,AEAGJIZUNZTIQJLNHGXFIJH7ECVA
5,'When I review a pain relief item, I am interested in the mechanism for pain relief whether it 1) absorbs deep into the pain source such as high quality Emu oil does, or 2) whether it masks pain through a cooling and/or heating sensation. The latter type of pain relief can relax muscles and thus, potentially free joints-- thus both mechanisms are useful. This particular product works primarily according to the second route. That is, it contains a menthol (called methyl salicylate) that first cools the injury sight, then leaves a lasting feeling of heat. In addition to this primary ingredient however, they include Indian frankincense (from the plant, Boswellia) as an anti-inflammation agent. So this product is trying to be the best of both approaches. For about two weeks I have been comparing this pain medicine to other pain relief creams and lotions. I love the spray applicator so my hands do not get messy or greasy. It makes it more convenient to use when in public for instance, or at bedtime when one simply wants to turn out the lights and not run to the washroom to scour hands clean. The spray has a feint menthol + rubbing alcohol smell and a few seconds after spraying it will leave a cool feeling, a minute later the cool becomes hotter. Feels like icy hot in a spray. However, I sleep better knowing that unlike pure icy hot creams, this also has boswellia to lower inflammation. So it is supposed to mask and speed healing. I cannot tell you if the inflammation is actually going down, but I do get relief. Though not as much relief as my emu oil. As an added bonus, the product evaporates my sweat (there must be alcohol in the product) adding an additional layer of cooling and keeps me dryer.<br /><br />Overall, This product ranks #2 among 6 types of pain relief I have been using off and on. My favorite product however (a cream with high quality hemp and menthol and emu oil) is 4 times more expensive than this spray. Given the $10 per bottle price, which seems more than reasonable for what you get, I will happily give it 5 stars. I hope this helps with your pain and please give this a thumbs up if my review has helped you with your decision to purchase (or not)',B08KFLC533,AHSJ73XC3DMN6FGEHNJ6HI2L2WLQ
5,'So far so good. This is lasting FAR better than the larger Germ Guardian I purchased from BB&B. It is extremely quiet. Maybe the sound of a small fan on low, if that. I have it in one child\'s room to try it out. I will go ahead and get a second for the other one. It does seem to help with odors, as I now do not smell the hamper in his room. The room has no smell at all, which is lovely. As for killing virus\'s that I will have to trust is taking place. How can you possibly really know this?',B000G2BESO,AHQAMEZGYFDI7T5APCQKHXC7ONVA
5,'This is a wonderful product for extending the life of produce in the refrigerator.<br />The sellers give excellent customer service.  The item arrived slightly damaged, so I contacted the sellers and they promptly replaced my damaged product.  I am very pleased with this purchase and I recommend this product',B00OM60CTM,AFG7EEWAX7L4IDTSAFZTUHJVIEKA
4,'This is a set of all cotton decorative cloth pads for women\'s menstrual support. For any woman seeking additional aid with absorbing the monthly flow this makes a nice gift. For cotton cloths that are just worn underneath your clothes it is a little expensive, but if you like these colorful, attractive designs it is worth it.',B07JNQXTJC,AGQXRXHIEUGJU6KNUPNWMXYBRREA
5,'My wife got this kit for me as a fathers day gift. when I opened it I was surprised to see how much was in it. This kit works great I have done a few tats with it so far with no issues from the machines. The machines vary in weights so Im sure there will be a few that suit just about any one. And it does come with everything you need its a travel kit all on its own or makes a great addition to a set work station. I personally wouldn\'t use the ink for anything more than practice ink, there is nothing wrong with the ink as far as I can see I just have my preferred brand of ink I use. If you are starting out, doing tats as a hobby, or just need a good little travel kit Id recommend this one.',B009BK1QEO,AFW6FFD6GIZIFLIMQHTWODUYUF4A
