5,'Upgrade Version Eyeglass Repair Kit,XSIATO Glasses Magnetic Screwdriver Set with Eyeglass Tiny Screws Kit and Nose Pads Tweezer Curved Tweezer,Eyeglass Cloth Ear Hook, Sunglass, Spectacles Repair<br /><br />I never knew that there was so much to an eyeglass repair kit.  This kit has every kind of screw and screwdriver imaginable, all packed into a nice, compact case.  There are tons of different screws and numerous screwdriver bits.  There are tweezers and ear hooks and nose pads.  It comes with a cleaning cloth and a decent screwdriver for all of those bits.  It even has a tool for magnetizing and de-magnetizing the screwdriver bits!  The screwdriver is much larger than the ones in those little kits that can be picked up at a pharmacy or grocery store.  I\'m happy about that because the tiny screwdrivers in those grocery store kits are difficult to use and are just really cheap quality.  Now I can go through my junk drawer and toss all of them in the trash.  This easily replaces all of them.<br /><br />My one complaint is that the screwdriver is kept separate from the rest of the kit.  It doesn\'t look like there\'s any way to fit it in there with all of the other stuff.  A little more thought should have gone into the case because though the screwdriver is larger than the normal ones, it is not impossible for it to get lost.  A slightly larger case would have accommodated all of the pieces of the kit.  It seems like a miss.<br /><br />Still, it\'s not a big enough complaint for me to give this amazing kit anything less than five stars.',B08JLGJL7K,AH3PZSQQEL5JD3MHXDTNT47U436A
