5,'I have a couple of other nice wooden boxes for oils storage, but this is much better. It\'s perfect large enough so there\'s room in one case for all my oils, as well as duplicates of things I use lots of like Peppermint. I can zip it closed and take it with me when I travel. It\'s tall enough that even my rollers fit. I really like this case, solid and holds lots. I do have 2 small critiques, there\'s not a clearly indicated top/bottom from the outside of the case, but it\'s an easy fix, I just used a sharpie to make a small arrow so I\'d know. The second critique is that I think it would be just a small bit more secure if the handle of the carrying case was on the opening side of the Zipper rather than the hinge part of the case, I\'d feel more secure if the zipper wasn\'t toward the floor while carrying this.  The zipper does feel solid, and changing this would require a slightly different handle configuration, but these are my only critiques. Otherwise, I think this case is very near perfect for it\'s intended use.',B075X3KPNB,AG5WYL5PCN7M4KSQCYAOGHE6SYFA
