5,'After using blade and foam for 65 years, I wanted something quicker, less messy, and easier to use.  This economical Dynabliss fits the bill.  I can shave in 4 to 5 minutes and use only 4 to 5\% of the battery life, respectively.  After about 10 shaves, my face got used to the change to an electric shaver which I understand is typical.  The shave is not quite as close as it is with a blade and soap, but the result is not visible to the eye, only to a finger rubbed against the grain.  And, very importantly, it is very quiet.  After opening the blade head and holding it and the drive elements under running water for 10 to 15 seconds, the whole unit is clean.  After using it for about a month, I have not needed to use the cleaning brush.  Highly recommended.',B07QNW5F8G,AG4KQTLECFLDSXUYVDAUJGB2WJSA
