4,'I have tried Biotin products before for my paper-thin and easily-torn nails. Sometimes they seem to work but then it isn\'t long lasting and my nails go back to their pathetic state.  I read recently that the main reason people think that these products work is because they really want them to so  they also start taking better care of their nails like wearing gloves while washing dishes and caring for their cuticles more at the same time.  So there could be this placebo effect going on but these seem to be working much better than other supplements I have tried. I ordered a second bottle and have been taking 2 a day for about 5 weeks. My nails are longer and stronger than ever and they don\'t tear off when I wash my hair.  I haven\'t noticed a change in my hair, lashes, or skin but those haven\'t been a problem for me.',B017PV397C,AFKCHBKZWOA5GO2YU6KUMU3DE7RA
