5,'I wish I could give this product six stars because I think it\'s amazing!!!!<br />I take it daily for fibromyalgia and lupus. It helps to keep pain away, joints feel less tense and I have more energy. However I know lots of people have written about how Swedish bitters help in this respect.<br />I wanted to tell you something new.........<br />My teenage daughter has suffered from quite severe acne. See was treated by doctors and hospital consultants for approx two years - with very little change to her skin.<br />One day I had a thought to use Swedish bitters on her skin. We put the liquid onto a cotton pad and dabbed it on her skin at night. My daughter then slept - all be it looking slightly yellow!! - in the morning she would wash it off and repeat the process the next evening.<br />After one week the difference was amazing. After three weeks her skin was almost clear, after six weeks there wasn\'t a spot or a scar in sight.<br />She continued to use it every evening for around six months and now only uses it on the odd break out spot should it occur.<br />I hope this can help other acne suffers as much as it has helped my daughter.',B0015KGYAE,AFPCE22AR5KIZTVX7QRZXXE7ROPQ
