5,'I was given these at a discount for my honest opinion. Can I say, they are balls of fun. They were shipped so quick I think I got them 2 days after I ordered. I gave them a quick wash slid them in and went grocery shopping. I know crazy right, but I needed something to give me a little pep in my step. So I was day dreaming through the store practicing squeezing. I honestly felt a little naughty. I found myself more focus on the toning of the kegel muscles then on shopping....forgot a few of my items. The plus to these little gems is after 2 days of play with them .....I can feel a difference in sex. I think with the effort I\'m putting in with them, my interior has more feeling. I think every woman can use these especially if you have had children. It does bring an extra level of pleasure I wasn\'t aware I was missing and well we can use a barbell to strengthen our love muscles.',B00UZJLFOG,AGN564L7DGI5X75N7P3KC32VCDEQ
