5,'I bought this because of my mom. It would be mine but she can use it.<br />Story..<br />While at Costco, a vender was demo \'a\' non-zero gravity massage chair for 3499.00. I sat in it but said \'I\'m not going to recline and get a massage in front of God and everybody in Costco.<br />I stood up and in mid stride (I kid Not) a voice in my head said, \'but what about your mom?\' My eyes widened,  I said ok, sell me on this thing. (Vender would be there 3 more days at which time I was driving 18 hr to Long Beach, CA.<br />I said I\'d be back before vender left, knowing I needed this for mom.<br />I told my personal trainer. He shouted NO WAY!! Google it.<br />I did that night. Got This ZERO GRAVITY for under 900.00 including 3yr Warrenty.<br />It arrived post hast. Put it together in 30min.<br />WIRTH EVERY FRIGGIN PENNY hands down!!! I never would have spent the $ on me.<br />I train with a cage fighter. I\'m 62yo.<br />Worth EVERY penny 2x.Love it. So does mom.',B00YGKYJGG,AFVX3ZYCEIZX5EQWEBK6AEOKM7LQ
