5,'Found this beard brush while looking for something a little more manageable and portable for grooming my beard and trying to train and maintain it.<br /><br />The upsdie:  Original order went in and received my item 3 days later via USPS.<br /><br />The downside:Unpacked it, used it and within a couple of hours a co-worker pointed out that I had feathers on my shirt.  Turned out to be bristles from my new brush.<br /><br />The uber-up:  Spoke with the manufacturer and I think they were more upset about it than I was.  Drop shipped a replacement and received this one in 2 days USPS.  Manufacturer was very apologetic and assured me this was not up to standard and would not repeat.  Been using this one for a couple of weeks without problem.<br /><br />The short and curlys: This brush was made for your palm.  Fits comfortably and easy to manage while brushing my beard.  Bristles are stiff enough to maintain stand while brushing without feeling like you are using a cactus on your face.<br /><br />Koodo - I don\'t expect perfection in the things I buy, I expect to get my money\'s worth and the manufacturer to stand behind their product.  These guys more than met those expectations.<br /><br />Would I buy it again?  If I had a second beard, in a heartbeat.  Beyond that, if the one I have ever needs replacing, this is what I\'ll come looking for.',B00M1WYYWK,AFFY3QJZ5FDWHZTLRH6A25VI5YAA
