4,'These Amazon Elements women’s daily multivitamins are a quality vitamin. Yes, they are a bit large but not any larger than  my current food based vitamin I normally take.  I have no issues swallowing these multivitamins.  I have taken them on an empty stomach and with food, neither way upsets my stomach.  I love that 59\% of the ingredients in these vitamins are cultured from whole food and that amazon discloses the ingredients in the vitamin, where they come from, and what purpose each one has. I also like that these vitamins do not contain any artificial flavors, colors or chemical preservatives.  My only complain is that I wish they contained more calcium as the only contain 25mg or \%3 of the daily recommended value.  Overall I think they are a great multivitamin and a good value. I myself have just been taking a calcium supplement in addition to this multivitamin to meet my needs.',B075DLLC4V,AFKBVRDWS2ZPNM6EAEA2GRYRXFPA
