5,'I am on an extremely restricted diet, and while this is still \"cheating\" it doesn\'t hurt me when I eat it and helps curb the sugar cravings! This isn\'t for someone who drinks a soda everyday because this will taste super bland, this is for someone who has cut out all sugar and on a restricted diet. It\'s a bit more than I would like to pay but what do you expect when it\'s a specialty organic chocolate?!?! PLUS it\'s not that much more, it\'s only $1.50 per serving, you pay a $1 for any \'ole candy bar at the store that\'s FULL of junk! I\'ll gladly pay the .50 more! But I wish I could buy more than 12 bars at a time, I eat this in about 3-4 months!',B07DBC34KY,AE3ZRK7N2UXTJHN2DDGJIDDMKE2Q
