2,'Wow, I can\'t believe the 5 star reviews for this, so maybe not everyone experiences what I\'m experiencing with it. But, what I am experiencing is pretty foul and disgusting! First, every time I open the jug, I get a smell that has an underlying rottenness to it, though I fail to see how a product like this could rot, or spoil. Still, EVERY SINGLE TIME I eat this stuff, I get bad gas & the runs. No cramps, or bloating, just lots of passing of smelly gas & runny bowls that smell particularly foul. This is so bad that on 2 occasions, when I thought I was only going to pass gas, I found myself having to take a shower and launder my pants! Could have been not just inconvenient and messy, but extremely embarrassing, and almost impossible to deal with, had it happened in public away from home! I will say that the stuff tastes pretty good, but with the way it\'s affecting my digestive system makes it impossible for me to use. You can try it, if your brave enough, and maybe it\'ll be just fine for you. But, it wasn\'t for me, and now I find myself stuck with half of a $39.99 jug that I can\'t use, and having consumed half the jug, I think I gave it more than a fair trial.',B01N9ZYBBU,AEJ727Y7JSGHO3AJJBUKZX65NRMA
