5,'I\'ve been a long time back pain sufferer. I\'ve had two back surgeries. I\'ve just bought  a decent new chair by Thomasville. I sit at the computer for many hours each day only to cuss myself for one,not having anymore sense and two, not taking more frequent rest periods.<br /> Enter the Wondergel Extreme Orthopedic Seat Cushion. The manufacture states, This miracle seat cushion is made from an advanced space age co-polymer gel called \"Wondergel\".<br /> This new-age material allows one to sit for hours without the usual cushions that just flatten out after setting on them for hours.<br /> I\'m using this new cushion in my new chair to write this review. I can tell you that this cushion breaks the (Mold) of all of the other types of so-called new age materials used in making seat cushions.<br /> As a new owner, \"You can have my cushion, when you pry it from my cold dead hands\"! Do the reasearch for yourself. See for yourself. I wish that I\'d have known of this product a long time ago. I would not have set in pain. Thanks, Randy H.',B004CUHJSK,AENVTF5WYSDSJCCVQPK46DYKO35A
