3,'The product itself is good however nobody mentions the ambient smoke.  Unless your mouth is firmly and correctly in place you can get some smoke leakage. Whether cigarette, pipe ,joint or whatever there is still plenty of smoke around to smell.  It only handles the smoke you blow into it. So I can not see how all these reviews say it works 100\% . What about the smoke coming from the lit joint, ,pipe or whatever it does nothing for that and therefore can not eliminate all the smoke. Does it reduce the amount of smoke yes. Does it remove all smoke ,no.  Unless they make it a self contained system it can not work 100\%.  Bought it to use during thanksgiving with family for my medical 420 but because of ambient smoke I could not use it. So really what\'s the point ?  Anyone have any ideas how to solve this problem? Then you will have a winning product,until then I will have to keep sneaking outside.....unfortunately.',B00478UIB2,AGNUZLMGMRPOSJT47C7MOFXYJD2A
