5,'I\'m so excited that I found these!  This is my third little one and breastfeeding has always been a challenge. My goal with this one was to make it past 6 weeks so from the moment we got home, I was trying everything to try to boost my supply. I was only pumping an ounce from each side and it wasn\'t enough to fill my baby\'s tummy. We introduced formula to supplement and to help increase her weight, per dr. Since starting the milk flow, I haven\'t had to supplement as I can pump a little bit extra to help those feedings that are close together. She\'d latch but would get so upset when she wasn\'t getting enough, it was so heartbreaking to feel that I wasn\'t enough and now in those moments, I can provide breast milk and not formula. (Formula has been hard on her tummy and has caused her to be gassy and constipated.) I have my fingers crossed that it keeps working as the amount she eats continues to grow.',B01DO9JSOW,AFKWZQUQ3KC7TX3XMRNVRA6XOH6A
