5,'Really great. My old nose-hair trimmer wouldn\'t cut butter. My wife has always done my brows, sideburns and ears. I recently grew a beard (out of boredom), and she trims it beautifully using one of the combs---looks really professional. Using just the blade to edge around the mouth to get prickly whiskers and to neaten up the mustache is fool proof.  I have not cut myself. It\'s also great to trim your neck in front. Beats my shave-cream razor to reduce prickly whiskers there, and my neck feels smoother and for longer than my razor. Worth every penny..',B073F6RGNH,AFGP7WTINTGCUFVMOGACQHBL5LOQ
5,'I try to be especially conscious of the health of my children and go to painstaking lengths to make certain that they have nutritional meals available to them. However, I also believe that it is almost impossible for us to reach all of our nutritional goals through food alone. Therefore, I decided to buy vitamin D drops to enhance the absorption of vitamins and nutrients.<br /><br />The product arrived on time and in perfect condition. The packaging was so good as to make it a little difficult to get into the package in the first place.<br /><br />The first night, we put a few drops in my daughter\'s water. My little one loves this Vitamin D supplement. She normally will reject anything new or even the slightest bit different from the norm, but on this first night, she drank without objection. Since that first interaction, we give it to her every night. Out of curiosity, I decided to try a drop myself, and found that it tastes great too. We love the dropper as it makes it simple to measure doses; I sometimes worry about how much we give our daughter whether it be medicine or even the form of nutritional supplement even though I am not sure if Vitamin D3 can really have that great of side effects. I put it in her sippy with her juice just to disguise the taste, and she can\'t taste it at all.<br /><br />As far as the longer lasting effects of the vitamin D3 drops, I cannot quite say with absolute certainty. I can say this: my daughter has not been sick in the time that I have made this as a part of her daily nutritional regimen, and she appears to be one of the healthiest children you could imagine. Again, this is not the only thing involved in trying to assure her good health. Vitamin D3 drops are only to assist her body in the absorption of other vitamins and nutrients.<br /><br />Highly recommend this Vitamin D and will continue to purchase in the future.<br /><br />I received this product at a discount for my honest and unbiased review.',B0104ATVPU,AE24IUPDYFDDXKRRJN7LHV3XQ5GQ
