5,'First time buying a Purple mattress product. My package arrived wet from the pouring rain, so I had to let the cushion sit on a table for it to dry overnight.<br /><br />The cushion feels great. There were some quality defects (which can be seen in the molding and some minor tearing) but they didn\'t affect the overall usage of the purple cushion. Also, keep in mind that the cushion won\'t fit the contour of certain chairs. I have an IKEA JÄRVFJÄLLET chair and the back of the cushion (where the tailbone is) won\'t fit. But that\'s okay. Sometimes the back corners get squished down by the chair, but that can be easily adjusted. The purple cushion seems pretty durable.',B01CKMP21W,AG6QJ5XIPBE6GI2JZHWRC6YQWAMQ
