3,'I think this product should serve its purpose well for those looking for an oral rehydration product. It doesn\'t taste overly salty or sugary, and the orange flavor is similar to that of orange Gatorade or an orange popsicle. However, there is quite a medicinal aftertaste that was very off-putting to me. In a pinch, I would certainly use this product. But since I have POTS, I need to drink several liters of fluid a day, and drinking that much of this product would probably be very disagreeable to my taste buds and stomach. However, I have a very sensitive sense of taste, so this may work great for other people!',B01FIDM6CS,AE735TLUSIJHGUFWYMPAVG7GZURQ
5,'I have to say. I am that person that simply had an oscillating fan, set up in the bedroom, to provide a white noise effect.<br />I, unfortunately, have one neighbor that is an insomniac & chooses to move furniture around at 2:00 a.m.<br />Another neighbor feels that terrorizing their small dog, so it goes into a barking frenzy, is great fun. This can go on for hours.<br /><br />Anyway, a friend recommended the Dohm/Marpac Sound Conditioner. I was skeptical.<br />Let me tell you, I have had it for one week now, and have been getting the best sleep of my life.  It provides the perfect type of white noise to cover up any annoying noises that may have kept you from enjoying a full night\'s rest.<br />It is very easy to change the tone/volume, simply by twisting the vents to either a more open or closed position.<br /><br />Trust me, if you are on the fence about this item, give it a shot.<br />My only gripe would be that I had not heard of it earlier & have missed many night\'s of good rest.<br /><br />Enjoy!',B000LQI2S0,AEGFH4TXJ2I375IACKNRKSNMPPGQ
