5,'I read a lot of the reviews on here about this product and I\'m kind of one of those don\'t believe the hype, whether positive or negative, until you try it. I\'ve heavily relied on coffee and energy drinks for a long time suffering the surge, crash, and costly Starbucks bill. I run a pretty hectic life. I have 3 daughters all 5 and under. I manage a good sized technical team working 50 hours a week and commute round trip 3 hrs a day. I tried BTT based on a recommendation from a friend and honestly thought nothing of it the first time. It tasted good and we were doing a yard project so I was like \'why not?\' I decided to try a second glass the next day and I started feeling less fatigued. No real energy rush, just not exhausted.<br /><br />Fast forward and I\'m on my second canister. After being out of the shape for 7 months doing limited physical activity, I made it to the gym by 5:30 am 10 days in two weeks. I stopped drinking coffee for four days now because honestly, I don\'t even crave it. Like other people have experienced, food that is bad for you is less desirable if not gross. I actually make better eating decisions now because I\'m not in a rush to get some kind of nourishment in my body. I feel like there is sustained energy. Other things I\'ve noticed: a more clear focus, my anxiety levels have dropped, my respiratory functions have improved (I had moderate asthma all my life), I think an after effect is that I\'m happier because all of the other positive effects. I haven\'t had any negative side effects and read the concerns of others, but based on my own research and experience, this product is not harmful. As with any supplement I\'d recommend cycling on and off it.<br /><br />I was disappointed by the reviews of people who have either not tried the product or are bitter about being caught up in an MLM scheme whether lost money. I have no intention of becoming a distributor, but I thoroughly enjoy the product. This product is not a 3 star product in my opinion. I give it 5 stars for sure. If there was really harmful stuff in the product, I feel like there would be some noticeable negative side effect. That is my 2 cents!',B006M3YNKC,AGK7QWXVY5IFIHDBRILN3VX5M2OQ
