3,'The banners themselves are very nice. However the white wooden balls are not attached to the dowel rods and come off very easy which causes the hanging ribbon to come off.  I lost one of the balls when I was trying to put it up and it fell off somewhere in my garden. The other hanger came apart shortly after I hung the banner up. I ended up putting them up with staples and duc tape.',B08G148QNQ,AHPEWFMFIBCNKJJBGS53JLVGQMVQ
5,'I am more than pleased with this wig! Considering the price you\'re paying for the amount of hair on this is amazing! I wasn\'t expecting it to be super thick and heavy. This is my first lace front wig so I wasn\'t sure how to make the lace disappear and look less noticeable. Somehow I made it work with the help of wig glue and hair clips.<br /><br />The good thing about lace front wigs is that it is more natural looking as opposed to a wig without it. The other thing that makes this wig worth buying is how soft the hair is! I\'ve worn it a bunch of times outside and people thought it was my actual hair!! One girl was even surprised when she saw me again! I have a grown out pixie cut so when she saw my real hair, she thought I cut all of my hair off!<br /><br />Pros:<br />- natural looking hair part<br />- soft and silky hair<br />- super long hair, very heavy<br />- looks exactly like the photo<br />- wig cap fits my head perfectly with a little bit of extra &#34;wiggle&#34; room<br />- shipping was quick<br />- great price for this high quality wig<br />- packaging was good. Wrapped in a standard netting to protect hair, which was placed in a nice plastic bag. Came with a free wig cap and compact black hair brush<br /><br />Cons:<br />- wearing a wig cap for this wig (or any wig) gives me headaches. If that\'s an issue for you, just keep that in mind.<br /><br />* Note: I forgot to take photos when it first received it. I apologize for that...',B01EY483RE,AHMAU3XLGJOZD6L7I2E6XTMNF5ZQ
