5,'I can\'t say for sure that this changed my life, but I can tell you:<br />I suffered from intestinal issues for years. I\'ve went on antibiotics several times lately and ended up getting a nasty side effect called C. diff. After going on a 2nd bout of an antibiotic to get rid of the C. diff I decided to try this to add the good bacteria back in to my gut. At the end of the regimen I was completely without intestinal issues. Did it reseed the bacteria I needed and make it all better? Could be. If I did not have the antibiotic as well, I would say yes for sure, but I can not rule out the possibility that the antibiotic did the trick - or the combo.<br /><br />I can now eat wheat, corn, and other starches/grains I could not eat before.<br /><br />If I have any further intestinal issue crop up, I will not hesitate to try this item first and alone. If so, I will update at that time.',B016VETP68,AEIAFGS3S7BXXE2BD3DIVD6BS35A
