5,'I looked at a lot of supplements prior to this one but the Vitpro supplement seemed to have the best ingredient list and the most reasonable cost. The bottle arrived double sealed and with 180 capsules that are average in size. The suggested serving is 3 capsules which provides 60 servings per container at that level. I had no unwanted side effects from taking this supplement. I would suggest starting with a single capsule and working your way up to the suggested serving size to ensure that it doesn\'t cause any issues for you. I had a great workout and I believe that the quality ingredients will help with stamina, endurance and energy. I can\'t say that it affected my libido but I wasn\'t having any issues in that department previously so I probably wouldn\'t notice any difference. There are many of these types of supplements that include \"proprietary blends\" or other unnecessary ingredients and this supplement was one of the few that didn\'t which I liked. I would definitely recommend this supplement.',B0933GTHMJ,AHAS7NULKULTXUJBAFC4HKPRQPJQ
