4,'Having sensitive ears can be embarassing. Loud and high pitched noises cause pressure and a loud ringing in my ears. I originally bought these DownBeats for concerts because I needed a reusable pair of ear plugs. My only one complaint is that they are so comfortable that sometimes they fall out without me noticing! I wish they had a chord to connect them, however I also like how discreet they are. When I am at the bar or at a friends house where they are playing loud music, I pop these in without anyone noticing and never have to worry about complaining about the music being too loud. I clipped mine to my purse and use the at least once a week at the bar, movies, and concerts. Cleaning is very simple, you can unfold the plugs and simply wash them with water.',B00A3Z44RW,AFTPFBAU5NBMM5ABQSLGLPF3PC4A
