4,'We have a brushed stainless steel refrigerator and have tried a couple of stainless cleaners but were unfailingly displeased with the results - fingerprints cleaned off but oodles and oodles of streaks left, always. We have 4 kids under 12 so our appliances, especially the refrigerator, have layers of fingerprints. Apprehensively, I followed the instructions and sprayed it on a cloth, wiped it on the fridge and buffed it off - with pleasing results! There were some streaks left to be buffed out, but not as many as other products tried. While not ecstatic, I decided to continue using the product.<br /><br />A few Saturdays later, I came across the cleaner again while digging through products for my least favorite chore, the bathroom. I recalled our faucets are shiny stainless steel and we have some exposed pipes that get pretty gnarly looking, so I and grabbed the bottle. I sprayed it on a rag, rubbed the stainless and was astonished! I could see my reflection perfectly in the shining faucet! I used it all over the bathroom and soon every faucet and pipe shone as never before! I was ecstatic and will use this product from now on.<br /><br />Summary:  4 of 5 for brushed steel appliances and 5 out of 5 for shiny stainless steel.',B016UFYJUK,AG6LG2GIB4VRT4DPMQS4XSRU6NDQ
