5,'I ordered these to try because I was going to be attending a hard rock concert. I used them recently and actually forgot I had them with me until the first of 3 bands started up and I was just a few feet from the stage and all the sound equipment. I quickly popped them in and noticed a much improved sound. You can still hear everything clearly, just without all of the excess. All of the guitars, drums, vocals etc were very clear, in fact, I could even pick up some of the stage conversations. I\'ve only ever really used ear plugs designed for industry or gunfire prior and those seem to muffle everything.<br />My only problem is that the stem is kind of short and when you have large fingers it\'s a bit challenging to get them back out but it\'s only a slight problem that wouldn\'t stop me from using them again.<br />As soon as the show was over, I removed and had no ringing or anything like that. I have never used ear plugs for concerts before and always suffered the ringing ears for hrs to days later.<br />Also, the little screw case is cool to keep them stored when not using them.',B00A3Z44RW,AGU4EJOPE5BXL7IRCKQ7X3ALAKTQ
