5,'I bought this product to help stick my CGM and insulin infusion set to my body as I have VERY sensitive skin when it comes to adhesive.  This product works great!  I make a 3-4 inch circle of the film on my body before attaching the equipment, let it dry a few moments, attach the CGM and insulin infusion set, and it stays until the next time I have to change them out.  Even though I applied the Bard Protective Film beyond the area where the equipment would go it was not sticky on my skin and after the first shower the stick under the equipment held tight and the film where I\'d over-wiped was clear of the film.  This product holds beautifully and I don\'t have to worry that anything will come off from my skin until I need it to.  It also protects my skin from the adhesive very, very well!<br />I tried purchasing something else when this box ran out, Skin-TacTM Adhesive wipe, and it was far too sticky, left residue on my skin around the equipment and required some additional non-sticking solutions to get all of the wipe off which has not happened with the Bard!  Even if Amazon PRIME does not cover the Bard Protective Barrier Film the next time I need more I will still buy the Bard!  It is the best product I\'ve tried yet!',B0006UOMN0,AG2FN4LVFTJ523IUHAXDQIQGZMNA
