5,'We purchased the Germ Guardian GG-1000 UV-C Air Sanitizer when we moved into a place that had a very poorly ventilated powder room. The smells really lingered. Being in there was very unpleasant and I knew that I could not expose any visitors to that. I did research on line and chose Germ Guardian.<br />I liked the design, the simplicity, the efficiency of the bulb and the ease of replacing it. The reviews were fairly good and the price not outrageous.<br />I must say that the product exceeded our expectations. It sits tightly on the outlet, has a pleasing shape and a sleek look, but most importantly it does the job well. The powder room (which is around 20 sq.feet) is smell-free. The little device does not work instantly, but it works quickly enough. I have no more concerns about letting people in or walking in myself. We\'ve had it for two months, so we haven\'t had to replace the bulb yet. I don\'t know exactly when it will burn out, but it doesn\'t matter much, since the product has already won us over.',B000G2BESO,AFLUZUDOJGRU2F6GAWH3LZKRYUYQ
