5,'Hello everyone! I started using this powder 2 months ago. I knew from the reviews and previous experience with other herbal protocols dues to Lyme, Babesia, Bartonella, etc...to go super slow.<br /><br />I only use a fraction of the scoop and use every 2-3 days. That alone makes me Herx a bit which means it\'s working. I\'ve been able to tolerate it and hoping to be able to use it daily.<br /><br />Pros:<br /><br />Has every herb in this one powder that my naturopathic doctor wanted me to take. Also I know that all the herbs listed is also in Stephen Buhner\'s protocol to help with not just Lyme but various co infections.<br /><br />Saves money and time. Instead of purchasing each herb individually to use, it\'s all compacted into one powder and I just have to take it so far once every other day. I\'m on a tight budget so this is a winner.<br /><br />You feel this powder crossing the blood-brain barrier. So if you feel any tingling sensations or something like that within your head after taking this powder, it\'s okay, that means it\'s really working and helping out your CNS. Good for Neuro Lyme & Neuro Co-infections.<br /><br />I have more energy (huge win)!<br /><br />Cons:<br /><br />It\'s not so much a con but those in the world of Lyme disease know that unfortunately some of us herx when taking certain products or treatments. Praying that this will pass soon and that I could just start to feel better altogether.<br /><br />I detox a great deal and also use a binder to get the toxins out, all the dead bacteria that might be floating around inside my body, biofilms and all that nasty stuff. This is super important to find a good detox protocol and binder.<br /><br />I\'m going to continue using this and want to come back in a few months and share with all of you how I\'m doing. I\'m down to working on the last few symptoms of Lyme disease and co-infections after being diagnosed 9 years ago. I do have CNS Lyme and trying to see if a co-infection or two also impacted my brain.<br /><br />Praying that I could be in remission soon and that this powder could really help me get through the finish line.',B01LYRQC8H,AEORLUG3IO4TTDXG4XIXWNSF7G3A
5,'I wanted something to soak my feet in that was easy to carry from the sink and not spill it. My feet fit in it perfectly.',B002XBV78S,AE5ALMQT4QNTKSQBIC2ZGGWS2EOA
5,'At first I ordered one package because I didn’t believe the reviews. I put on one application and I think I put on too much, 15 minutes later it was burning. Read the directions before you put it on. Let’s just say when I got the right amount to put on, I went at it for a whole hour. My gf couldn’t believe it. I never reveal my secrets so I didn’t say anything but she had a smile on her face the whole day and that’s all I needed to see. This stuff works, just don’t put too much. I liked it so much I bought two more packages.<br />My directions, put less than a matchstick head amount of every hour for 3 hours before the encounter. Felt some slight tingling/numbing. Took a shower before in case there was residue left behind. Then go to town! I’ve said all I need to say. Thank you!<br />Do experiment with it some before you use it cause the first time I overused and it was burning for a few hours! Had to put my thing in ice water.',B084RQZMB9,AFFJ7MYVJMQ4RT2A4LDUONGO6NEQ
