5,'I have been a bit of a gym rat for most of my life, and have concentrated of muscular development.  Why do I mention this?  Well because, that also means I\'m not as flexible as say a Yogi, or gymnast.  yes I struggle to wash my own back in the shower, because I simply can\'t reach all of it.  I wanted to try this silicone back scrubber for exactly that reason.  I have used others in the past, that are like that loofa or poof material (not exactly sure what you call it but I think you know what I mean), and they are fine, but eventually fall apart.  They also take longer to dry, so I was happy to find a silicone one.  It stretches well, and allows me to do as I intended to do with it, which is wash my whole back. The handles are a nice touch, and I always like the feel of silicone, as it gives a nice little back scratch too, if you add tension to it.  If you are like me, and not flexible, then this is right for you to get those problem areas that are out of reach.  Works well so far, I just hope it lasts long too.',B08G4SCJJK,AE5ESL52LWWBJTSFOAXSFZA3XCGQ
