4,'I\'ve bought a few of these, and a couple for other people. I love the carrying case and the comfort of these. They don\'t drown out all noise, but they muffle it a lot. I keep on my keychain and they have saved my ears (and my daughter\'s) on multiple occasions. She uses them while in class when she needs to concentrate on her work. They are small, don\'t bring attention, and super portable.<br /><br />The one thing that needs to change is that the rubber seal (o-ring) tends to fall out. It\'s fallen out on two of the products I\'ve bought, so the lid doesn\'t stay on and you have the possibility of losing the little ear protectors.',B00ODE0IDS,AEN6Z3P6WKBPTO6M5N3AGVHHE3CA
