4,'I always put insoles into all of my shoes, and was in search of another pair for some work boots that I like to wear in the winter time. Beyond the arch support and the extra comfort level, I do like the fact that it allows for more of a snug fit with larger boots. I was very pleased with these, and found that they slipped pretty easily into my boots, and didn\'t require any trimming. I would say that they\'re pretty true to size, if not perhaps a little on the small side of things. For me that\'s not really an issue in my case, as I sort of lucked out ordering a half size larger being that I take a 10 and a half. So the 11 fit properly into my shoe without any adjustment. I found them to be quite comfortable for prolonged use, and like I mentioned I put them in a pair of work boots which made those boots far more comfortable to wear all day long. If you\'re somebody who needs strong arch support, I would say that these are not your best option, however they do provide some level of support that was adequate for my needs. I found the cushioning to be quite comfortable, and provides relief to the bottom of my feet for long periods of time. All in all, I\'m very pleased with them and happy to have them in my work boots.',B0989GJ4HB,AE5ESL52LWWBJTSFOAXSFZA3XCGQ
