5,'[[VIDEOID:be1c2a93090ee7563009f0410466e3bd]] The memory foam is firm, supportive and contours to the body. It bounces back to its original shape in seconds once you remove the pressure. This is advertised as a foot rest but it is multi use for me. It can be used to support neck, back and to elevate legs and knees. I am using this on the couch to support my lower back when I sit down. The velvet cover is removable and washable. The foam has no chemical smell to it so I didn\'t need to air it out before using it. I left the room for a few minutes and when I got back I found my Shih Tzu sleeping on it. I don\'t blame him, it is a comfortable pillow.',B08PG563FP,AGTGHYRTZXKX4AIL42A3FKWR7SOQ
