5,'I am really in love with this Tunne guitar foot rest. I love that when I opened the product it was very small. This is helpful because it is easy to pack in my bag when I am playing somewhere other then home. The last thing I want to do is lug around more equipment and weight. I found that even though it is a very small foot rest it is a very sturdy product and can hold considerable weight. I love the 4 different angles this product can be adjusted a I had a foot rest in the past that only did 2. Having more options helps me find the perfect angle to avoid leg cramping and pain after playing for extended periods of time. I love it and I would definitely recommend this to anyone needing a foot rest. I am very fortunate to have received this product for free to test and review with my honest opinion. I definitely found a winner.',B01CYVREMO,AGUVAVCDZDCTYQFBEUYMJ6KZ332A
