4,'I received 4 boxes of \"Tea Herbal Cigarettes\". Each pack contains 20 cigarettes.<br /><br />These \"Tea Herbal Cigarettes\" come in uniquely decorated boxes. They also look like \"regular\" cigarettes.<br /><br />I don\'t smoke but my boyfriend does. He has been a heavy smoker since his early teens (over 30 years now).<br /><br />He has tried \"Herbal\" cigarettes before and liked them. So, I thought he would like to try these.<br /><br />They look pretty much like any other cigarette but have a faint Tea scent.<br /><br />He said he did like these Herbal cigarettes. That they don\'t make him cough like regular cigarettes do. They have a smooth taste and that they don\'t give off alot of actual smoke.<br /><br />That he would smoke them again except they cost more then his normal brand of cigarettes.',B0B1QTK9QV,AGSQN7QVGI3VRJO4LX6F5E63QJIA
