5,'I love this face brush, it works really well.  I\'ve always had oily skin.  Today, I received this and went right to using it.  You should use a gentle face cleaner, because as I\'ve stated, it REALLY WORKS.  I could feel the difference afterwards, and my face now has a glow.  I will be looking into a moisturizer, now that I know how effective this is.  With all the oil in my skin, I didn\'t think I\'d need one, but I was wrong.  I\'m so happy I chose the right brush.',B00RTFT08W,AGPTNOFYJNV55PVEGIEVRQRNYMEA
5,'Firstly be careful with this thing. Even sort exposure to UVC can cause harm to eyes and skin, and this lamp undoubtedly makes ozone, which is excellent for neutralizing odors and killing mold, but an irritant for people and animals.<br /><br />Second, this thing works. I purchased a test card which confirms this does make UV light. So far, I have used this in my closet, two bathrooms, and a few trash cans, and it’s effect is without question. Both bathrooms had a slight bit of mold mainly in tile grout, which this knocked out. The musty smell from the closet is completely gone. I’m currently doing my outdoor trash can which was in bad shape and I paused it, opened the lid and after about 29 minutes the black sludge has all turned grey. There was a significant amount of smoke coming from the can, so much so I though I had somehow started a fire. For the price, this lamp is no joke and gets the job done. I will not use it frequently, but when I do, I will set the timer and leave the house for a few hours. When I come back I will do so with confidence that the room is as near sterile as I could imagine wanting.',B08947W9NB,AHZXB4KDVCRMQNZOFGOECCDKPQGA
