5,'I have been making my own supplements for about a year now. I’ve used a couple different brands of capsules and capsule making machines. These Capsarior capsules are some of the best I’ve tried. Other brands seem to be weaker than these. If you look at the pictures I uploaded, only 1 out of 100 capsules didn’t close well. Another review said there was warping and that was probably due to excessive heat. If they were left in the mailbox baking in the sun, then the capsules probably melted a bit. I try and order them so they arrive on a day when I’m home. This is a problem with all capsules though, not just this brand. The best thing about these capsules is that they are already separated which saves TONS of time! I also really like that they are enclosed in zip-lock bags. After making my supplements, I just zip up the bags for easy storage. Overall, I highly recommend these Capsarior capsules as well as their machines.',B07PD9KCZT,AECA6R4Z56R2LIAQZOR63COCOZDQ
