5,'I am over 50 and have a wide variety of medical issues from Type 2 Diabetes to Carpal Tunnel to Menopause. I started taking Multi-Mushroom Complex about a month ago for several reasons. Of course, with Covid out there, I was concerned with my compromised immune system, but also, I had confusion, mental fog, moodiness and chronic pain. I had investigated a wide variety of individual mushroom supplements and found that Multi-Mushroom Complex contained all the mushroom supplement types I was interested in. The results I have gotten were not instantaneous, but I did notice subtle improvements in my mood, mental clarity and inflammation based morning pain. The longer I have taken the supplement, the more improvement I have seen. The only thing that I can say negatively about the product is the size of the capsule, but taking it prior to eating a snack made it easier to get the capsule down.',B07MX4TSWS,AFQ5EN2JE62XAWSDLNVNIC3GI2NA
5,'My GI usually feel stiff and bloated; I had flatulence and my belly looked like I was 8 months pregnant. After I did some research on the causes, natural remedies, and lifestyle changes that I needed to make, I decided to include probiotics in my daily supplements. I did my homework on probiotics because there are so many on the market and some of the claims are untrue. I decided this was the product I was going to try based on the reviews/comments on Amazon. Oh, was I pleasantly surprised!!!! The flatulence, bloating, and stiffness disappeared!!! I have been using this product since my first purchase in 2017 and will not stop. My belly has not gone as flat as I\'d like because I am not exercising like I should due to health reasons and my schedule, but there is a noticeable difference.<br /><br />I received the wrong product for my order earlier this month. Immediately after opening the container I realized it was not the product I ordered so I contacted the seller via email by way of Amazon. I received a response in less than 24 hours and the error was corrected immediately. The product I ordered was shipped express mail the very day I received  the response to my email and I received it within 2 days as promised.<br /><br />Thank you Richard for the excellent customer service you provided me. Your customer service is # 1 !!!',B01CX92L02,AGRTA7UWMY653E4M25I5UHXDEJ4Q
