1,'I just purchased this product and it\'s very misleading.  The seller clearly states that there\'s no soy in the product:<br /><br />CONTAINS NO: Artificial coloring, artificial flavor, preservatives, yeast, corn, milk or milk derivatives, lactose, salt, sodium, soy, sugar, gluten, starch or wheat.<br /><br />However, this product contains soy as clearly stated on the ingredients, which by the way there\'s no picture of.  Usually sellers have a picture of all sides of the bottle so that you can read the ingredients for yourself.  I had previously purchased a brand of phosphatidylserine that had soy and I stopped taking it and wanted to find one that didn\'t contain soy but had a higher dose.<br /><br />I thought that this product was the solution, especially since the seller clearly states that it has no soy, even though that\'s a lie.  Anyone who has allergies to soy please be warned that this product does in fact contain soy.',B00DG92RL2,AFT6SBKTTWAAFWNEHG53UCMSMS5A
