5,'Wow! This stuff is awesome! It really does kill weeds in less than 24 hours! I followed the advice/directions from a few other reviews on how to use it and what precautions to take. I bought a 1 gallon chapin law and garden sprayer (here on Amazon) for around $12 to use with this vinegar product. The chapin sprayer worked great. I used this vinegar product at full strength (like other reviewers said to do). I wore those big yellow rubber kitchen gloves, eye goggle protection and a heavy duty mask. I did all that just because some reviewers said it is very strong smelling and could burn eyes. Also, another review said it could burn your skin, so that is why I wore the gloves. I was very careful and cautious while pouring the vinegar into the chapin sprayer. I didn\'t spill any or get any on my gloved hands at all. And yes, it is a very strong smell to this. I sprayed the weeds. Wow! It has not even been 24 hours and they are wilted, drying up and dying! Wow!',B08NPN1PG3,AGYH4MMTCADVPV3NIRPTV7VDMFCQ
