3,'Who knows. My macular degeneration is getting worse. Perhaps it would be even more worse without this supplement. Who knows?  Will I keep taking it? Yes I will. So maybe you\'d like to know why I\'m going to keep taking a supplement that may or may not be working. Well, I\'ll answer that question with this question. It\'s macular degeneration, do you have a better idea?<br /><br />As far as noticing a difference the very day you start taking it as some claim, that\'s rather ridiculous and might best be viewed as someone\'s wildly positive over active imagination. If you have eye issues, just try it for yourself for a good 3 to 6 months and make your own best decision.',B001BM64P6,AGK6HN5OEX74OFJHBAOHDUMZQY5A
