5,'I love this balm. It\'s essentially CareCera\'s proprietary blend of ceramides suspended in what they describe as \'soft, melty, high purity\' petrolatum jelly. I use this nightly as my eyecream. And I have used it as emergency repair balm when I eff up my face with the sun, or wind, or cleansers or whatever is upsetting my skin at any given point. It has gotten rid of severely dry, rough skin on my face either overnight or in 2-3 days.<br />This actually melts into your skin if you have the patience to work out the quantity (SMALL! if you actually intend for it to sink in) and the time to massage it in.<br /><br />I\'ll never be without it. Been using it daily for 6months and I\'ve used maybe 1/4of the tin, if not less. Godsend.',B0141ZOFZK,AG6XSBMDIIFQ24RLQEAHJFKHLCAQ
