5,'This straightener is first of all bedazzled. It is sparkly and brings a smile to my face and the turquoise is very pretty. This straightener is really compact and can get small. It would be perfect for travel or just to keep in a purse to touch up your hair. Even to keep in my car for emergencies. On the inside of the straightener is the on button. I wish it was on the outside, but because of its size it has to go somewhere. I just unplug to turn off imstead of reaching my hand in between two hot plates. Basically turn it on and plug it in. I got this as a sample and it has made a huge difference to smooth away flyaways. I have straightened my hair to offset my cowlick and so to give my hair loose curls. It\'s small in my hand and creates a beautiful curl. The ceramic heats up easily, and smoothly heats my hair to straighten or curl. The cord is long enough to have wiggle room. It makes my hair look good and I enjoy using it.',B078J8Q682,AFXESCJXGBCDEWWANTSXSLZDGCHA
