5,'I don\'t write a lot of reviews even when I\'m happy with a product, but this basket\'s exceptional design warrants a review!  Broke my ankle and am using a knee scooter. I looked at a few baskets, and this one stood out because the basket can be easily removed. I thought it couldn\'t hurt to have more flexibility, and after using it can give you one simple reason why this feature is super helpful--getting stuff done in the kitchen!  When I\'m doing things like putting dishes away, removing the basket allows me to get 8 inches closer to the cabinets. I hadn\'t considered this use case when I picked the basket, and it turned out to be a pleasant surprise.<br /><br />The basket holds just enough. I put a washcloth in the bottom to create a soft landing pad for items. Easily fits my laptop, phone, and water bottle. The basket has never seemed like it was about to fall off.<br /><br />Install is super easy as well.  It came with some extra shims and allen wrench. Install below the handle adjustment knob and scoot on!',B00UB1HHY0,AGENVZEVFPWJYFQCXIHO2EHEQJLQ
