5,'So I\'ve been using a nice Norelco for quite a while, but why not have a back up/travel unit?  Well, this may have actually replaced that one.  The battery already came at 99\%, which is always nice.  By the time I was done with my shave it was at 97\%.  The cut was very close and everything seems to work perfect.  I did not use the trimmer attachment as I have a separate trimmer that I use.  I\'m honestly starting to think that you do not need to spend $100+ on a razor.  Ill update my review if it craps out, but I\'ve yet to have a razor go bad on me.  I usually change them as opposed to buying new razors for them.  Recommended.',B09T34JMCB,AE7XJLKV3YNGZ35KZJHGSVXHITFQ
