1,'I found out about this product from a video advertisement on the internet. According to the video, drinking this stuff once a day before 10 AM was supposed to start melting away body fat in the first week. I\'ve been dieting and exercising up to this point (I eat one meal a day-usually a salad and a protein) and walk between 5-10 miles along with using free weights to tone. I haven\'t lost an ounce in 3 weeks of using this product nor have I lost any body fat. My clothing still fits me the same way. At my age, I should know better than to buy into the hype about a product. There is no magic pill folks. Save your money. Shame on me for being duped once again and shame on the people who have promoted this product for giving false hope to people who are desperately trying to lose weight.',B08Y16LSK3,AHJOD3KSO3QO4ROADJTIUY2V2FVQ
