1,'There are lots of reviews are out there that state that their hair started falling out when they started using this product... I honestly thought those people were nuts... but, the first time I used Wen, I went on a date about an hour later. I was shedding so bad- my hair was everywhere- even falling in the food. I thought maybe it was just normal shedding from washing my hair, but for some reason it must not have come out in the shower like normal. I continued to use the product for about a week and a half. My hair was very frizzy and the shedding became worse and worse. I don\'t know what more to say, except I stopped using it and went back to DevaCare, which I love. It works better, is a non-lathering silicone, paraban-free formula, my hair is smooth and never frizzy with Devacare and my hair doesn\'t fall out anymore than the normal shedding I experience when brushing or combing my hair. The only reason I wanted to try Wen was for a different scent, but now I think Wen is overpriced, doesn\'t leave the hair as smooth as similar products... and it really does increase hair shedding dramatically. I was skeptical, but I will not use this product.',B00IXX8YMM,AE3PI5K6CAO6IHKPYBJLNH2BTRNQ
