5,'I bought this as a birthday gift for my dad, who twice a week drives 8 hours in one direction for his job. He is someone who works a very physical job and he is aging. He isn’t a complainer, but I know that the drives aren’t as easy as they were when he was 20. This week he used this cushion for the first time and this is what he texted me: “That purple seat cushion is perfect! Normally as my drive progresses I have to shift my body weight and keep adjusting the seat so that my butt doesn’t hurt. Today.... I didn’t have to shift my weight or adjust the seat at all. That thing is amazing, thank you!” So that said, I would happily recommend this to anyone, especially those who frequently make long drives',B01CKMP34S,AF4OLNOGS4YLB2EX6L3JF6JNJYQA
