5,'I\'d never heard of this brand, but I was intrigued by the \"clean\" ingredients and non-toxic \"safe for kids\" claims. With my little one eating solids now, and being messy at that, I\'m constantly cleaning up everywhere. Even places I don\'t even think to look. This does not have a strong scent at all. In fact, I shook it to make sure it wasn\'t just water with a nice label on the bottle. ;-P It is very light scented but this stuff works so well. It has cleaned up some dried up messes. You don\'t get a soapy residue, it wipes off clear. I was using it for our high chair, and now I\'m using it everywhere, including her play areas and our kitchen!<br /><br />I feel confident that this stuff is actually disinfecting everything. Highly recommend and the price at $7.95 is very fair, in my opinion, compared to the other chemical ridden stuff I used to buy.',B086QB1ZKV,AGFFCGQTNV2DUYSKVMV3QMI7MJXQ
