5,'I love it. I especially enjoyed that it came with multiple parts including the soft silicon nozzles. All pieces are easy to clean and the stop clamp/ stop cock valve works exceptionally well. There’s visual instructions on the box as well as instructions inside the box however the instructions inside were pretty vague. I had to visit the my order again to get more details. I had never done an enema before and did not know what to expect my first time and it was easier than I thought it would be. I definitely recommend this especially if you are just starting out with “cleansing yourself”. I ordered it because it seemed cost effective than the others and had an adequate amount of equipment for a beginner. This was definitely a wise investment and it even has a cool handy bag to store when not in use.',B07FKQXS1X,AHLKFB463UXPCEAYZKMQN7OY6M2Q
