1,'This is basically useless due to the auto shutoff feature this will barely warm up your toys due to it shutting down automatically at such a low temperature for far to long and way to often.<br /><br />Highly recommend you do not buy this out of all the onahole warmers I have bought this is by far the weakest and most useless one simply cannot heat any toy up to a nice toasty hot temperature that actually last for a good while matter how long you leave It plugged in even putting two inside one toy won\'t do it works better then one but where near as well as the usual non auto shutoff onahole warmer.<br /><br />Get a rends or a dmm warmer instead leave those in a well lubricated toy for a good while say 20-30 minutes and you can actually have a decently long lasting hot onahole to use careful not to leave it to long though or you risk melting your toys texture to be smooth as well as giving you burns where you really don\'t want one.',B085B5F35J,AE7FQIPNTENCCNRZCZU47LNFJQCA
