1,'I\'ll try and keep this from becoming a long-winded rant...<br /><br />So I recently took up straight razor shaving and in no time it has become hobby of which I am quite passionate.  And most any wet shaver quickly learns that the brush & lather are crucial components to the experience as a whole.<br /><br />I received this brush as a gift and was incredibly excited to start using it.  Unfortunately, it hadnt yet served me through its first shave before I noticed that it was not performing even as well as the boar brush I had picked up in a ten dollar boxed set from CVS.  In short; with the Latherwhip brush, creating the lather was no more than a choir.  It wasn\'t until I had finally finished and was rinsing the brush clean that I noticed the large tangle that had formed in the center of the knot.<br /><br />One of the great things about wet shaving is that quality tools last a lifetime.  I don\'t know what was more disappointing, the poor shave I experienced after receiving the brush as a gift, or the dashed expectations after realizing that I wouldn\'t want to use this brush more than once.',B00QFXVOL0,AHD24Y5AN2QPVG5CY2C4Q4IDGMJA
5,'This is an amazing product!  It runs for all day long in my bed and helps me to relaxed all day.',B01LXCNLCX,AGXM7V7NZOA5HWDCNENJTDBATD4Q
4,'After using this product for a week, it turns out that it\'s a pretty good deal after all. This oral flusher is excellent when you employ the correct dexterity in its use. To be more succinct, it just takes a little time to master the procedure for perfect flushing. Once you fill the reservoir ( you can even mix in a bit of mouthwash too), you press the on button and get it right in position and start flushing. This writer found that once on, I immediately click the lower button two times to get it on lowest pressure, and then I do the upper teeth quickly because the reservoir runs out quickly. I then refill and do the same for the bottom teeth. It took a bit of time to get used to quickly using it, but a little practice will have you liking it more and more and, in between your teeth will be extremely clean.',B01MTVAOAH,AEZOJVS2BKWCHTHA2NB4OUART7AQ
