5,'I do my own manicure and pedicure for over twenty years. I had some good tools but for the last several years I have been looking for a great quality manicure/pedicure set. Yes, you can find limited separate pieces of one or two good quality makers at beauty stores but that\'s about it. I was so glad when after another on line search I discovered the seller. Before I bought my set I did an extensive research on GERmanikure including the seller\'s website. When I received and used GERManikure set I knew right away I made the right choice. The set comes with both great quality and with a great low price. Believe me, for as many as eight pieces of top quality and a genuine leather case you get the price is Great. Each piece felt very comfortable in hands. The cuticle nippers are the best I had and the pusher felt so soft as if it was not made from metal. If you listen to videos on seller\'s website everything they said about the pieces I received was correct :)  And one more thing I wanted share. My mom needed some help with her ingrown nail, so I had three necessary tools for that right away: stainless steel nail nipper, nail cleaner that can be easily used as a lifter and larger scissors. Thank you so much for brining here wondeful products made in Solingen, Germany. IB',B01M8MDQVI,AFM6PH2CHW36DUOPOZ5354LP4DSQ
