5,'This supply is enough for a month, which makes a good price considering it\'s vegan. The pills are LARGE, and while most multivitamins are, these seem to be even larger than the ones I usually take. So if you have problems swallowing, this could be an issue. They also have a very strong smell, might be due to them being vegan. Since you don\'t chew this, the smell is easy to overlook. I didn\'t experience any upset stomach problems which is my first concern when taking supplements since if they upset my stomach, I\'m not going to take them.<br /><br />As far as how well they work, I have to go on faith until the next time my doctor does blood work which isn\'t until this fall. The best I can say is they provide all the vitamins and minerals my doctor has said I need, they are vegan and don\'t upset my stomach.',B075DLLC57,AHCRWHCVPY77C66P3BHYHU2V34QQ
