5,'I am so glad a reviewer of another product explained the many greater health & other benefits of finding a freeze-dried version which resulted in my finding this product as the ones produced by spray-drying require the addition of some maltodextrin to prevent it from caking.  Maltodextrin is made from corn starch & I like many people nowadays are allergic to corn products to varying degrees because they are so over-used in so many products including at low enough levels that they don\'t always have to be shown in the ingredients list.<br /><br />I HAD BEEN SCARED TO TRY THIS PRODUCT BECAUSE MANY REVIEWERS SAID it doesn\'t dissolve easily or can clump or tastes less sweet but none of this has been a problem for me.<br /><br />IT IS THE FIRST FORM OF VITAMIN C (of many types I\'ve tried over the years including all natural & food-based etc.) THAT I HAVE TAKEN THAT I TRULY LOVE & THAT DOESN\'T FEEL ACIDIC OR BAD IN ANY WAY FOR MY TEETH OR MOUTH. With every other form of C I have felt the need to immediately then chew on a piece of xylitol gum ([[ASIN:B00ARABK20 PUR Gum Aspartame Free, Spearmint, 2.8 Ounce]] works great & has the purest ingredients with the least chemicals or additives of any of the many xylitol gums I\'ve looked into) but not with this one.  Instead it feels totally wonderful to drink & I love its slightly tart taste as some fruits have as that makes it feel like eating a piece of fruit or some fruit pudding if I have to rush while mixing the product & end up with a small clump of it in my mouth.<br /><br />I FIND IT WORKS BEST TO ONLY USE 1/4 teaspoon at a time as then it\'s easy to sprinkle lightly over some room-temperature water which makes it easy & fast to dissolve simply by stirring with a teaspoon.  C is best absorbed anyway when taken in small doses through the day because your body can\'t store it & only so much can be used at a time with the rest being excreted in your urine.<br /><br />CHERRIES BRING SEVERAL KEY NUTRIENTS HELPFUL FOR ONE\'S EYES & GENERAL HEALTH SO THIS HAS BEEN AN OUTSTANDING PRODUCT TO DISCOVER IN EVERY WAY INCLUDING BECAUSE good organic cherries are often not available or very pricey.  ALSO, MOST FORMS OF C THESE DAYS ARE SYNTHETIC & THOSE HARM THE BENEFICIAL GUT BACTERIA CRITICAL TO MANY ASPECTS OF OUR HEALTH INCLUDING OUR IMMUNE SYSTEM & ABILITY TO ABSORB NUTRIENTS.',B011J478G4,AFIPVOCVLAVBFAXTQDKLPSN5ADOQ
5,'Immediately reduced the pain in my feet. I used the tea tree granules foot soak with it and it helped the pain in my feet and ankles tremendously. Easy to use, easy to clean',B07Y2YCF7R,AG67PHZBXF2MMT3E662E2E7JNLFQ
