2,'This brace is not helpful. I originally ordered a small, as recommended based on sizing, but it was way too small. I then exchanged it for the size up, while this one technically fits my leg/knee, the area behind the kneecap bunches up no matter what I do, and causes a pinching, painful effect. I also can\'t fit the brace over any clothes, not even thin leggings. This is insane because it is a size medium, and I am not large at all- I am 5\'3\'\' and about 120 lbs, so there\'s no reason I should need to order a size large just to be able to wear the brace over leggings. Lastly, it claims that the two medal side pieces can be removed if desired, this is not the case on mine. I have tried and tried to figure it out, but nothing comes apart whatsover. Overall, I had high expectations for this brace based on the price, but instead it causes me more pain. I have patellofemoral pain syndrome so I was hoping that this brace would assist me by stabilizing my patella, but it only causes pain and achiness, in addition to the pinching pain from where it bunches in the back. No help, at all!',B017CB6HZ6,AHKZV6DT3RRK7RQUPRARFNMYN5EA
