5,'We love this detox foot bath system. My whole family uses it.  There are several high end, very expensive models on the market but this one works just as well.  We have been doing detox foot baths for years at our chiropractor\'s office and he has one of those high end machines, he said it\'s several hundred to repair it. We had him look at this one and he was so impressed he bought one too for use at home.  You take in toxins every day and they interfere with your immune system and overall health.  I recommend doing this at least twice per week to help you flush many of those toxins out. My son has an autoimmune disorder and doesn\'t shed toxins easily, the color of his detox foot bath is nearly black by the time he\'s done.  He feels so much better afterward. Be sure to wash your feet in the shower after your soak as the toxins you shed will be on your skin afterward. If that is not possible for some reason then carry a small squirt bottle with melaleuca (tea tree) oil and water and spray your feet off. This will kill bacteria. Then wipe them clean with a towel.',B003U4ZKRQ,AGNFFZG4HFDEJN6RU3FGJ6XKJ7VA
