5,'This product is fantastic! I recently was sick with the flu for over 3 weeks and found myself unable to sleep for more than two hours at a time before having to run to the bathroom. I read about Crinum  on Swanson\'s website and knew I had to have it. I received the product and took it as recommended for eleven days and was surprised that I was now able to sleep the night through without any trips to the bathroom. It has been a little over a month now and I am still taking 2 pills twice per day with excellent results.  I would recommend this product to any man with prostate problems.',B00MQSNZ7E,AFK2XQNP4SHRCVPBE5XXREMPTW5Q
5,'After using eyeglass chains with rubber loops for several years, I came across this chain. I liked the idea so I purchased it. It\'s perfect! Because you attach it with alligator clips, it stays on no matter what, unlike the rubber hoops which stretch out over time and fall off the glasses. Since the clips are lightly padded on the inside, they don\'t harm your glasses. And not only is it functional, it\'s absolutely beautiful!<br /><br />After wearing it for two days, I had a problem with it, so I reached out to the sellers. They very promptly responded and addressed my concern to my complete satisfaction. So not only do they produce an outstanding product but they stand behind it 100\%. You simply can\'t go wrong with this purchase.',B01N08N4FD,AGHSYTGUHMOCTJ2VUVELSVGN464Q
5,'Love the taste mixed with water was perfect to help me drink a glass per day.',B092MJ6JKV,AFW3AANCVO3ES52RR6NH7VZ4JTFA
4,'I used to work at a cell phone company in corporate, and that was my first introduction to wipes of these types.  Prior to that job, I had no idea about these type of things, I just used alcohol and tissue.  These types are just moist enough, clean thoroughly, does not leave streaks and looks new after use.  That is what they advertised.<br /><br />Some complain that they are too small, but I had prior use with these types for eye glasses and cell phones - never for camera lenses or larger things.  However, I did use ONE on my 10 inch table and one was enough to get the job done.  I have a feeling that outside of my phone, the tablet may use these the most.  I am sure that someone makes larger ones some place.  I don\'t know how anyone can complain since these leave no streaks and no fibers!<br /><br />My only complaint would be that the box is too fancy and even heavy for the product type.  If they made a cheaper, more simple box, they could cut down on the cost.  I mention this because I was expecting one of those medical type boxes that you see alcohol wipes come in.  Ah well.',B08683VKC7,AFPPREVOZ3DVVH3Q7SJYUNEJHVAQ
