3,'I got this product for my overall health and brain fog. I think it\'s a legitimate product and the dosages are accurate. There are two things to know about this product though.<br /><br />1) A single serving consists of 2 capsules. That means that the 50 capsule version is 25 servings, the 120 capsule version is 60 servings, and so on.<br /><br />2) With that said, you can get the same or higher dose for cheaper. For example, the 120 capsule (60 serving) version costs $32.20 with this brand. You can buy a different curcumin product, like the Key Nutrition brand, with the exact same quantity of ingredients for $15.99 (that\'s the lowest I found it on Amazon, there are other brands cheaper than $32.20 here as well).<br /><br />Otherwise, it\'s a good product if you don\'t mind paying extra. I\'d ultimately recommend getting the most bang for your buck though. That\'s my personal preference.<br /><br />. Likewise with the $32.20 120 capsule version, it gives you $',B01MXQM1L0,AH577FMJ3UQ4B6THXD7ZSEAPVLKA
