2,'I bought these as glass nail files were recommended by a friend.  I don\'t know that I read the reviews on these particular ones, so it\'s a little bit my own fault here.  I had already looked at so many reviews and I saw the colors and nice case and thought &#34;Oh! Yes! Those ones!&#34;  I should have paused for one moment longer to read some other reviews as these files are much like many others have said....these are NOT etched glass, they simply have some kind of scratchy coating on TOP of the glass.  I used them once and was mildly impressed.  However, the second time I attempted to use them, the coating began coming off on THREE of the files.  It just wiped right off, especially in the line right along the edge, where most people\'s nails hit the file.  I\'m very disappointed.  I will now be getting a GERmanikur glass file set, in hopes that those will be wonderful.',B013PGDSUY,AEMMOAWT5L6YD4PNB6JXYED34JSQ
