4,'As we grow older, frequency in urinating becomes evident and a frustrating situation, especially when one is traveling.  I find carrying the Male spill-proof urinal in my vehicle allows me the opportunity to pull-over to the edge of the road, use the urinal descreatly, and continue my travels.  The contents remain in the urinal until I arrive at my destination and can empty it, and clean it properly.  I highly recommend this urinal, not only for a traveling companion, but also for use at home for anyone bed-ridden for whatever reason.  Being in the medical field, I can\'t tell you how many urinals were accidently spilled by patients and their care-givers.  This type of urinal prevents those accidents from happening.  I did note, however, that a miniscule amount remained in the outer receptive chamber, however, by using a kleenex one can readily eliminate the problem.',B000RZLUV6,AGGHGYDJP56NWYRMETLLWMCONDFQ
