4,'I suffer from chronic back pain and neck stiffness that is exacerbated by my truck driving career and I was looking for a heating pad and/or tens unit i could use on the truck to ease the pain.<br /><br />I want expecting to want to try a massager like this but when I saw that it also was heated and allows for targeted neck treatment, I decided to give it a try and I\'m glad I did.<br /><br />The massaging settings are nice and the straps that allow me to adjust the position and pressure on whatever area I need it most is pretty wonderful. The heat is nice, but doesn\'t get as hot as if like it to and seems to fade quickly. I figure it\'s a safety feature, but ultimately it\'s frustrating to me. It\'s also really bulky which makes it borderline impractical to take with me on the road as it takes up a lot of space.<br /><br />Overall, I am enjoying it for now and time will tell if I continue to reach for it.',B071LHKBLQ,AFRKXZPFM6VBKRBGJBYSJYSDVYJQ
