5,'Pure Creatine without any other weird ingredients,  cheap price, there is really nothing I can complain about! You get what you expected!<br />Also, Creatine is one of the supplements that has the must studies on, and no real research can proof that creatine do damage to your body, so if you are looking to optimize your workout performance, try to consume 2-3g every day to start with, and go to 5g everyday after a while! After about 3 weeks your body will have a good stable state of creatine! (There\'s really no need to cycle creatine, it does not give you a bad liver of kidney)<br /><br />I just received this product not long ago, but until now, there\'s no negative effect showing from the product, and I do hope this product works in the long term, and I will keep coming back and update my comment.<br /><br />Disclaimer: I received this product for a discounted price in exchange for my honest, unbiased review. I treat reviews seriously because the first thing I do before buying something on amazon is to read reviews, so I guarantee this review is my unbiased opinion about the product.',B00P1FC4CQ,AHLT6PVW7GF2C2ZUE32ZYJ7G6XDQ
4,'My hubs has sleep apnea and the machine tends to make his mustache hair stick up at odd angles, which greatly annoys him. He uses this heated curler to push the hairs back into place. The silcon wrapped curler protects his face, and it\'s easy to use/charge. He is happy with it, and would recommend.',B08GK5XP3S,AECRCC4YQHKE7ICKLZ3DU276XWDA
