5,'This gloves are perfect for dish washing or other household cleaning duties. They keep your hands protect nicely during all these duties we love so dearly, not. They are a good quality product that should stand up the test of time quite nicely, only time will tell. These gloves come with a cotton flocking that makes wearing them nice and comfortable and absorbs your sweat to some degree. Getting a pair of these for $10 is very good so I can recommend purchasing these for sure!',B07Y335YT3,AEZP6Z2C5AVQDZAJECQYZWQRNG3Q
