4,'Pros:<br />its pretty cool and worthy of 5 stars<br /><br />Cons to knock it down to 4 stars:<br /><br />1) you HAVE TO OWN A WIRELESS DEVICE to set this up.  Aka a smart phone or ipod etc.  You have to connect your device to the scales wifi port, tell it where your wifi name is, and disconnect.<br /><br />2) the white scale is pretty hard to read.  I have to bend all the way down to read my weight... and you only get like 10 secs to read it before it goes black.  It shows your weight exactly twice before it goes dark.  Im tone deaf.  If it beeps saying its done, I never notice it in the first cycle.<br /><br />3) you dont get the bodyfat readings and such until you log into fitbit and assign the scale to your account.  Then in a couple days you scale starts saying your BF\% and your initials.<br /><br />4) you can secretly monitor your roommates weight until they set themselves up on fitbit.com.  All guest weights are shown to the fitbit authorized owner.  Once you invite a friend, they sign up, and you point those guest weights to the friend, the friends weight is hidden for good.<br /><br />Pretty slick device.<br /><br />Wants:<br />network cable support<br />the timer when the scale goes dark to be longer or even configurable',B0077L8YFI,AESSO753LXHY2QFTE2T3YCJWJC6Q
5,'We bought this scale for our deer hunting camp cause we wanted an accurate scale to weigh our deer.  Someone has to have bragging rights and we wanted to make sure we were able to get it DEADLY close.  Easy setup, and a breeze to use.  We hook the u-bolt to a crank, put a rope around the neck of the deer and right onto the s-hook.  It\'s a SUPER bright LED screen, and you can read the weight from a good distance away.  There is no guessing.  Just push the power button on, and read the weight.  We used this a bunch during the last season and should continue to use this for years to come.  You have to be careful as it is plastic, but it seems to be the industry grade plastic which is super tough.  Our camp is very happy with this purchase.',B01N25OC6P,AGP5MPUX247GNWRMZMH2QP4W6WIQ
