5,'This heating pad is a bit different than typical ones in a couple of ways. First, it\'s weighted a little bit, but not too much. That helps the heating elements stay a little closer to the area you\'re applying heat to and makes it more effective. Second, the cord, at over 7 feet, is longer than most and gives some extra flexibility. The pad is very generously sized at 1x2 feet so it can soothe relatively large areas. The outer cover is a very soft, plush material that feels great against the skin. It\'s simple to operate  - press the Power button to turn it on and then click the Heat button to cycle through the 6 heat settings. The instructions say it turns off automatically after 2 hours. I wish the instructions said what temperatures each of the heat settings is, but it goes from quite low to more heat than I can stand. I like the 4th setting best. The pad heats up quickly and feels very soothing. I like it a lot and I recommend it.',B08H4BPPWF,AH52452NXXPKFMO66MPSF5NFNUHA
