5,'My wife has been plagued with rough feet for years.  She\'s tried all of the remedies.  The Ped Egg, the buffing sponge wands, the razor scrapers. None have ever been able to match the results of an expensive professional pedicure.  Even those provide short-lived results and it\'s just not always convenient to schedule one when her feet start to get rough again.<br />We purchased this unit not expecting miracles but were soon very impressed.  It only takes a few minutes per foot to completely remove the roughness.  The coarsest roller takes off the roughest skin very quickly.  A little time with the progressively finer rollers results in absolutely smooth skin rivalling even some of the best pedicures she\'s gotten.<br />The callus remover has two speeds which combined with the pressure that you apply allows you to easily control the rate of dead skin removal.  There is no discomfort during its use.<br />The only downside is the clouds of dust created during use, especially at the higher speed.  When the weather permits, we\'ll be using this outside on the deck.',B095PGGWX5,AECO2FAZOFST5FE7GZH5V5NZPDOA
