2,'Bought this item for mirror box therapy for stroke for my mother.  It was listed as \"non-returnable\".  It was more expensive than could be had elsewhere, but I decided to order it.  It is just a flimsy quad-fold plastic/paperish board and did not seem durable.  In addition, one of the folds was not aligned properly--it was mis-creased.  Since I could not return the product, I noted this defect in my feedback.  The seller contacted me and offered to refund $10 dollars, so I accepted.  Then they contacted me incessantly by phone and email asking me to remove my feedback.  So I did.<br /><br />The product may be OK, haven\'t used it enough to say it works or not, so I must reserve judgement.  But it doesn\'t seem durable--just a cardboard-like sheet with a quad-fold, with a mirror glued on--for $75.  Can\'t blame the seller for this--but it is not a good value.',B002C9GO3Y,AFKNJEWLR65L2JDKZXT4VPVRXFZA
