5,'We ordered this several months ago and have found it an excellent product.  My mother (age 86) has used both the white 5\% sodium chloride ointment and the opaque clear.  This white is FAR better.  Not only does it keep her eyes comfortable all night long, but after a week or so of nightly use, her eyes and the skin around them were so well moisturized that she did not need her Bausch and Laumb drops during the day any more!  It’s an amazing product.  We found the opaque clear version melted right out of her eyes.  The white ointment makes her vision blurry (that’s how she checks it is correctly in the eye), but by morning her vision is clear.  Sodium chloride 5\% ointment is recommended by the Mayo Clinic as treatment for dry eyes, which is how we found out about it. Highly recommended.',B01LWKMJ9V,AG76ZAJQBWDTUH2BNC2VGQPPZY3Q
