5,'So check out the shine on my sinks! I think that speaks for itself, but I will go on for a bit because I love this Power Cleanser and Polisher from The Crown Choice! It cleans to a streak free shine on both my stainless steel kitchen sink and my bathroom porcelain sink! It also removed some really old burned on stains from my enameled cast iron Dutch oven! Made in the USA, this Power Cleanser and Polisher cleans well and rinses easily and leaves behind a beautiful shine! It has the consistency of like a thinner soft scrub, but does not contain bleach and is septic safe. The reusable scrubbers that came with it are pretty awesome too! These sparkly scrubbers remind me of those bath poofs that allow for lots of soapy lather. I used them with dishsoap and they made tons of bubbles! They scrub well without scratching and rinse cleanly,  plus release food particles easily. I toss them in my washing machine inside a garment bag and they come out good as new! I love that I can wash and reuse these over and over and I am keeping junk out of the land fill! So happy I found The Crown Choice line of products! I have also tried their Lemon Zest Naturally Powerful Multi Cleaner,  check out that product as well. It left my granite countertops gleaming!',B091MCHW38,AEN2WH5WYKIJFO57R2KUNDDSJAAQ
