5,'This scale was purchased to replace an old School digital metal scale that we\'d had for decades.  Was not thrilled new ones are glass after all we are kinda big folks and standing on glass on plastic feet just seems idiotic...BUT we like the new scale very much and it is encased in metal makes us feel safer the glass is covered.  Its accurate so far.  It lights up and we can see it very well, large foot pad (most of our weight is in the belly area not legs but still).  We hit the little button on back to make it lbs and set foot on it for 3 sec\'s to set it to zero and works great on hard surface :)  Time will tell on how often batteries need replaced or charged depending what used.  Im used to the watch battery type this is not its aaa.  Anyway it got here in tip top shape and we like it a lot.',B073YBBBGF,AFJTLH4B66QBHAXLSRF6YFVG2JBA
