4,'I am bald and bearded and bought this to keep my bald area and neck smooth between old school shaving soap, brush, and blade.  :)<br /><br />Given that I\'m not now nor ever been an electric shaver guy, I was prepared for a less than stellar result.  But to my surprise this little rig does a very nice job although not unexpectedly it takes multiple passes.  No nicks or irritaion either. :)  For my purposes it fits the bill nicely. I certainly didn\'t need an upscale foil shaver from Braun or other major manufacturer.<br /><br />So why just 4 stars and not 5?  The little manual states that replacements accessories (e.g. foil head and cutter blades) should be replaced when worn and to \"go to the designated service point for\" them.  There are NO service centers listed in the pamphlet NOR have my two requests here on Amazon to identify where replacements could be purchased been answered.  I suppose that simply means that when the blades dull or foil rips this shaver is disposable.  I find that unacceptable.',B083DSJPQQ,AEIRRVSTU2BI7IO7ELTXV6UXITBA
