1,'When I read the reviews, so many people were saying how great these clippers were, so I bought them.  First thing I noticed was the plastic insert inside the flip handle looks cheap and the nail file is placed right in the center which makes it almost completely useless.  I began trying to cut my little toe nails with the smaller clipper and had trouble getting the edge under my nail, when I clipped it, it cut it shorter, way too short.  I have never cut my nails so inaccurately, as I\'m even a licensed manicurist and have cut many toe nails in my life.  When I compared the design of these next to a regular clipper, I could see the edge was at a different angle, thicker...sharp, but worthless to me.',B00PXKFT80,AGKJ2H45Y4GKFPOKEZAKMR3G7BUA
