1,'but I can not love something that was so unbelievably frustrating to use and then DID NOT WORK!!<br /><br />I have fairly long but super straight lashes. Every single day I would curl my lashes with a heated up eyelash curler and wear waterproof mascara. In the summer months, no matter how great they looked in the morning the heat and humidity would make them fall flat instantly! How excited was I to find out there was something called eyelash perming and that I could do it myself!!<br /><br />I quickly set out to find out how to do this and do it well!  Watched many videos and read all the reviews. Finally settled on this kit. It came with TONS of stuff! Everything I knew I would need and more! Watched a few more videos and get right down to perming my straight lashes! Oh my gosh was this a pain to use! I expected it to be hard to get my lashes glue on correctly from watching the videos and reading the reviews but this was ridiculous! The glue was awful! Gloppy and soooo hard to get to work (just as hard to remove the huge glops of glue when you\'re finished too by the way!)<br /><br />I persisted and managed to get the job done...Only problem...It didn\'t work! It curled some lashes slightly, others not at all making it way worse because I couldn\'t even get them to look good with my eyelash curler anymore!<br /><br />I assume it was user error, watched more videos, waited a week and tried again! Exact same result! I was doing everything exactly as directed and had done considerable research on this before starting so I was confident it was not something I was doing wrong at this point.<br /><br />Soooo, I ordered Dolly\'s Lash Lift kit (sold on Amazon for 49.99 but I found mine online elsewhere for ten dollars less). Dolly\'s worked beautifully! Everything about it is better!<br />-The silicone pads are more comfortable and easier to use.<br />-The glue was awesome! I had absolutely NO trouble gluing the pads to my lid or my lashes to the pad. It brushed on easily. Stuck to everything it was supposed to and nothing it wasn\'t. And it was super easy to get off too!<br />-The lotions are colored (pink for the perming lotion and blue for the other) making it really easy to make sure you\'ve got it on evenly<br />-It came with easy to follow instructions<br />-Most importantly...It worked!! My lashes look amazing! Curled perfectly. Got up this morning and threw on a little mascara and I was good to go for the day!<br /><br />I suppose it is possible that I just got a bad batch of this product. There is no expiration date on it...Maybe it was old and that\'s why it didn\'t work?? This kit did come with a lot of extras that the other, more expensive kit (Dolly\'s) didn\'t. Some of which I used with the Dolly perming kit. Some of which I\'m not even sure what the purpose is?? Not sure but I highly recommend checking out this one before buying!!  https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008RN1QQO/ref=cm_sw_r_cp_dp_T2_imctzb1MF94X2',B01DVXDREI,AHUE6EI4PHPVTSZPPJU675LFHYDQ
