1,'dimensions listed are rounded up quite a bit. in the photo added, this item is on the left & the item i was looking for a comparable to is on the right. roughly half size, although measurements on each listing are only slightly different. seems to be decent quality plastic (not ultra thin) & would likely travel well. if you have more than a few pills or vitamins to put in each unit: this probably isn\'t for you. if you only take maybe 2-5 pills/vitamins per unit, it would probably work just fine. in looking through other listings, i think the giveaway is the case... those that are of \'double thick\' material/close tight/don\'t pop open/are more substantial in every way - including size: all have the locking tab that flips up at the bottom (many also have a rubber gasket around the inside of the lid; not all). frustrates me most that this was priced the same as what i\'d paid for the nicer/bigger/better ones & in every way portrayed to be the same/similar to it+its comparables. some1 needs to measure a little more carefully or go with the smaller edges vs the larger edges.',B09793YVMX,AFSUY6QH2VSTE2GN5IMDFYAPJEXA
