5,'I contacted Okaysou Company as I had been very happy with my purchase of 3 8L Air Cleaners a year of so ago. One of the three had stopped working and the Company responded right away within Ine Day to my request for help. They asked me to sent them a video of my problem and they sent me a Replacement Brand new Air Cleaner at No Cost without any Issues at all. They were a pleasure to deal with and I would definitely do business with this Company again as they stand behind their products.<br />This Air Cleaner really cleans the air great and you can see the dirt on the cleanable washable pre-filter.<br />I would recommend this Air Cleaner as one of the best I have ever owned.',B0987H3N4V,AGXD7OGEA3JFLSJ4F4IWFRUWDR6A
