3,'I am a regular kava kava user and am familiar with the effects of a strong dose of kava. Two teaspoons mixed into a cup of water produce  the familiar numb mouth effect of a good variety of kava. I am disappointed with the addition of maltodextrin which is a serious down check for me. Maltodextrin can cause a spike in blood sugar especially for diabetics. Other than that the licorice flavor is a little off putting but tolerable once the effect sets in. I will not be reordering unless they can find an alternative carrier such as acacia fiber or inulin. If you can\'t tolerate the taste of regular kava and don\'t have a blood sugar problem this product may work for you.',B01M8L2O6G,AGWATTKJB5U4IGFP2DAP6TRPJOMQ
