5,'UPDATE:  Pillster contacted me directly after my original review about the color scheme being difficult to tell day from night.  As they strive for 100\%  customer satisfaction, they contacted me directly to let me know they had a  \"two color\" organizer and graciously sent me the Two Color Pillster that is ABSOLUTELY PERFECT!!!!  They sent this to me at no charge which shows Customer Satisfaction is a top priority for this company.  Kudo\'s to the Customer Care action and attitudes shown.  I so appreciate it.  The AM & PM and day of the week are still written on top,  but based on color,  at a glance you know AM is the lighter, yellow side while the PM is a dark purple!!!  Absolutely love it!!!  Color scheme enhances all the other perfect features of the Pillster..... the ability to detach and carry just one or two days with you when needed.  Also the size of the area that holds the pills ....good size to handle numerous vitamins and pills.  The \"push\" to open feature is good.  100\% Recommend this product!',B07R4Y9DV8,AFA5MRVXXSYCH2KEUDFQ6KRLT4PA
