3,'The [[ASIN:B00THEPUCI Athletic Greens - Pure Branch Chain Amino Acids (BCAA) - 390 Capsules (312 grams)]] have a good profile, but way too many pills. It states to take two servings a day; however, one serving is sixteen (16) pills! I got this product for my husband who uses BCAA products all the time because he is a bodybuilder. BCAAs are important to have included in your supplement regimen. The profile of these BCAAs are good, it is just too bad you have to take so many pills to get the benefit of them. My husband hates taking so many pills, but was doing so to get the benefits of the BCAAs. It would take him several minutes to consume the pills because you can\'t just take sixteen pills all at once. You have to do a few at a time. So the daily serving amount is a total of thirty-two (32) pills! That is a lot of pills to take with just one supplement. Not to mention taking a multivitamin and other supplements as well. If this supplement profile was in a smaller number of pills, my review would be a higher rating, but I do not know anyone who would want to take so many pills at once. I received a discount on these BCAA pills in exchange for my honest and unbiased review.',B00THEPUCI,AE2TNLFI5NPXRNZOJCI3TTBT7KDQ
