5,'The product was as expected and very fresh based on the expiration date. Of course, I had to try it immediately after it arrived. I mixed it into my matcha green tea powder. The maca gave my drink a little more of an earthy flavor which is expected for a root (I assume adding additional ingredients or sweetener would minimize this flavor). It is a taste one could easily get used to. When using a blender bottle, it mixed into cold water okay. In water alone, the taste was quite light and easy to drink! I love that the product is pure and organic, because it is so hard to find products without added ingredients or sweeteners. The packaging gives a great description of the product as well as recommendations for use and storage. This product provides a great opportunity for someone to (possibly) benefit their health and increase their energy in a natural manner. I have not used the product much, so I have no knowledge of things like benefits, side effects, etc. at this point.',B00SQROFIW,AGM5DEOFSJWDT2UL2M6CQEAFH3HA
