2,'Revised disappointing review: I first purchased the 2 oz. size for $29.99 when it was available. But when I saw $21.99 for the product, I immediately bought another bottle. I was sorely disappointed the company shrank the size by 50\% yet only reduced the price 26\%. So, that is big profit for the company without any disclosure upfront about this price/ounce increase. I will hold off buying again until the company gets back to reality on this product\'s pricing.<br /><br />First review: I first came across this product when having a glass of flavored water at a St. Regis resort spa in Punta Mita, Mexico. The peach flavor was so extraordinarily refreshing, I purchased a bottle on the spot. Years of repurchases later, an added benefit I also appreciate is how convenient it is to instantly transform a glass of water by simply adding an eye dropper full of this product. A fabulous indulgence.',B001AYJHM2,AED2K5ZCWQRM4Y6KYBTIEL3TST6Q
