4,'I keep hearing about wheat grass powder and how it suppose to help get you a good serving of vegetable in your diet and I wanted to try it out. I saw this in the organic health food store in my town and since for once I had extra cash on me from saving up due to the holidays I decided to buy it. I keep hearing/reading reviews about how wheat grass tasting bad and not a lot of people don\'t like the taste so I was a bit worried it would be bad. Once I made it thought I had a completely different opinion! To me it just taste like a none strong version of Matche Green tea powder! Like, the cheap stuff, not the expensive ones. So I am pleased that this doesn\'t make me gag or anything. I do hope this will work and give me a bit more energy through out the day. I mix it with a bunch of strawberries and a tiny bit of Mio orange drink drops instead of juice since I have to cut back on my sugars. So far it taste great. I will update on this in a month or so to see if I get any more energy or feel any different.',B00014EF3S,AGBAAXGUQFJUWCDC7CRWGMHERLGA
