4,'Amazon provided this product to me specifically to write a review.  That said, I try to be honest and open in all my reviews.<br /><br />(Please see the enclosed pictures.)<br /><br />We both take a number of supplements every day to include some common, anti-oxidants.  I will update this review in a couple of months to let you know if had an appreciable effect on health.<br /><br />I was not familiar with moringa leaf, but according to the directions, it is pretty easy to use.<br /><br />Stir a generous tablespoon of the green powder into a steaming cup of water (8 oz) and drink the ensuing brew.  You can also use it in smoothies.<br /><br />The taste is earthy, but not overpowering like some herbal drinks.<br /><br />We put a couple of drops of peppermint into the tea to mask any \"grassy\" taste, and it went down easily.<br /><br />So far, we cannot report any effects either positive or negative, but supplements like this often take time to reveal the positive results.',B07J32PJCJ,AGVOYO5W45UWJY4I6MBEPU2GTW2A
