5,'Can’t speak to ritual quality at this point, only products. I’m assuming from past experience and quality of this kit that it’ll pack a lot of energy in a purification ritual.<br /><br />I have an aromatherapy certification, I make candles and oils. The quality in this seller’s products always impress me. There’s both essential oils and herbs in the oil, candle, and bath salts. They also include a bag of similar themed stick incense.<br /><br />The only suggestion I might make for the company is to add a printed card of instructions for the spell kits. It’s in the description though, so customers can screenshot that (that’s what I’ve done for the ritual part).<br /><br />I like strongly scented natural products, but it might be a bit strong for some people (something to keep in mind). It’s not overwhelming, just strong.<br /><br />This was a very nice kit.<br />But I have to add ... my absolute favorite product Art of the Root makes is the Fiery Wall of Protection oil — omg, SO yummy. I’ve used it for protection, but more as a perfume! Lovely scent. Great products, great company.',B07BT2HJ11,AEDSU6PB74DE7OAOSBEOQLL5F23Q
