5,'I love this mat cleaner. The microfiber cloth that comes with it is perfect for giving my mat a quick wipe-down after every practice. I love that the cleaner smells great but it\'s not overpowering. I do hot yoga a few times a week, and this is the first cleaner I\'ve found that really makes me feel like I\'m actually disinfecting my (very porous, rubber huggermugger) mat and pulling the sweat out of it, as opposed to just masking sour odors.<br /><br />If the product wasn\'t wonderful enough, their customer service is top-notch. My firsts bottle of cleaner came with the cap a little loose, and some of the product had leaked out into the box. While this is likely Amazon\'s fault, I contacted Asutra and asked them what I should do about it. They sent another bottle, no questions asked. Happy to support a smaller seller and absolutely in love with this mat cleaner. I may even try another scent before I get all the way through this bottle, I\'m so obsessed. This is a business you can feel good giving your hard earned dollars to.<br /><br />Thanks, Asutra. Keep up the great work.',B00XQBHIHS,AFNUIM2BSTRAHOY4E5BNYCZPV6SQ
