5,'This is a wonderful med box.  I have used many during my years as a nurse, and this one is super sized and great for anyone who takes lots of med or supplements.<br />I found no rough edges, and I have no difficulties opening it and have found no pieces of plastic breaking off of the individual pill holders or the large box.<br />I have arthritis and carpel tunnel and the tops of the individual pill holders simply slide forward or backwards. I like that you can take just one individual days pills with you if you choose.<br />The container that holds the individual days pill containers is not awkward, but it\'s not small either, it\'s approx. 5.75\" wide (which includes the hinges and the clasp) and 10\" long x approx. 1.75\" high.<br />The individual containers are approx. 1 3/8\" tall, 1.75\" wide and almost 5\" long.<br />This box is white on the bottom, and pale aqua on the top that is see through as are the individual daily containers just as pictured.<br />I\'m impressed with this and very happy with my purchase.  I would recommend it to my friends.',B0011YJE4C,AHXMKLMWQVVRA6IAKL63EK7U6YHA
