5,'I was looking for a triple flame torch for traveling or when out and about as an upgrade to a single flame torch.  This Scorch Torch lighter is aesthetically pleasing, is easy to light, and has the nifty feature of a cigar punch built into the lighter.  Right out of the box, it lit the first time, and so far, has lit on the first strike almost 100\% of the time.  This lighter could easy pass for a more expensive brand name lighter.<br /><br />Some reviewers have complained this lighter is a fuel guzzler, and my comment to that is.....what do you expect from a triple flame torch?  I equate those negative reviews in the same context of someone buying a SUV, and then complaining it doesn\'t get the same MPG as their Yugo!!!  I mean, really???  Go buy a single flame torch if you need to conserve fuel....<br /><br />I would definitely purchase again, or recommend to a friend.',B00AIANND8,AE5YDL7RQT3LQU4NKTG33UIM36AA
