5,'This is a fantastic Morning and Night-time Teatox. It is all natural, cleansing and so refreshing. It really helped reduce my appetite and urge to eat junk food all day. It gave me so much more energy, and a clean energy where I didn\'t just crash after.  They are one of the best tasting teatoxes I have ever tried. The Morning Tea has a strong clove flavor and the Night-time Tea has a light minty flavor. Both delicious. They do exactly as described if not better and has been one of the best 14 day teatox I have done yet. Definitely recommend them! Especially the Morning Tea!',B01H40U03A,AGSDIMXLI7EEPJ5XQFQ5J23KRPDA
5,'Holly smokes this stuff works! With the monrey. Works ridiculously quick.<br /><br />I had a baseball sized patch of Tinea Versicolor under my left breast and spreading across my braw-line, down my stomach and up the middle of my chest.<br /> I used this stuff for only like 5 days, than a few nights I forgot... and within a week or two my symptoms have vanished!!! I didn\'t even use it that long and ALL of the ugly patches are nowhere to be found. I haven\'t use any for over a month, nothing has popped up! I found it impressive for how little I used It and how large of an area I was treating. I decided to write this review and let other\'s out there that this stuff is serious business!<br /><br />I read SO many reviews before buying this. Buying something like this off of Amazon didn\'t seem like the best idea because things like creams and medical grade products might be best bought directly from the vendor or pharmacy. But this was easy and I\'m a busy girl, and it worked out for me!!<br />The bottle is still more than half full, a little goes a long way with this stuff. It has the texture of a thin lotion and has almost a baby shampoo smell, so it\'s not grouse. It seemed to obsorbe quickly into my skin and didn\'t get super sticky when it dried. I put it on before bed every night that I used it and only sometimes washed it off in the morning, some days it would stay with me all day (which isn\'t as directed, it says wash it off the next morning) but it wasn\'t noticeable enough to for me feel like &#34;ewww I can\'t wait to wash this stuff off.&#34; But this can be different for different people.<br />So, now my ugly versicolor is gone in time for my wedding ;) thank god this stuff worked!',B01I0J7NPW,AGCZVRM2EK7XKRICZ7VYCT4PBA7Q
