5,'My fitbit band split open at the back from popping the device in and out for charging.  I was kind of ticked-off, because I think it should have held up much better, especially since I always took extra care to be gentle with the procedure.  I decided to try this third-party band, because it was much more attractively priced than the fitbit brand, and I was already disappointed in fitbit\'s durability.<br /><br />I\'m very pleased with both the color and the quality of this item.  It is at least as well made as the original (and possibly better). I like that the color is unique; I see a lot of slate blue and black bands, and even a few of the persimmon ones, but I\'ve never seen another like mine. The fit and clasp are identical to the original. I couldn\'t be happier.  If this one lasts roughly as long as my first, I\'ll start buying them in pairs.',B00HMKK0QK,AEB74RL2DSI737BSMR2J52O3ZH4A
