5,'For all intents and purposes, this product is identical to the well known Airborne supplement. The ingredients list is a one--to-one match, aside from a single ingredient. The one item that is different is listed as \"Corn Syrup Solids\" in this product, and \"Maltodextrine\" in Airborne. (In the little research I did, though, I realized those might actually be the same thing too.) The taste is very similar to Airborne too, as is the effervescence. Given that, it is safe to say that it boost your immune system in the same way as Airborne. Your results there may vary, but I\'ve found the product useful in dampening and possibly shortening the effects of a cold. Good product to have on the shelf, just in case. I recommend it.',B07C734XK3,AHFXN7VYMREYLNP2PCVXAXCZYUZA
