5,'After taking good magnesium pills for a couple of months. My blood pressure still shot up to 180/115. Went to the ER and they handed me blood pressure pills. I\'m only 46 years old. After taking blood pressure pills for a week it was still 130 or 140/ 100 So I bought the book Magnesium miracle.  The doctor recommended this Remag. So I bought a bottle. Tasted awful at first. After a few days. I can\'t taste it anymore. I\'m only doing 1/4 of a teaspoon everyday for 2 weeks. Sipping it all day in a bottle of water. I cut my blood pressure pills to half from a 10 mg pill the last two weeks. Tested my pressure last night before bed was 114/72. Waking up this morning not taking blood pressure pill yet and it\'s 130/89. It\'s still work in progress.  But way better then it was with best magnesium pills I could buy. I don\'t know what\'s in this stuff but I\'m a believer. I will be buying more. Trying to get magnesium back to normal so I can get off these pills forever.',B01LZLSJ7B,AFBHPCIRWACX64XYKWWIWC2BZOFQ
