5,' <br />These Original Athlete Focus Plus vegetable capsules provide just the needed energy that I need without feeling shaky or hyper. I expect it is because of the 225 mg. of Theanine provided in each of the capsules along with the 100 mg. of natural caffeine. It provides the perfect balance to give me the sustainable energy and yet still feel calm and tranquil at the same time. Theanine is an amino acid found in green tea. It is commonly used to treat anxiety and high blood pressure so if you are already on blood pressure medicine, you should check with your doctor as theanine may lower your blood pressure even more. It is also used by some for preventing Alzheimer\'s disease. The recommended usage is to take 1-2 capsules per day. I took 2 capsules at lunch and remained focused and energized throughout the afternoon with no side effects. This bottle will provide a month\'s supply with 2/day or if you find that 1 capsule is enough for you, then a 2 month supply.<br /> ',B01LYC2JIZ,AHO5KUATGSDLV4MN4GSL5MRY6EDQ
