3,'I had seen an add for this product via social media. As my picture shows, I have two other products that advertise for the most part instant visible results. Well...<br /><br />Overall, the product seems to have similar to no difference from normal toothpaste. Nor a huge change in the whiteness of my teeth as shown in the add. Not mad, its an add and its meaning is go get you to buy the product. Well played.<br /><br />To be fair, Ive only used this product for the last couple of days and truth be told. Didnt always have the best habit when it comes to brushing my teeth twice a day. I was also worried about the products makeup, due to the lack of info on it.<br /><br />After using the product. The foam it creates is similar to if you were to rinse after with hydrogen peroxide. It does have a nice taste in comparison to the other products as well and less of a mess on your counter top. Another plus is the charcoal is a mess if/when used. Almost feel like I need to brusb twice after using either of the other two.<br /><br />If your interested and you have a dentist you see on somewhat of a normal time frame. I would either ask them about it and see what they say. Or if the price is right for you and you have tried other things like myself. Id say give it a try.<br /><br />Hope this helps and you have a wonderful smile!',B07VK87RNG,AH6BYQSKV7QJ4RRRCIEHN7D3KXNQ
