5,'This mask is comfortable and convenient due to the adjustable strap. It can be washed easily. I like that it was made in the US.  I’ve gotten compliments on it too. It’s perfect for situations during which you need to take your mask off-like for eating or going from store to store.  You can drop it when in the car, so it’s right there around your neck when you need it. No need to lay it down or lose track of it. The filters needed are not included. This is something I think should be considered by the seller.  They are conveniently together on Amazon to make ordering simple,  but did not ship together.  It would be better to include them in a package deal.  I am satisfied with the mask. The style and convenience is worth the extra cost compared to other styles.',B08B7RRTF4,AH6W73PICQSVY4DEEWJ5N6UQFMPQ
