4,'This is my first heated eye lash curler,  so I can\'t compare it to others but as a first time, this thing is awesome!!! Its easy to turn on, just hold the button down for 2 seconds, same way to turn it off. It heats up quickly,  and usually goes to about 85 degrees Celsius,  if you click it once, it will raise in temperature to about 95 degrees Celsius,  which is where it tops out, if up click it one more time, the temperature will drop and get cooler. It curls my eye lashes great and they stayed curled up all day,  which is better than my old metal curler.  You can out mascara on before curling or not, either way, I like to put it on before and after. The curler wipes clean really easy. The display is bright and large, easy to read. It also comes with a bag, a charging cord ( but you need the adapter for the wall)  and a couple brushes.  For the price I think it\'s a good value. Love this thing!!',B08JVF5B7F,AFO6QRJE7PPMBY2P66V2FPKJUIEA
