4,'These DownBeats Reusable High Fidelity Hearing protectors work as advertised and are surprisingly comfortable. The included aluminum container is larger than it has to be, but very handy.<br /><br />Ignoring all the reviews posted about this product, I\'ll simply say this. The Downbeats moderately reduce sound volume without greatly affecting the quality of the sound. They are by no means &#34;HiFi&#34; or &#34;audiophile quality&#34;. They can\'t be. But if you seek a quieter world, no matter the circumstances, I can recommend the Downbeats.<br /><br />Our world is a very noisy place. You can just put up with it, or you can keep a pair of Downbeats in your purse or pocket. You\'ll be surprised how often and where you use them.',B00A3Z44R2,AG5BO5XMA5K7HTTAPRMYQ2KOLHPA
