5,'This stuff smells good, cleans well, is a good size bottle, has wonderful list of organic ingredients, pretty label, and came with a towel. I am really impressed with this small company and the high quality. I want to support them and try more of their products as I am about organic and well sourced materials.<br /><br />If you want to read more about why I am impressed: I have a beloved yoga mat from a company in Seattle that is now going out of business (aka, I can\'t buy a new one from them as they are out of stock). I love the mat I got from them in 2010 dearly and we have been through so much together -including a 200hr teacher training, daily yoga at studio for years (in addition to lots of hot yoga classes), and a move across the country from Colorado to the Midwest over a year ago. Being a native of dry air, I have no idea how to clean my yoga mat in this funky humid environment! In Denver I could soak and clean my mat and hang it up dry, and it would be good by the next day --- not here..  and it was developing a weird mold funk smell. I quit using it and thought I was going to have to through it out (and haven\'t found a new mat I like yet!)- but this stuff has saved the day. It took the funk out and renewed my beloved mat with a wonderful scent. I am beyond impressed and grateful.',B00XQBHIHS,AHY6JLSKFZB4D7AVSGDQ4RQAMYZQ
