5,'In an attempt to shed some weight, I purchased the Fitbit Zip to track my activity in May of this year.  Pairing the Fitbit with apps like My Fitness Pal allows you to track calories in vs. calories out.  After adjusting my diet and increasing my fitness, I wanted to see the results.<br /><br />This scale was incredibly easy to set up with a little help from the Fitbit site.  I use it daily and the scale immediately uploads my weight and body fat to the Fitbit site.  I can access my information from my iPhone, iPad and Macbook.  My husband and I both use the scale and after the first few weight ins, the scale now recognizes us every time we step on.  I have thoroughly enjoyed and find it very motivating to watch my weight fluctuate via trends on the Fitbit site.<br /><br />The Fitbit trackers are the ultimate weight loss tools!',B0077L8YFI,AHWFB6NNJILJQL3CF6ILJMO37F6Q
