5,'This rotating cleaning brush matches the descriptions and pictures in the product details. It has three good speed settings, accessed by successive presses of the power button. As is common in such devices, a long press of the power button will power the device on or off. The power/speed button is located on the bottom of the device. This product requires slightly more force to activate the button, because there is a silicone covering that secures the watertight aspect for the power button, and the charging port.<br />The device is nicely designed, with a nice compact size. I like that it can stand upright easily (see attached photos). It comes with the silicone bristle brush head already attached. Two bristle brush heads are also included. The silicone brush head works well, especially for exfoliation. I found the softer bristle brushes actually enhances the foaming of soapy lather on the face. I think a smart move would be for a brush head that includes both silicone and normal bristles to get best of both worlds.<br />The brush heads easily pull off and press on. As mentioned, the three speeds offer a range from a gentle cleansing to a more robust scrubbing.<br />It\'s IPX7 waterproof, which means it can be used in the shower or bath without water damage. I always wonder how any cleaning brush could not be IPX7, since it will always involve interaction with water. Anyway, this product meets that requisite waterproof rating.<br />The initial removal of the cap was a bit frustrating, but once it was on/off a few times, it was fine. Although, I would advise that the cap be removed before you lather up your hands with soap/shampoo, because your hands will be slippery and you can\'t get a good grip of the cap.<br />Overall, this is a very credible rotating brush. This is a nicely manufactured product, with a simple, straightforward utlity: a rotating brush device with three speeds. It met expectations, and currently sits on the bathroom sink. Based on these initial impressions, this cleaning brush earns a solid 4.5 star rating, with a high level recommendation.',B091KDWG5T,AHPGHDFIU3BUB3RQBP56RQQA7W4Q
