5,'[[VIDEOID:b46e7ea0d13ae0821cad709996c924c0]] This is the biggest diffuser I have ever had and I love it. It makes life so much easier. I can fill this bad boy all the way up and it goes all day or all night. It fills up a room super fast with whatever aroma you put into it.<br /><br /> I love all the different functions. The lights are very pretty and not to bright but still vibrant. I like that you can also change the low and high of the our put on the the mist that comes out. You are also about to do just the lights or just the mist.<br /><br /> I was a little worried when I first turned it on because It was not putting out much mist. I just let it run though I did really pay attention to it but after a little while the mist really started spewing out. I was impressed with how much was coming out not only did it look cool but it smelled amazing.<br /><br />I can turn this thing on and not mess with it for the entire day. Its even better for when I sleep because I get all night diffusing If my favorite sleep blend. I do have to use more essential oils then the smaller ones. I find it better to just come back every few hours and put a bit more in then add a bunch from the start. Its not hard to do either. Since the top just lifts off you don\'t have to deal with unlocking it. The on off button makes it a fast and easy process.<br /><br />I\'m really please with the quality of this diffuser. Much better than I expected. The simple and elegant design goes with pretty much any décor you choose to put it with. It looks nice anywhere and with the light its really makes a wonderful addition to any room.<br /><br />I received this product discounted in exchange for my honest and unbiased review. This does not effect the time, effort and integrity I put into a review that would be beneficial to any fellow customer. I have no relationship with sellers and manufacturers. I base all my reviews on quality, value, and personal experience of the product.',B00WSCFS6O,AHEUVUCF4DDDHKDOI2JJRQFBNZMQ
