1,'We bought this step to use with our RV to assist with the first big step up into our rig. On the first weekend we used the step, it broke rendering it completely unusable, The hinges on the end braces failed. See the included pictures.<br /><br />At 250 lbs I am not a small person, but still under the stated weight capacity of 300 lbs..<br /><br />Our campsite happened to have a concrete patio next to our RV and this is where the step was placed, so the failure cannot be excused by use on rough or uneven ground.<br /><br />Unfortunately, I purchased this step well in advance of its first use, so I was about 7 days past Amazon\'s 30 day return window. And it appears that the vendor does not offer any additional warranty on its product.<br /><br />I recommend that you do not purchase this product.',B0761141KY,AGV3DNWWVN6ARFP755CH772IUUXQ
