5,'I remember using tooth powder (Pepsodent and Colgate) when I was a kid in the 70s.  When I was surfing Amazon during the recent Prime Day in October 2020, I came across this product.  It is so awesome.  Yes, it will discolor your teeth ONLY IF you don\'t rinse well.  I\'m not sure why people are complaining about this in other reviews.  I\'ve been using it daily for a few weeks now (right after I had a visit to the dental hygenist) and my teeth feel so clean and smooth after using The Dirt.<br /><br />I highly recommend this product but you may not like it if you can\'t wrap your head around the fact that it is a powder and not a paste.  I have a younger friend in her 30s and she just does not \"get\" the whole tooth powder concept.<br /><br />Because it is flouride free I do use a flouride treatment I get from my dentist\'s office but only because I have a medical condition which greatly affects my teeth due to chronic dry mouth.  In fact after my dental cleaning I had 9 new cavities over the course of a little over a year.  There is nothing I can do about that - not until science comes up with a cure for my rare disease - but I just have to live with it.',B07YNXX55V,AGYHUIZEDLQCOLV2JDIEXWWZHFNQ
