5,'Years ago, I purchased a large dog food container (approximately 17&#34;x18&#34;x20&#34; tall) for my recycling items. I used to get free recycling bags from the city I lived in, but no longer. After trying various tall kitchen bags (never big enough to stretch over the opening), it finally occurred to me to get 33-gallon bags. This fits the container comfortably and is tall enough to lap over the top edge, then tie down (never use twist ties, anyway), which also makes a good &#34;handle&#34; to transport. I was forewarned on another review that there was not an inner box, so I opened it carefully, and it has its own storage box (~12x18x4 tall)! I highly recommend these bags if (1) you don\'t care about the twist ties and (2) you don\'t expect a separate storage container for the bags.',B0017T70B0,AGIERWNNBPWLUALOWIQWXHGJMTPA
