5,'I have tried so many different compression stockings.  All extremely difficult to put on and take off with arthritic hands and no padding in them at all for my severely injured feet.  These are easy putting on and taking off, very padded in the foot pad and heel.  I have inflammatory arthritis, osteoarthritis, gout, posterior tibial tendonitis problems, 2 completely torn tendons, broken bone on top of foot, tendon sheath swelling, plantar fasciitis, circulatory and neuropathy problems, muscle damage and damaged Achilles tendon.  These stockings comfort and support my legs from the knees down and ultimately lessens my pain, particularly late in the day when the pain is excruciating and hard to tolerate.  I will order more and discard all the other brands and consider the money spent on them a learning experience.',B01A84Z5HU,AEVDRCZJBWGBOYXSHDZSHLXIZWYQ
