4,'Since this is my first tobacco pouch and all, I decided against a 5 star review, since I haven\'t known anything else but this one.  First off, if you have a big pipe, you might want to avoid getting this, since I have a Dr. Grabow pipe (featured here: [...] it\'s the one on the bottom) an i have juuuust enough room for it, the tamper and a small box of matches.  The tobacco pouch itself is quite large and can hold plenty of tobacco if you aren\'t a heavy pipe smoker.  The inside of the case isn\'t quite as bad as some reviews say it is, although the tobacco pouch portion of the case does smell like a cheap inflatable inner tube swim ring thing you would buy for your kid.  Overall this is a nice pouch!  I would definitely recommend this to other novice pipe smokers.<br /><br />And for some extra perspective, the tamper is shorter than my ring finger and the pouch itself sticks out a tad bit when I cover it with my hand.<br /><br />I have small to medium size hands.',B001DYM622,AGRUHYDX2DNAVG3OT2SGTODI56GQ
