5,'Have taken this for two months now...positive results and noticable difference in my digestion.  I\'m a 50yr-old woman, avid runner, walker and hiker...very active, but have had a lifetime of \'gut\' issues...bloating, gas, irritable bowel syndrome, mainly after eating and always more pronounced during the holidays, celebrations or vacations.  I started taking one capsule a day (usually at lunch or dinner) and over the weeks my stomach settled and I felt much better after meals.  I eat very healthy, lots of fruit and vegetables, and limit sugar, no dairy, no bread, so very diligent about my diet, too.  I\'ve never been formally diagnosed with a digestive \'condition\' but just had a \'gut\' feeling something was not right.  This product helps immensely. Once I started taking this it did take a few weeks to notice the results, and during that time I did have some gas and very mild diarrhea, so I\'m guessing my body was adjusting to the influx of good bacteria.  I did try other products, but none were as effective as this brand. About a week ago I was busy and distracted and skipped a few days, it didn\'t take long for some symptoms to recur. One capsule a day, with meals, has become my daily ritual. If you\'ve got tummy troubles, give it a chance and you may be pleased.',B00012NCBG,AG3GHLJELAPH35BTCNGCSH4IBSZA
5,'I love this brand of Ashitaba. I have taken this for a few months now as part of an overall fitness and wellness routine. The taste is pleasant and I love how water soluble the powder is. Just a scoop in my water bottle and a few shakes and it\'s good to go! There is no doubt I look and feel better using the Ashitaba. Fast shipping and an attentive sales team at Samsara!',B017VESJLE,AHZPXGM6V5KEVTKVWSSHUGPFU25A
