5,'Used panacur c for dogs (purchased online- box with 3 envelopes). The planaria infestation was incredible so I decided to desolve half a packet in tank water and warmer sink water mixture- much shaking to dissolve granules then dump in tank.<br />-Remove cartridges first so medication efficacy is not lost.<br />-Dumped milky substance in tank and left apple and rams horn snails in bc planaria can hide in their shell<br />-Waited 2 days and repeated dosage.<br />-No water changes in between nor feeding. (non- feeding was the most difficult)<br />- Waited a day 1/2 then did ~80-90\% water change<br />-Added prime and stability<br />-Later that night added algae wafer and apple snail (Gus) and rams horn ate in peace<br />(This was for 29g tank)',B009TAQ4OI,AGBTNIVRL2UQR2LV5EBWIESDKVFA
