5,'Mosquitos love me and I have tried everything! The only thing that used to work for me was 100\% DEET and that stuff is nasty! It literally melted the paint off the jeep when my DEET covered leg rubbed the jeep side!<br />A friend of mine whose family lives in Texas recommended this. I have now used it on numerous trips and I got very few bites. I use it in conjunction with ’doTERRA TerraShield Essential Oil Outdoor Blend’ which was recommended by an American living in Cabo. I also recently bought ‘The Bug Bite Thing’ to remove the venom on the few bites that I get rather than constantly applying anti-itch cream.<br />I use the lotion every evening before going outside. In places where the mosquitos are out during the day, I also use the lotion in the morning. I place 3 drops of the oil on each ankle every morning and evening (even though the instructions say one drop is enough). The smell of both is not offensive; but if you use the oil around your neck/shoulders, the smell can be a bit strong.<br />One bottle lasted for three 3 week trips.',B07D3CF4MG,AF2QOWYETBM2PNVYF6PIDKEPN6QA
