5,'Fantastic item. The lid was loose on its arrival, and the ball was loose too. Not sure how much of the oil got loose. Put the ball back on the jar, tightened the lid on very slugly. The ball applicator has not fallen out since.<br /><br />Have used this MONQ Roll-on Essential Oil on my neck and shoulders before work, and it actually did help. Put some on the hip muscles area, and it took longer to notice an effect, but there was a comfortable warming sensation.<br />Wished the oil container was larger to use more often. That little jar will not last long.<br /><br />Good smell. Comfortable warmth. Recommended.',B09217KPZV,AHG5PL6TRAIJVRILHZYM4BHGLL7Q
2,'Wasn\'t impressed with this “HSN” formula. I didn\'t see any results in the form of hair or nail growth. My skin didn\'t appear any different and I didn\'t notice any changes in my hair\'s strength or shine.<br /><br />I have tried hair skin and nail support supplements in the past and have had decent results. I have found the ones that work the best are the most simple in recipe. This formula has ingredients I never heard of such as Plant Squalene and bamboo. The amount of Biotin (3000mcg) is disappointing.<br /><br />This formula seems to have too much going on. It\'s claims sound more like those of a multivitamin. A lot of the mentioned benefits (cardiovascular, vision, energy increase and memory improvement) I expect from a multivitamin or other benefit specific supplement. When looking for a Hair, Skin and Nail supplement I want it to focus on just that. I think this company was trying to capture too much here.<br /><br />Three capsules daily can be tiring. The price isn\'t too bad, but I have used HSN products in the past that cost around the same or less and work loads better. On the positive side, the capsules are quite easy to swallow and don\'t give off any bad smell or aftertaste.<br /><br />I received this product at a discount in exchange for my honest and unbiased review. Always be cautious of “free or deeply discounted” product reviews, but DON\'T discount every reviewer. Click on the reviewer\'s name and check their other reviews. Honest reviewers won\'t give every product a 5 star review and will typically write more than a few sentences.',B016EEUO42,AEXUGVHFZA7357OIAC7GCX367UPQ
5,'Very well done product here.  Tumeric is one secret of staying healthy, and as a spice it just works well in a wide variety of dishes.  At first impression for the package is that you get three hefty size packs in an overall clear packaging.  Its got a nice heft, this is a lot of tumeric.  The processing is good and you can tell the product is pure.  You can cook with it, package it in gel caps and use it daily as a tonic.  Just don\'t take raw tumeric after dinner to ensure you don\'t have digestion issues because it does have some heat.  Good stuff.',B085LHTW4G,AHOFNQHMKWRZQRBRYSCN2NFWGEZA
