5,'This is a very well made guasha tool. A friend of mine (also a mom of young kids) told me about them and said it’s the one thing she does each day for herself. I’ve been intrigued and was excited to get one finally.<br /><br />The product is presented well (would be a great gift for people interested in them) and has a nice heavy weight. It’s very smooth and slides well on my skin. The instructions are also useful as I am new to using these.<br /><br />I think there’s an art to using them so I’m going to watch some videos. I saw other people took off a star because they didn’t feel it worked for them immediately. Personally, I don’t think that’s an issue with this product, would happen with any guasha device. You definitely need to learn how to use them, but if you’re invested in doing that, this would be a great tool to use.',B0B9PBCNLJ,AEYDWBTKRXYIOW2ATGJ7YV4FXGWQ
