5,'This is a BIG 4 ounce container of beard balm. The canister it comes in is nearly the exact same size as a can of chew if that helps. I\'ve picked up a couple of different beard balms for my husband and it\'s nice to know he won\'t go through this one as quickly. It should last him months, easily!<br /><br />I love that it is unscented as well. There is no lingering odor at all. My husband couldn\'t stand the last one I got him as it smelled like vapor rub under his mouth and nose all day.  That is not an issue with this UrbanXY brand.<br /><br />To apply I just rub my index and middle finger around on the top of the open canister until I get a bit of melted balm built up on my fingers and then massage it into his beard. In manly fashion, on the other hand, my husband digs a finger into the canister and gobs some out and then rubs it into his beard. Both get the job done.<br /><br />This balm takes his unruly beard and tames it, smoothing the hairs out and keeping them neatly together instead of sticking out all over the place. It also makes his goatee appear longer than it looks without the balm. I\'ll include pics so you can see for yourself. It also makes it easier to comb though his beard and makes it softer to the touch. Since you leave it in, this effect lasts all day until the next time his beard is shampooed. We\'re really not seeing long lasting benefit just yet, but the instant improvement is pretty amazing and it\'s become a part of his daily morning routine.<br /><br />I received this beard balm free in exchange for an honest and unbiased review. All opinions are my own and were uninfluenced by price. I would happily pay full price for this item and feel completely comfortable recommending it based on our use.',B010L93B64,AFW5Z2P5MXLGAFGCQZN4ATKNRU6A
