5,'Having never tried a protein powder before, I was looking for something to take after working out to help build muscles. I bought a small package of the vanilla flavor at a local health store and my wife and I both really like the taste blended just with water. I also froths up really nicely when blended. The milk ingredients seem to have a somewhat negative effect on my stomach but I still am giving this 5 stars as the product is excellent in my opinion and my stomach is quite sensitive to milk anyway. I drank one serving before dinner and two more servings after my evening workout and I can\'t really believe it but my muscles are noticeably larger and firmer even days after the workout. I am also drinking water but I really believe this product has a positive effect on my body (other than the milk intolerance). It is also fantastic as an appetite suppressant between meals and great to drink first thing in the morning. I\'m really hoping Rivalus has another similar product that my stomach might find more tolerable because I would love to keep taking this on a regular basis.',B01K7OVIRW,AGZ7PZJ4MS5BGEKYDLLO72JCID6A
