3,'[[VIDEOID:4e7127560e0dce32815de1168e58073]] This compact, lightweight 3-in-1 Nose, Ear and Facial Trimmer has the 3 blades that are easy to install, and to remove.<br /><br />The nose hair trimmer pulled an occasional nose hair as I trimmed my nose hairs. I needed to move the trimmer inside my nose repeatedly to trim the long hairs that I could see, taking longer than it normally takes me to trim the hairs. When I was done, I cleaned this trimmer under running water.<br />note: I could not remove any parts of the nose hair trimmer.<br /><br />The round shave trimmer gave a decent shave (I shave multiple times a week), but it took longer to shave my face than it did when using my preferred razor. When I felt my face after shaving, I didn\'t get as close a shave as I\'d like.<br /><br />The hair trimming blade, with options for 2.0 mm and 6.0 mm, gave a good cut that I liked. This was my favorite of the three blades.<br /><br />Of the 3 blades, the nose hair trimmer makes the least noise, while the hair trimmer makes the most noise. I did not find this trimmer to be too noisy.<br /><br />Lastly, the user manual has detailed illustrations; but, the text instructions were a bit confusing. For instance, under in the section \"Cleaning and maintenance - machine body cleaning\" --- the manual says \"...can split the blade and body, it\'s convenient to clean the hair debris in the gap.....\".',B0B28VNFB6,AE2O2C43KTYO4LXXGZWJZLE67GBQ
