1,'It is a nice design but too expensive.  I made the same thing from a 1/2 inch ten foot length of PVC pipe and eight elbows from Lowes for less than $10.  Cut six 12 inch sections from the ten pipe.  Then cut the remaining 4 ft section in half.  Assemble in the same shape as this item with the two foot pieces being the vertical sections.  I cut off 4 inches from the two ft pieces to fit my bed. No need to glue them together.  Works perfectly.',B000ITQ2Q4,AFDBVPPDZOUDWPDC7OVXROXJ46GQ
