4,'I got the Swonuk Sound Machine with Night Light to replace my other sound machine that was getting finicky in its operation. I can’t sleep without white noise and my other machine would periodically suddenly stop, instantly waking me up.<br /><br />Different people who use sound machines need different sounds. This sound machine has a lot of different sounds, so there should be a sound that works for most people. There are even three musical lullabies for babies. The volume has a good range and actually can be set quite loud. The machine will remember the last setting from the last use. I usually takes me a couple of nights to adjust to the differences in the sound with a new machine. For some reason, that was not the case with this machine.<br /><br />It is also a night light with vivid colors that aren’t too bright. There is a dim and brighter setting for the white light. You can also have it automatically cycle through the colors. I use it when I have to get up in the middle of the night. I also use the colored lighting at times before I go to bed just for relaxation.<br /><br />I always bring my sound machine with me when I travel. This machine is more compact than my previous machine and will travel well.  Hopefully, that will be happening again soon.<br /><br />The only issue I have with the unit is the controls are touch sensitive. There are no button or even raised areas to the ring with the controls. It’s very easy to brush up against the wrong control. It’s even harder at night if you are wanting to control the machine. I’ve hit the volume up when I was wanting to turn on the night light. Considering how loud the machine can get, it is quite jarring in the middle of the night.<br /><br />Even with that, I have been unexpectedly happy with this sound machine. I guess I was expecting something “less” and it’s nice to be surprised in the positive direction.',B08TW9W6V3,AHR6ZSCEZPV5IIYAPOECIMWJMZEA
