1,'I had previously purchased this product from an independent website. I loved the taste and efficientcy of the product.  So I checked to see if I could purchase it on Amazon.  The packaging is very similar except for a few hardly noticable differences.  This product has a difference style of print of the word Okinawa, the picture of the fruit is similar but less the vegables, and the supplementy facts are totally different.  But who notices that stuff since at first glance it appears the same. After opening it the differences are more apparent. It is more of a powdery consistancy then a fine granular one. The taste is none spacific where as the original has a lovely pomagrante flavor.  I can not speak to the efficiently of the producty because I dislike the flavor and stopped taking it after the first bottle.  This one is distributed by Swift Breeze Fitness, whereas the original is by Claro Nutrition and has 3 certifications on the lable. GMP, Made in the USA, and FDA. I am unable to return this product since I did not open it until I was out of my original which put me over the alotted time limit. So it is going into the trash.',B08Y5RK23T,AFXHFJ54NGJVLL6UERABXKMESZ6A
