5,'I discovered this product when looking into supplements for sinus infections.  It seemed that every time I got a cold it progressed  into a sinus infection, or bronchitis so I was trying to discover if I possibly had a vitamin deficiency.<br /><br />As I was searching I found this comment about Oralmat on a website:<br />  &#34; Oralmat - from Australia.  Natural herbal product with no listed side effects derived from Ryegrass.  Medical trials are underway in Australia.  Anecdotal patient reports claim the product is so effective that allergy & asthma sufferers can greatly reduce or even eliminate normal medication / inhalers. Adults asthmatics get significant relief after 3 to 4 weeks and children respond much faster.  Allergy symptoms may improve within minutes of use.<br /><br />Oralmat is said to produce broad-spectrum results for numerous conditions including:<br /><br />* Chronic fatigue - symptoms abate within 7 to 10 days<br />* Asthma<br />* MS patients - dramatic reduction in fatigue & fewer relapses<br />* Cold and Flu - symptoms said to disappear within HOURS of administration.<br />* Hayfever and Allergic Rhinitis - rapid improvement, even within MINUTES of use for some individuals<br />* Sinus Headaches - rapid drainage of congested sinus passages relieves headaches&#34;<br /><br />Well, I decided to give it a try.  What could it hurt--no known side effects?  I am so glad I did!  My husband was skeptical at first until he had symptoms of a beginning cold which vanished after using 3 drops of Oralmat on his tongue, 3 times a day for a couple of days.  I have had those same results.  I have not had a cold, or sinus infection since discovering Oralmat several months ago.  It is amazing how quickly the symptoms leave after taking the drops.<br /><br />I highly recommend this product and have purchased several bottles some of which I have shared with skeptical friends or family because they didn\'t want to spend the $20-$35 (prices vary) to experiment.',B000IRNE5I,AFTCS7DZLVG4V2AJHQLV3VKEBUZQ
