1,'I’m sure these patches work marvelously until you accidentally get some of it in your eye and you have a bad reaction, so unfortunately I’m going to have to leave a negative review.  I was noticing some dark circles under my eyes so I decided to use these patches. Well, I put the left one up too high and it got in the inner corner of my eye. My eye watered nonstop and then it completely dilated (see my weird photo) and then my vision went all hazy.  I was told to call poison control and then poison control directed me to go to the ER. Luckily, I was able to get in at a nearby ophthalmologist who ran tests and treated my eye then gave me prescription cream for the reaction. I understand that the box says not to get it in your eye but this was a complete accident and it was pretty scary. I never really write reviews but I want other people to be aware.',B0009ET738,AGEWA55TYD6PGMCAJJ762JVFVFYQ
