5,'Love this pump! To be clear, this is a pump, not a collector. So if you’re using if while nursing regularly you will likely increase your supply. I almost exclusively pump and have two electric pumps I use most of the time. But I pull these out when the electric pump is not convenient. I literally used them while bathing and getting my three year old to bed the other night. And they stayed on! They are not as effective as the electric pumps, at least not for me, but the convenience is worth it. I also find them way more comfortable than the electric pumps. The expression feels more like a hand expression than the forcefulness of an electric pump. Overall for $10 these are amazing.',B07J55V2Z3,AGUGB4FC6VZFMSD5CF33EIJPUARQ
