3,'Keeping your own electronic medical records on some type of personal USB device is a great idea.  Having as many features as possible in the programing is really important.  Also, convenience is another factor.  I think this is a good product, but I don\'t like always having to have this bracelet on me no matter what I am wearing or where I am going.  The other products that look like a USB aren\'t very convenient either.  I like the medical id cards, that have a USB built in the card that I can carry like a credit card in my wallet. I always have my wallet whenever and where ever I go, so this fits me much better.  Also, some of these cards have 2G of memory on them letting you use them for whatever you may want to save on them as well.  Great idea though, all med records will be electronic in just a few years.',B001L74AQG,AEHNXFQDPQM55DNLLBSPSP65QEUQ
