2,'I ordered this for my husband as he has a 41in chest and a 31in waist which fits in both of the products specification ranges. This item looked better online than the other posture braces from a perspective of durability and quality... and I think it still maybe.<br /><br />The brace arrived in the XL size we ordered, however, it did not fit him well. It was an extremely tight fit to get it to stretch for the velcro to fasten. It did actually stay fastened, but it looked extremely uncomfortable; also, with all of the adjusting to match the photo in the directions it took considerable time. Even when intially putting on the shoulder straps, it was impossible for him to reach the torso straps... so this product is most likely always a two person installation job.<br /><br />After all of this effort (about 30min) and several hours of testing, he still felt no need sit up straight... I am not sure why this product does not work, but I am sure that it is a fail for us... so I cannot recommend this product.<br /><br />If you are really tiny, you might be able to fit in this size or a smaller one... just I hope that you find it helps with your posture as it did not help with his!',B08BLK4Z6Y,AFXXNBWCNHQALN6XKWC7Z2JMIKLA
