5,'I bought these on the edge about them. When I got them, I hated them and went to return them. The seller let me keep them instead of paying to have them shipped back. AT this point I feel bad for doing this as I ended up falling in love with them. These things are beautiful and are very unique. As far as quality goes, they are uncontested for the price range. I usually buy ten dollar sunglasses every three month expecting them to bend and snap and buy more. This is not the case for these. They still feel like new and are going strong after months of abuse. When they do die, I will buy another set.<br /><br />Buy them, let them sink in. You will like them. 5/5',B002M3SQH2,AFDHJO3FQVB4BAVKKA55DF3DOQYA
