2,'I am on a mission to reduce my plastic consumption without seriously impacting my quality of life. Or at least, not frustrating me so badly that I want to throw something...Plastic trash bags have been my waterloo, and sadly, that has not changed with this product.<br /><br />They are fairly thin, though they are a bit supple, and I did not experience any rips, which I was sure was going to happen. If they were even an inch longer, I probably would like them a lot more, but the length is such that they are constantly slipping into the trash bin which is just frustrating.<br /><br />Bottom line - my current trash bag is made out of recycled plastic, which helps to mitigate my guilt. I will use these for the bathroom trash until I run out, but I can\'t see purchasing these.',B07XJ1WZBS,AENWFDJTKIMH4447GCH4H4TZQC3Q
