5,'Very elegant and accurate!! I was just at the doctor a week ago and was weighed in at 173LBs, I just checked my weight the minute this arrived and it was 1Lb off (I\'ve been purposely trying to lose 5 more lbs) so It\'s spot on. It\'s Gloss black with Blue LED screen and black numbers, very shny and elegant with rubbery feet on the bottom to allow it not to slip when you stand on it. It\'s so shiny and glossy I don\'t like leaving it sit on the floor since we have two cats and dust is always abundant along with fur and we have hardwood floors so I lean it up against the wall behind the waste basket in the bathroom lol. Seriously though, this is a VERY nice scale and much nicer than ones I\'ve seen at Bed Bath and Beyond for 20.00 more than the regular price of this and it came with whatever batteries it requires to power on. There is no on switch you just simply stand on it to check weight and it goes off a few seconds later so I imagine batteries last a very long time. I couldn\'t be happier!! LOVE this scale! Very modern and would look great in a very modernistic home but also looks good in any old bathroom, it\'s accurate, VERY fair price and looks GREAT! what else can I say! I got mine at a discount sure, why not, but it was in exchange for a review and an unbiased one at that. It\'s be hard not to rate this a 5-star and not mean it. It\'s gorgeous, works perfect and very nice so 5-stars it is! Thank You! You wont regret buying one. No idea why some are saying it\'s off, mine definitely isn\'t. Maybe they got a bad one and should exchange it instead of knocking it a star for something so miniscule. It\'s perfect! A+++',B01EW9V5DK,AEC52UBWO4QBCMRYHAYIEH3XCWQA
