5,'This flat iron is AMAZING, with or without the awesome price tag. I originally ordered it because I thought it was a travel size flat iron and I wanted something small that could also work with higher voltage outlets. While this was actually a full size straightener, my disappointment quickly subsided when I decided to try it out anyway. This glides on strands so much smoother than other flat irons I\'ve used and the heat protected casing that this comes with makes it so easy to pack immediately after use regardless of its size.<br /><br />The one funky thing I will note about this product is that mine will not work if I turn it off, leave it plugged in, and try to turn it on again. I have to replug it in after each use. This was odd to me at first but really isn\'t a big deal in the grand scheme of things. I\'m not sure if its an error on the manufacturer\'s end or if there is some purpose to this but either way it\'s a bit of a quirk that I soon forgot about when I realized how much I loved this hair tool. I\'ve even replaced my daily flat iron with it which was about three times the price. Really great product.',B01GQ85WAC,AEWE7ZYEEV7TMKBURJTFV6SNYRSQ
