5,'This is our family\'s go-to for ALL our joint and muscle issues. We are active and often over strain our wrists (tons of computer work), our knees (tons of steep stairs + two of us in mid 50s), and shoulders (workouts, slept on them wrong, overhead lifting), lower back, hips, etc.<br /><br />It doesn\'t matter the cause or the joint, this WORKS! And FAST. Other creams worked ok, and eventually, but this takes care of pain and inflammation after only a day\'s use (based on applying in a.m. and p.m., and midday if intense).<br /><br />We often \"punch its power in\" by using lemongrass essential oil first, then applying a tiny amount of Deep Blue. That results in extra effective/fast relief for us, but Deep Blue by itself is amazing. We love the smell, and rubs in/absorbs easily and completely. Not oily at all. And only need to apply a tiny amount -- this tube lasts for A LOT of usage!<br /><br />We have given many tubes of this away to family, because we love them too much to watch them suffer unnecessarily from joint pain, when we KNOW this WILL help them. Every single one has found extensive or complete relief within a couple days. Many of them were like us when we first used it: suffered from a chronic pain from an injury, tried other creams, weeks-or-months-long pain, not much relief. But then used Deep Blue, and every one of them were ecstatic at the results. In fact, we just gave this to our plumber, who has been dealing with rotator cuff pain for 6 months.<br /><br />No one in our family is a doTerra seller/distributor, or is in any way connected to, or receiving remuneration or discounts or anything for our usage, or for this review. We\'re just big fans of this and have experienced wonderful, much-welcomed healing and relief, without use of potential organ-damaging or organ-compromising medications. Highly recommend doTerra Deep Blue!',B00U36SD5U,AH3KSNACR3NOIOO6JL5ZVWETXETA
