5,'So far Pretty good. I am obcessed with my weight to the tenth of a pound so the reviews I read about getting on and off with a 5 pound difference worried me. I have large square ceramic tiles in my bathroom and I picked the tile with the best consistency to place it on before weighing and not overlapping another tile. When I let the location of the scale overlap two tiles the result was not as consistent. I also have a real doctors scale (move the weights) that is very accurate that I check it against and it is within a tenth of a pound if I make sure it is on the same single flat tile in my bathroom. If it were off a pound or so consistently I would send it back. That would drive me nuts. The most overweight I get is 10 pounds, so tenths of pounds matter to me. I LOVE that it syncs to my Fitbit.',B0077L8YFI,AESFVQD7ZIHBEXVDVHSETJIWQLUA
5,'I received DMSO 3 days ago and by coincidence decided to use it on my chalazion on the top corner side of my left eye. A chalazion is a painless bump from a healed stye that is filled with pus. I usually get these often when the air is polluted and I end up in the surgery room to have them removed. I was so amazed that it actually healed the chalazion in a couple of hours and there is no more redness. I took a cotton swab and placed two drops on it and directly applied it to the chalazion. This product is incredible. I actually heard about about it from youtube. For those who suffer from chalazions, use it and you will pass the surgery room forever if they appear again :)',B01EU54A1K,AEMLRHYQ5CAE5THWW7OFPO7NJ63A
