4,'Spills and messes are a fact of life, especially when you have toddlers, so it\'s essential to have something on hand to pre-treat the wide range of interesting stains that show up on articles of clothing in the hamper.  This Dreft does just that.  We spray it directly onto stains before tossing our kids\' clothes in the washing machine, and there is no question that it helps get stains out.<br /><br />Note that this isn\'t a miracle worker; some things just aren\'t going to come out of clothes, including stains that are left in place too long before being treated.<br /><br />The pump sprayer is easy to use, and this four-pack is a nice way to stock up at a good price.',B00UFG61T8,AFONENWGNXXIUGGYZKWZ3GPZI36Q
