1,'Not convinced that it works. My wife and I used it during our vacation in Bora Bora this past week. A few things to note: it is late-Spring/early-Summer in the Southern Hemisphere and Bora Bora is located near the equator. The water is almost crystal clear and the sand is nearly white, so we weren\'t well protected from the suns UV rays throughout the day. That all being said, my wife and I slathered ourselves in this sunscreen and reapplied frequently, including after snorkeling. I got the worst sun burn of my life, and my wife didn\'t fare too well either. When we started to use another brand with a higher SPF, we didn\'t get burned further. We didn\'t get many bug bites during the trip, though we weren\'t wearing it at night, so it\'s hard to verify if the bug repellent was 100\% effective.',B0032NNW5M,AFCGIX2X4MAJTGMAYXEWGV4YJNQQ
