1,'TLDR; Size is okay, quality is bad, flimsy, packaging was awful, see photos. Box was very crumpled and not giftable at all.<br /><br />I\'m not sure what I expected, but I sure expected better. It\'s a good size (it\'s big, pretty obviously from the photos), a little smaller than I hoped but still pretty big and chunky. It will stand out. The \"2020\" on it isn\'t properly sanded off. It looks really amateur, which is fine, but it doesn\'t FEEL handmade at all. The \"paper\" part of it is a lot longer than I expected, leaving a lot of blank area, unable to tell what it is from the front at all. Not like the photos presented. It\'s also got lines in it, like it was terribly scraped, which you can see in the first photo. The gift box... Well no, not a gift box, the box was smashed and really messed up. You can see it in my photos.<br /><br />The paper part that hangs down is extremely flimsy as well. Like it feels like it will easily break. I also noticed it says \"Handmade of polymer clay\" in the about this item section, but above that says \"Paper, Plastic\" in materials. To be honest, it feels like neither. Has many bumps, very bad quality for the expensive price. I would not buy this if I were you, I\'d save my money. I ended up paying $22 for this item, that was normal shipping. Definitely NOT worth $15.',B08DFKXVWX,AHZW5EETKM6DKM6OUFWFVGBY665Q
1,'The taste was almost intolerable, however, I drank it.  After three days, I was nauseated, vomiting and very constipated.  I stopped taking it and my symptoms subsided.  Tried it again because I really wanted it to work.  Same issues.  Tried to obtain an RMA to get the promised refund.  No help there.  Customer Service number did not accept calls at any time from 8am to midnight as their hours state.  Plan to keep trying to reach Customer Service.',B00A6JEGUK,AGUMUVO2J4BCXM5UZ4P4KEOCH66Q
