5,'I have been using this for several years! I find it to be so reliable and I always marvel when it takes me awhile to think to use it instead of Tylenol or NSAIDS... this is better than anything I have tried and I have tried many... I have bone to bone in both knees and sometimes the pain is constant and the use of NSAIDS is just not possible as often as I feel like I need them.<br />I use Triflora and the pain just disappears as soon as the gel is rubbed into the knee. I use it for my lower back pain as well and it works just as well there.<br />I HIGHLY recommend it, and it can take the place of over use of NSAIDS!<br />It is OUTSTANDING!',B00014WCBU,AFBVDOINIZ67K3C3LJ4UH2QOCCUA
