5,'I have used this product for about three years now and can\'t be any happier with it. It has done wonders to keep my blood pressure under control naturally and with no side effects. The first time I tried it, I had elevated blood pressure of around 148/90. This was due to stress at work, taking care of my aging parent, and worrying about my blood pressure. Anyway, I decided to try 2 capsules that evening before bedtime. The next morning when I got up and checked my blood pressure, it clocked in at 118/78. I was very happy and relieved. I also did research on Hawthorne, and found that it dilates the blood vessels making it easier for the heart to pump blood through the body to all vital organs, resulting in reduced blood pressure. Blood flow to all vital organs is essential for good health. Also, depending on your lifestyles, some individuals may need to take Hawthorne for a while in order to realize the benefits. Furthermore, exercise and diet is beneficial while taking Hawthorne, as it helps clean the cardiovascular system out. I do 30 minutes of treadmill and 275 pushups every day. A most recent check of my blood pressure last night showed 106/60.<br /><br />The bottle recommended dosage is 1-4 capsules daily. I usually take 1 capsule 2-3 times daily at mealtime. If I miss it, it doesn\'t hurt, as there is enough benefit from previous doses.<br /><br />Now if only we could get the FDA to understand that natural supplements are better and safer!',B001Z1WT70,AFXJSZZ7NKM7PAEGSNXVS243NAGA
