5,'I purchased these after reading that a lack of Omega 3s can cause a child to be moody and have constant food cravings. Since taking these, my youngest child hasn’t pestered me for sweets and snacks between meals nearly as much. I have also cut back her sugar intake by over 60\% and this has helped with her moodiness. Before, she was eating a lot of cookies/ chocolates at dear old grandmas and some at home. I still allow her to have the occasional treat- but I limit it and these great little omega 3 chocolates have been a real help ! They support good nutrition habits for your kids. My son who is nearly 12 has had a growth spurt since taking these, that he probably would have had anyway, but I feel good knowing that I am giving him something healthy to support/build  his body as he grows. They do taste like orange flavored chocolate- my youngest loves the taste - my eldest not so much, but he eats them anyway. I still give a multivitamin alongside these and a probiotic. Consult your doctor if you are concerned. Also, check the label for allergens. I’m buying these again and I’m pleased. Also- I keep these in the fridge, but you don’t have to.',B07YYJN7MH,AHBIP7I52AM3LQXARGIZIFVYWYSQ
