5,'My husband wanted a walking stick as he goes into the woods with our dog. He really liked this stick because it is very sturdy and fits him nicely. The stick has some twists in the middle, and a bottom cap (to prevent slipping). It also has a strap that makes it easy to keep the stick in your hand.<br /><br />The stick comes in different heights: 41&#34; for children; 48&#34; for adults up to 5\'4&#34;; 55&#34; for adults between 5\'4&#34; and 5\'11&#34;; and 58&#34; for adults taller than 5\'11&#34;. It also comes in several colors: black, brown, natural, red and tan.<br /><br />Highly recommend this walking stick. It is sturdy and beautiful in its look.',B06X6LWMBL,AEKLIYDB6LIETDRWO77YCWDUVT5A
