5,'Not bad tasting and I really like the ingredient list except for one small potential problem...if you have a low heart rate, this seems to lower it even more. Although past the half century mark, I\'m athletic and tend to have a low heart rate and lower blood pressure - the beets and some of the other ingredients have a tendency to lower blood pressure and heart rate to levels that are not acceptable...it\'s probably not a huge problem for most people but for those on the low side, use with caution and/or sporadically. Taste is good and ingredient list packed.',B07J3F4V1W,AGLCYFK2SZYTSYVMHA744ZC6AXBQ
