5,'First of all, the owner of the Lather whip brush, AJ is ROCK SOLID in his customer service and lifetime guarantee.  That reason alone is enough to purchase this brush.  I had a small problem with the first brush, the hairs were shedding too quickly.  Within 3 days a new brush was already on its way.  Great brush, will have a animalic smell for the first few shaves.  Eventually the smell wears off from use with the lather.  I use Taylor of Bond Street cream lather.  Ive had this brush for two months, and it is still shedding a couple hairs every shave.  During the first few weeks it was dropping 4-5 hairs per shave in the lather and on my face.  Other than that its a brush with the correct feel, correct stiffness in the hairs, and I think it will last for years.  Excellent price for what you get.',B00QFXVOL0,AHAYT65FJMOKYQQCPMROHQ34X2FA
