5,'This item arrived around 12 and I just had to wash and apply this product on my face to see what all the hype was about. After applying for the first time, all the white heads and black heads had started to slowly dissolve and you know that rough feeling you get when you rub your nose and chin (blocked pores)? Well after using prep for the first time it felt as if I never had those rough spots. I hate the white/ black heads poking out of my skin because its so rough and annoying to the touch and its actually embarrassing(for those who have significant others that love to get so close to your face). Around 8pm i took a shower and once i finished and got to my beauty routine before going to bed,  I used this product once again and let me tell you, MY SKIN IS SO SMOOTH AND RADIANT AS IF I JUST HAD A CHEMICAL PEEL!!! Within ONLY TWO USES prep has lighten the color of my acne scars and the current pimples and has decreased the pimple sizes. I feel a mild stinging and a tingling sensation while applying prep on my skin and it actually feels good because it feels like its actually dissolving everything in my pores. Theres no smell to it (well if there is a smell i couldnt smell it). Shipping was super fast (faster than the date listed). No samples provided though but since im super happy that i found my new best friend (prep) i will most def be coming back to cellbone for more since this product is the answer to my face issues (acne, acne scars, hyperpigmentation, dullness, & signs of aging) Plz NEVER discontinue. THANKS YOU CELLBONE!<br /><br />UPDATE 4/20/2012<br />After using this toner for a few weeks straight i started noticing that my skin was getting way more oiler than usual and because of my skin getting oiler, it caused me to break out. i only use skin prep on my t-zone and chin area to get rid of the white/black heads. the breakouts only occurred on my cheeks and forehead.<br /><br />Update: 5/2/12<br />I wanted to get the same results my tzone and chin was getting so i started to use this toner on my whole face and let it sit for a min or two and rinse and apply a matte toner. Skin is agreeing so far',B000VEMWB0,AEZNF32Y423XKXFJINMUG4CZSFXQ
