1,'I purchase quite frequently on Amazon and have never been let down until now.  There were no directions included on how to assemble this product. The bases are very light even when filled with wet sand.  There is nothing included to attach the 4 colored sections of balloons together with.  The unicorns on the top do not stand up they fall to the side and hang down.  The pump broke half way through the first pillar and all balloons had to be filled the old fashion way.  They lasted for 30 minutes before they fell over and all the balloons blew away. One very unhappy birthday girl = one very unhappy mommy.<br />Would not recommend this item to anyone.',B073QHGYF9,AHXHWBMLIHPKRUL2UBLVHQI72YGQ
