5,'I bought this facial brush years ago and I still love it. It\'s easy to clean and works great in helping to cleanse and exfoliate my skin without doing damage. I don\'t usually use the \"massager\" side with the larger silicone bristles, but the smaller silicone bristles do a really good job at removing makeup and then working the cleanser into my face. I can feel a real difference in the softness of my skin on days I use the brush compared to the days I don\'t use it.<br /><br /> It also has an incredible battery life. I use it every other day, and have honestly only charged the brush a handful of times since I bought it literally years ago. Note that the charger is a USB charger, so you\'ll have to use a different plug or a USB outlet, but I don\'t find that to be a problem. The charger cable is also pretty short, so it\'s difficult to charge in the bathroom. However, I usually charge it by plugging it into my laptop. Even though that\'s a slower charge, it only takes about 1 hour for it to fully recharge, and then I\'m good on charging for a few months.',B01E6NITSG,AGVXF5ND44UD7TMCNWSULANVLT4Q
