4,'As others are no doubt smarter than me, I mistakingly purchased this to clean and purify air in a small-ish work office. Stale, perhaps moldy air was the norm, the GG1000 a hopeful solution to this uncomfortable dilemma.<br /><br />By \'smarter than me,\' I\'m referring to an ignorance that the GG1000 could only sanitize versus operate akin to ionizers on HEPA. After weeks of use, the GG1000 did nothing to improve the air quality in the office. About to send it to the great waste bin in the sky, I gave it a second chance in my poorly ventilated, home kitchen. The same kitchen where cooking anything sends the odor seemingly across continents.<br /><br />Eureka! What once was lost now is found. The GG1000 is a rockstar in this odor killing capacity, albeit a finicky one when it comes to being plugged into the wall. While said plug can rotate, the one is a tad unbalanced meaning older outlets might struggle with it (consider a multi-prong adapter for stability).<br /><br />On the odor killing front, I can\'t believe how well this thing works. I don\'t believe it an overstatement to speculate 80+ percent of kitchen odors are now gone. It\'s a new experience to have a kitchen and apartment no longer smelling like yesterday\'s vegetables (curse you, broccoli!). GG1000, you da\' man.<br /><br />**UPDATE - DEC 2014**<br />Product started sounding like a highest pitch aircraft taking off, 24/7. Germ Guardian stands by their stuff, and - even if out of the 1 year warranty - offered me a replacement at half MSRP (to include shipping).<br /><br />FYI: If you\'re looking for a good small office HEPA purifier: [[ASIN:B005NCB3HY Whirlpool Whispure Tower Air Purifier- HEPA Air Cleaner, APT40010R]].',B000G2BESO,AGYWMGGQ32YMT5CZIFHLE7VLUT3A
5,'Great, good deal',1465874399,AFBQSBELZSEW6OOSODDVXMCJG2OQ
5,'Works perfectly.  Cleans and shines sterling silver beautifully.',B083T9VD7J,AHF3LC7YEID43URONQNQQV2GFXJA
5,'As with almost any supplement, unless you are suffering from something you now are rid of because of taking them, you really don\'t know if they work or not.  My Neurologist recommend this product and explained the reasons why it is good to take.  I have neuropathy in my feet.  All I can say is it hasn\'t gotten any worse.  I\'ve been taking ReMag for about 6 months.  I hope over time things will get better but at least it seems to be holding it a bay.',B01LZLSJ7B,AFHXO4ISLR56M4DECWEKV4N6HR4Q
