5,'This PWO really delivers! It combines many of the things I normally have to add to my PWO and they’re at effective dosages. The scoops are considerably larger than standard, which makes sense when you consider everything included in it. I do not need to combine this with any other pump ingredients, intra-workout or stim.<br /><br />The only single downside is that I do get massive temporary bloating with this. With the pump ingredients and BCAAs, this is pretty much expected with my body, so I don’t deduct stars for it, but wanted to make note.<br /><br />PSA - Even though it’s tempting to be an uncontrollable monster in the gym (as with any PWO) it’s probably not a great idea to take this every day - be smart and stay strong!',B0756KY3VR,AFOETLUFMYHUURSPZW64RGKWLL5Q
