3,'I\'m 70-years-old and in good health, but my get-up-and-go has gotten up and gone. This provided the promised energy — and then some. It raised my pulse rate and gave me chills. So, I tried only using half, and that also proved to be too much. Eventually I was down to a quarter of a glass. Still too much. By way of comparison, Bang feels much weaker to me. Maybe it\'s my age, maybe there\'s an ingredient in it that doesn\'t agree with me. But don\'t start off with an entire can, as I did. As for the cognitive enhancement, it didn\'t give me any.',B087YSDGH8,AEYJL5G3OX6NWM5VSUK5WAHHDNPA
