4,'We use this is scenes with my SO. If you want a realistic looking dildo to wear, this one is great. It looks and feels real. Nothing about it is exaggerated (veins, coloring, shape, etc.) If you wear it out packing, it\'s noticeable but not super obvious because the length stays within normal jeans. It looks good in photos but not any that I can put on Amazon, lol.<br /><br />It works for vaginal intercourse but is too flexible for anal penetration *unless* the receiver is worked up and stretched fairly well, IMO.<br /><br />The cord is OK for now, as I loop & tuck the controller around my harness strap. It looks like it will snap off over time. I\'m going to reinforce it with strong glue to prevent it from cracking or pulling out. The dial on the controller spins really easily - almost too easily - so I wonder if it\'s going to hold up over time. I hope it does because this toy has been fun to use for the past few weeks.',B07GB4F92D,AGPWOAP6AQMZBGXGAMONUTG6MUPQ
