4,'We used these 2 years ago for my son. They worked amazing and I never had any issues with them. Now that he needs them again after a stint with glasses, I wanted to order the same brand. I am finding they switched their formula to a pain free removal, which I can understand would be helpful for children wearing something around their eyes. But they just don\'t stick well at all for me. My son has to wear them for 1-2 hours a day and almost immediately the patch is coming off (similar to putting a bandaid on wet skin). Sometimes I can get it to stay by resticking constantly throughout the hours, other times I have to get a completely new patch. Overall they work for their purpose, and they aren\'t too painful to take off (they still tend to stick to his skin on the temple side but nothing drastic). The prints are cute. I wished they stuck a little more securely.',B095SZYMTZ,AGRKYVIA4D3QF5GSM6ZSU3LMQO2Q
