5,'Bought this baby at a lower price on eBay a month ago. This massage chair is money well spent. It\'s an attractive and comfortable chair. I\'ve own this chair 1 month to the day and love it! It fits my 6 ft 3 in 235 lbs frame well. Of course my legs doesn\'t extend completely out in the zero G position but it extends far enough with a slight knee bend which still allows for my calves and feet to get a good massage. The foot rollers can be painful if you have normal or tender feet. Just put on extra socks or fold a towel and put it on the rollers for extra comfort. The extra long massage track is perfect! It reach the top part of my neck all the way down to the upper part of my thighs! Very strong massage and very nice looking chair. It\'s even comfortable to just sit in and watch TV. You won\'t be sorry for purchasing this massage chair. Speedy delivery. Came a day earlier than promised. Easy assembly. Just attach the leg assembly and you\'re good to go! I use this chair everyday and it feels great!',B00YGKYJGG,AEPTSXWLLE5UZOF3XSSV4Y6CAQNQ
