4,'This seems to be a gem. I was skeptical about getting it because I was afraid it would be unstable on the side of the tub. It turns out to be very stable and fairly heavy duty. My bathtub is a particulary tall step and I\'ll be having hip surgery soon, so I wanted something to make it easier to get my leg over the edge of the tub without having to step up. Plus, my bathroom is a bit too tight for a transfer bench. This seat seems like it will work really well. I gave it 4 stars instead of 5 because I haven\'t had it long enough to rate its durability and long term performance, and while it seems steady, I don\'t think I would use it if I was more than 200 lbs or so. Nevertheless, based on an initial trial run, this is an awesome little seat.',B00VKVH312,AHLL7OZIWSDDE3QTRMR7KJLGPMYQ
