5,'This spray is a miracle-worker for stinky shoes. Here is our background before we started using Sprayzee. My husband had major funk issues with his shoes. The smell was terrible and embarrassing if  he needed to take off his shoes in front of other people. We tried buying several pair of shoes and alternating them but that didn\'t work. We were getting desperate. My husband even started feeling nauseated at the smell after several hours in his office.with his shoes.<br />We saw Sprayzee on amazon and its high reviews. We ordered it and sprayed it ~7 times in all his shoes (leather dress shoes and tennis shoes). The shoes only smell like Sprayzee which smells like a natural citrus-mint essential oil. We love that the shoes don\'t stink anymore! We are very happy with this affordable solution to controlling shoe funk. It\'s super easy to use. Just spray inside the shoes toward the toe and also toward the heel and let it dry overnight. It would be nice to have a travel friendly size because we aren\'t going anywhere without this stuff. I definitely recommend this.',B01LYCSJM8,AHMQDVFVAP3UEPGPKG6UNDMGZM5A
