5,'Where has this product been my whole life? I am highly impressed with my new Boot Tray & Mat Multi-Purpose Premium Quality with Anti-Slip Pads. I ordered this tray with the sole intention of using it by the front door for shoes, however, this tray is multi-functional and can be used for so many things (as I will explain below)! As a boot tray, it generously accommodates our family shoes -  2 pair of adult shoes and 3 pair of children shoes. I love the high sides, which keep the leaves and grass from our shoes in the tray and off my floors. I also love the raised edges, which makes picking it up to take it outside and clean a breeze. This boot tray has saved my sanity!<br />But I\'ve also used the Boot Tray & Mat Multi-Purpose Premium Quality with Anti-Slip Pads for other things - I allowed the kids to play with their Legos on it (no more stepping on Legos) and I used it to carry our food outside for a picnic (all prior to using it as a boot tray, of course). I plan on ordering a few more for the sheer durability and multi-purpose functionality. I highly recommend the Boot Tray & Mat Multi-Purpose Premium Quality with Anti-Slip Pads! I am very pleased with my purchase and know you will be as well!',B01A06XK0U,AG4CN3YSAKJ3EVNJSJKLIPFR4PWQ
