5,'I have two permanently damaged knees due to an athletic accident. Besides chronic pain, my balance has been affected resulting in far too many falls. I have tried a variety of knee braces and knee supportive devices. These neoprene (I think) braces have by a large margin the best combination of compressive support which eases the chronic pain, knee protection should the wearer fall-it would be virtually impossible to cut or scrape open the skin wearing these and finally, the key to using supportive devices- these are very comfortable,light, flexible,do not hinder movement and are easy to wear for long periods. Outstanding item that combines the best elements of other knee supporters and devices into one knee sleeve. Could not be more pleased with these sleeves after a multi-year search for the &#34;right&#34; compression sleeve and knee protector. Will gladly buy from this vendor again.',B00RKGY594,AHSXZNG2EY46Z3UELW4JRX6OKEGQ
