5,'This is the perfect little grooming tool for my husband and me! I absolutely love that it is rechargeable so we never have to spend money on batteries. I also love that it doesn\'t require a charging dock. I hate having a cluttered bathroom counter top and not having a charging dock out makes me happy :-) It comes with a charging cord, but it does not have to be attached to the cord to work once charged. It is great not being limited to just using the cord and I can take it in the shower with me. This trimmer is small, compact, and easily fits into our drawer when not in use. It would be great for travelling with, as well. Since it is aluminum, it is lightweight and does not get tiresome to hold. The nose trimmer attachment works well and is not painful whatsoever. I like using the clipper attachment to cut the hairs on the back of my husband\'s neck in between hair cuts. I also use it to trim my bikini line and it works well. The two attachments are really easy to take off and switch. Everything about this trimmer is convenient and you really cannot beat the price! I seriously love it.',B01IV6C4FS,AGR4XG6U27YTDSQZHOBAFM3TEPIQ
