4,'I have recently developed cystic acne at 25, with no history of breakouts. I tried everything from changing my diet, increasing water intake, switching skincare products, nothing worked. I bought this after I remembered getting an actual plastic shard in a pore that closed up and finally popped out a year later.<br />First of all, for the price, this is surprisingly effective. I plan to purchase a stronger one, but this is super insanely easy to use.<br />Second, the the few times you use it, be prepared for a LOT of oil, dirt, and sebum to show up. I regularly use an extractor tool, but this got SO MUCH STUFF out.<br />3. It\'s actually helped clear my skin up. I use it every couple days on problem areas. I use an extractor to open the clogged pore, and this to suction it out. It heals 10x faster than if I drain the pore with the extractor or squeeze it out.<br />Again, not super strong, but it works, and my skin it happy.',B01EUZDZRK,AG2ADZPMNGOFH3FUM6643JRQ7ZAQ
