4,'Thanks to Smiley360 I was able to get a sample of Crest Pro Health and try it out.  I really enjoy using this toothpaste and you can tell a difference after a few days of using it.  My teeth are whiter and feel really clean after I have used Crest Pro Health.  My only problem and it may seem picky but I think it is too runny compared to other toothpastes that I use.  It seems to fall off the toothbrush easily.  I guess this could be caused by a warmer room temperature but my other toothpaste do not seem to have this problem.  I have always used Crest for almost all of my toothpaste needs so I have never really had an issue with any of their products.  Thanks again to Smiley360 for letting me try it out for free.',B001JJ69RE,AHDGQD4JADPLF2OR352GX6JGWDSA
