4,'I love love this product. Probably my favorite baby item we own! It was a gift from a friend who loves hers and used hers with two kids! I am sure this one will be with us for the next baby too.<br /><br />It is so convenient to have all of our diaper and bath supplies all in one place.<br />Our baby is almost five months old and still fits on the changing table top. We keep it next to our whirlpool tub and drain it there after every bath without a problem. You can wheel it around and it is easy to clean!<br />I didn\'t give it five stars because it only opens on one side, and when you move it the wheels sometimes disconnect from the top.<br />But I wouldn\'t let that stop anyone from buying it. My husband loves it and we recommend it to anyone I know that\'s pregnant!',B001F6L3MM,AEJX7N7AGV2EL7C6P5BAIVF2XRQA
