4,'Product: Back Shaver - Back & Body Shavers for Men, Replaceable Blade Heads, Ergonomic Long Handle<br /><br />So far, this product has worked well for grooming myself.<br /><br />Although not adjustable, the handle is quite sturdy. I’m able to reach where I need to, but folks who aren’t flexible may have trouble.<br /><br />The shaver head is made up of two cartridges, and each cartridge has 6 blades. Although the blades are sharp, this won’t work for thick/dense hair - the blades are too close together and clog frequently.<br /><br />One downside is the attachment head isn’t engineered to fit industry-standard, store-bought razor heads. The product listing has replacement blades for sale, but I’d prefer the flexibility of buying my own razors.<br /><br />Overall, I’m happy with it.',B0BJV53CYT,AETUKJQHKUHYWMERPAM6ODRDQD2A
