5,'I had been trying to solve my problem of bleeding gums for a year and a half. Tried visiting the dentist for cleanings every 3 months. Tried dental rinses, tried a water-pik. Tried oil pulling. Nothing worked. Very discouraging and scary. Used this product for 2 weeks and the bleeding stopped! Have been using it daily for 7 months now. The entire consistency of my gums has changed!! No hint of bleeding. Even my dentist and hygienist are amazed. They didn\'t want to believe this product would make such a difference after 3 months. After 6 months, they are both convinced that it is because of thus product and want to recommend it to other patients. I will continue to use it daily for the rest of my life!!! Thank you!!!!!',B01HALC482,AHORN5RW7D26C3C7MX5XW4UT76PA
