2,'I ordered this product based on all the positive reviews I read from others who had purchased and consumed this product. I took one pill one hour before eating lunch. My food tasted weird, even the water I was drinking tasted like metal. I was only able to eat less than half of the meal because the food tasted so different when I realized that the taste in my mouth was getting much worse. I ended up puking up all of my food. Then I had a terrible headache for about an hour afterwards. Needless to say, I did not take anymore. I did give the bottle to a co-worker and she had no side effects from it. I do have a very sensitive stomach and not sure if it was the capsule that made me sick or the green coffee bean extract. I have taken pills before that made me sick because of the gelatin that the capsule was made from. So in all fairness to the green coffee bean extract, I do not know which of the two made me sick.',B007TCQ6H8,AGNWHAUJPZLNYGRDYWW5RLG6BYXQ
