5,'When I first received the tray and associated bentgobox I thought it may be a little small, however, once I made my daughters first lunch I realized it is the perfect size! Everything has a designated section. And I like the fact that little plastic bags are not needed. Each section is completely leak-proof once closed and is extremely durable for those 4 year olds who walk in and toss their lunchbox on the floor :). My daughter doesn\'t have to worry about her mini sandwiches tasting like ranch dressing or watermellon juice (or both - ick). My only complaint is that it can\'t fit a full sandwich in the large slot, however, if you are creative and get a few sandwich cutters, it can totally fit the sandwich, just not traditionally. Two Hawaiian sweet buns fit perfectly. This is the extra tray (added perk so you are not buying multiple bento boxes) so if I don\'t get the dishwasher started one day, we still have a second that we can pop in and she doesn\'t miss her home lunch. Dishwasher safe is a great perk! Love this and enjoy putting love into each of her meals.This review is very similar to the bentgo box review due to the fact we use these interchangably and I want to make sure people know how great they are!!',B00QVSLE3M,AFZ7BYEIE6KDPQ5W4JLN6DDLUQCQ
