5,'I do not recall writing a review on Amazon before about a product, but Cellbone PREP is GREAT!  I am so impressed with this product.  I NEVER believed in using a &#34;toner&#34; - EVER.  I am a product addict and cannot compare this to another of its kind.  This may not be the best product for sensitive skin.  I experience a tingling, slightly burning sensation after I apply this, which is what I want.  I am now a firm believer in the importance/use of a toner after you completely cleanse your face and neck. I make sure this PREP is completely dry/absorbed and then move on to a serum and moisturizer.  I took a chance on using this and incorporating it into my skin regimen because it got so many good reviews and I had heard good things about Cellbone.  I will definitely re-order this before my current bottle runs out.  It\'s too soon to notice any visual effects, so I plan to update this in 30-60 days.',B000VEMWB0,AENMY2LNJQJTT3CKH2O4YSGPI4KQ
