3,'Let me be the first to say that I am not one to write a poor review and I wouldn\'t say this is a poor product but I do think people should know what they are getting.  Customer service and the nutritionist are very very nice and responsive despite being in the path of a hurricane. We found the results to be very very broad. For example, the results said my child was intolerant to bread. The company does not test for certain ingredients in the bread so the intolerance source is still unknown. Could be flour or yeast or gluten etc. There were other similar results i.e. Butter,noodles. In the end we knew she had intolerances already. We should have just taken the blood test for more specific results but we were trying to avoid pain.  Again great customer service just was hoping for more defined results.',B0731CN744,AG7FPELUQS6WHGV3XUT3E3MICVYQ
