5,'I sat on ordering these for a while fue to the lack of replacement parts, but Lengendairy sells this same system under their own name (for more $) and has replacement parts, so I went ahead and ordered this. I cannot say enough how happy I am! These work soooo much better than Freemie which I have used since 2019. The soft funnel makes for more comfortable pumping and the internal backflow protection is awesome! I used some hacked Spectra-type backflows from Maymom in my Freemies (1st gen) to make them a closed system. Much easier having it built in. The silicone cups seal well and make pouring out the milk easy because you can press on them. I\'ve spilled a lot less doing this than with Freemie. I also think these are less noticeable under clothes. I have G sized breasts, so everything is noticeable but these are rounder than Freemie and IMO a more natural look. I use these with both my BabyBuddha on the go and my Spectra at home. I am able to lower the pump suction from max to half with these since they seal so well.<br /><br />Get these. They make pumping so much easier.',B08HVF8GYN,AG4GNHABQ7DVDHNH52V7BIN3V5WQ
