5,'I just got this today and honestly I’m a little skeptical, but I see these neck “slings“ advertised and popular and my neck is one of the places that my morning exercise routine can’t stretch. This seems a little easier to use and store than a sling. And since getting older, I’m feeling a little arthritis maybe and lots of crackling noises that I think are from childhood abuses and sports. And it makes sense that stretching any muscle or spine area is going to loosen it up. So let’s give it a try. It’s a simple device and 10 minutes a day is easy. I would warn about going slow your first time as your spine is everything and you don’t want to do anything to affect it negatively. That being said, day 1 feels good . I even put it behind my head in my chair for awhile as the chairs have no real support for the neck. I’m hopeful 🙏🙏',B08P8913N3,AHBE7NQAPR7F7FSXPHT2JQOX3IYA
