5,'Great Nature Classics (from Blue Poppy) is a well respected company in the Chinese Medicine community. I\'ve taken their herbs myself and ordered many of their formulas for my patients. They are cGMP (certified Good Manufacturing Process) so you know what the bottle says is in there is actually what you\'re getting. Taking this formula post motorcycle accident was my first experience with Chinese Herbs. I had been run over by a car on the freeway after my motorcycle had broken down and I broke my left Tibia and Fibula in 3 places. The swelling and pain was horrendous. It took about 5 days for the formula to kick in, but suddenly I realized I was sleeping better at night and my leg wasn\'t getting nearly as swollen. I couldn\'t believe it was the herbs that were helping so much when Vicodin and ibuprofen did so little to help, but eventually I ran out of the herbs and within a couple days the swelling started to slowly return. This is part of what really encouraged me to complete a masters degree in Traditional Chinese Medicine and become a licensed practitioner.',B07V27M4ZP,AFH7VNXOLZBMPQGT6UY25BO45CEA
