5,'Provides the highest potency at the least cost of any multi-vitamin that I could find. Folate replacing folic acid is an example of their attention to the latest research.  In contrast to anti-supplement publicity, taking a multi-vitamin every day is recommended by Doctor Oz, PhD Bruce Ames and PhD Rhonda Patrick as well as many others, all of which you can view on YouTube confirming my statement.  The corona virus can\'t reproduce if the cells have adequate zinc & vitamin D3, both of which are in this supplement.<br /><br />Anti-supplement proponents ignore the fact that soils are depleted with nutrient content down 40\% as tracked by the USDA.  For example, table salt was iodized because iodine wasn\'t in the soil and the goiter belt in the US is from lack of selenium in the soil.  Research has also shown that telomere shortening in our cells, which gauges our rate of aging, slows with a daily multi-vitamin, according to various health oriented MD\'s.  I\'ll be taking this product the rest of my life along with real food consisting of primarily colorful vegetables.',B0165US6E0,AEQFOQUHUOAL7EXT26MPEZYAE7DQ
