5,'I had a gastric bypass almost 1 year ago. I liked pretty much all protein drinks before surgery but after surgery this is the only one I like. It has a light chocolate milk taste which is wonderful...not chalky or gritty. I don\'t care much for the vanilla but the chocolate is great! It has more calories than allowed right after surgery but I have been drinking it for about 2-3 months now and am still losing a little but feel a lot stronger and a lot less tired when I drink 1 a day.  I even brought a bottle to the bariatric program &they are going to recommend it to people!  Way to go Attitude Drink Company! I hope this catches on & doesn\'t get discontinued...LOVE it!',B004AWD1CS,AFNPMPJMP776GSNCW2KSE2GQGJ6Q
