2,'We got two of these chairs in order to be able to lay out and sun, both face-up and face-down, and the reading hole make sit nice to lay on your stomach and read, or even just talk and not have to have your head turned 90 degrees.<br /><br />However, two problems with the chair.  First of all, the folding nature of the chair is very awkward, and we regularly got our fingers pinched just trying to move the chair around.<br /><br />Worst of all, though, is that after a year the fabric simply fell apart and tore at the seams, on both chairs.  We rarely used the chairs, so it wasn\'t from wear and tear, it just seems like the fabric can\'t take the elements, which is ridiculous for an outoor chair.',B001A0Y7EE,AFDQNDRLLF47MO5CYI7PMLYSC2QA
