5,'I\'m extremely grateful. Honestly I can not offer positive proof that it worked as the name implied, &#34;Expand Your Mind&#34;; however, I can say what happened since I began using it. Many serious problems accumulated over the years have given me severe & chronic depression, and many physical ailments. Every time I made a progress, it seemed or actually moving backward 10 steps. My state of mind was mostly confused and angry which ruined my life - in two occasions I lost my 2 homes. I always felt misunderstood and isolated from everyone... Enough said. I trust that get the point. In the last couple years, I began to explore the magic realm - glad I did. Not sure if this particular oil or the combination with others, all from this company, that is / are credited to the positive changes. Like a light bulb got turned on, I started to see obvious things / solutions / ways out that were always there - cleverly concealed in plain sight of course. I\'m not going to tell the many horrid I endured - they only offer confusions to any conversation. I now can see clearly my adversaries, their modes of operation, tools and techniques, and I have a chance, a small hope / path of combating to overcome them.<br />I personalized the oil by clean it in the morning sun for 3.6 to 4.5 hours (use your favorable number, and use that as a guide for how long it need to be clean). Some people use moon light if they are govern by the house of Venus. I then infused with a part of me such as pieces cleaned nail clipping, cleaned whole strain of hair, or an appropriate part such as whole hairs from foot or any part of the leg for the Road Opener oil, whole hairs near the mouth area for the Do as I Say oil, whole hairs from arm and temple area for the Helping Hands oil., etc. In the morning I put on the oil or oils that would help me accomplish the scheduled tasks for that day, to the area suggested such as Expand your Mind oil to the temple, the third eye and crown chakras. I then sit and clear my mind of all to focus on the directing the oil spirit into the part of my body, the mind. I\'m a novice and don\'t have an array of technique of a practicing wizard. I tested this method with the Hummingbird oil, and did see a clear result. Strangers, people I met at a market place show clear interest by walking up and start conversing with me - this never happen before. Thank you Indio',B00A7FIGJK,AFFOHUOFTIKEJNR2P5Z4MSF2KP3Q
