3,'I purchased this product because I was looking for something to help me concentrate and focus. Not so much for gaming, but for trying to get work done and be productive in general. For starters, when you open the powder it has a very artificial smell to it. It does kind of smell like green apple but it is very fake smelling. As for the taste? Just not good at all. Maybe I should have tried another flavor but this one is just hard to take. It is very artificial tasting, very sweet and leaves an odd aftertaste in your mouth.<br /><br />Now when it comes to overall effectiveness of the product, for me it was just eh. I was able to accomplish what I had wanted to get done (Some work as well as things around the house- dishes, laundry, vacuuming, etc.) but was by no means blown out of the water by this product’s effectiveness. Yes I was able to concentrate, focus and critically think, but I am not sure whether that was from the product itself or if it was more of a placebo effect. To be honest I was expecting more. Yes I had energy, was able to process clear thoughts and was able to multitask but for me it was about the same as drinking two cups of coffee.<br /><br />Overall- yes the product worked but it wasn’t a game-changer in my book. I was a slightly more focused, a little faster with reaction times and was able to think a little more clearly. But the difference this product makes is far from drastic. The changes it had on my brain were between minimal and average. The slightly underwhelming results, coupled with the dislike for the taste mean that this is not something I plan to purchase again, unless some improvements are made. The results were not significant enough for me to purchase this product again.',B08968BVFS,AEFAW3YW3IUXD2YTIULK3MJL4X3A
