5,'This is one of the best brands of fish oil out there.  I take it for aching joints, dry eyes and dry skin - and it works!  I use 1 tablespoon a day with my evening meal.  If I forget to take it for a few days, I really feel it in my back.  I\'m only 45 years old - so a wide range of ages can benefit from this product.  There is some bad press on fish oil....I just know that it works, and that\'s all that matters to me.  This is a high quality product - so I\'m not too worried.  This product has a pleasant taste - the orange flavor is light and not overpowering.  There is no fishy taste at all, and I don\'t burp fish oil like I do with the capsules.  I think you will be pleasantly surprised with this product.',B001LF39S8,AGQW2ZO6LOYZMRZ7JKDM6LIGM44A
