5,'I am postmenopausal and am dealing with hormone fluctuations and hot flashes.  I steer clear of medications that have side effects, so I am always trying to find something more on the natural side.<br /><br />The cream is light and does not leave a greasy feel.  A dime sized application is used twice a day.  Being a user of essentials oils, I find the natural scent pleasant and it does not linger all day long.  The progesterone comes from wild yams.  Application is to the inner thighs, inner arms, abdomen or chest area for best results.<br /><br />It did take a couple of days for me to start feeling a difference and I will continue use to see how it impacts me in the long run.<br /><br />Disclosure: I received this item free or at a discount for my honest review. I received no payment or monetary compensation for this review. Even though I received this product free or at a discount it does not influence my opinion of the product. If I accept invitations to receive items to review, I post my opinion and experience (with the product and seller/customer service) as a consumer and not an expert. I want to help others by providing reviews that give my personal experience with the products that I buy on Amazon. Your experience with this product or seller may differ. If you have any questions regarding my experience, please feel free to ask. [...]',B019TDGPN4,AHLTKTVMEDC6YZKA7WS5J5WD3ZNQ
