5,'I work a Monday through Friday job and get up in plenty of time to get ready, but on the weekends I am always on the go.  Every weekend myself and my significant other travel here and there to look at cars, or shop, or whatever we want to do.  This is absolutely perfect for carrying in my purse.  The size is great.  Its about the size of a king sized candy bar when its in its little pouch it comes with.  Easy to hide in your purse.  The plates heat up super fast, I think it was hot enough to flatten my hair in under 2 minutes.  I only wish that the plug was interchangeable so I could take it in and use it if we ended up staying at a hotel or something.  This way I wouldn\'t need to bring 2 along.  But for what it was intended for, its absolutely perfect.',B078JB4KGF,AEOM5SR46RHTHSOKBMTGNDHHQA7A
