5,'My husband has a serious disease which causes terrible pain in his rear end AND requires long trips into the city for treatment 5x/week. This cushion has made a big improvement in his quality of life by reducing his pain.<br /><br />The Wondergel (Intelli-gel) cushions are designed on a very different concept than any other cushion we\'ve tried, and we have tried them all- memory foam, gel, inflatables, etc. Read the production description, and understand that this cushion works and feels differently than other cushions. It took my husband a little while to get accustomed to how it works, but now he loves it. And I love that it works for him.<br /><br />This cushion works so well, in fact, that I\'ve shown it to my husband\'s doctors. The lead doctor on his care team is  looking into recommending it for their other patients.<br /><br />We also bought the Roll-and-Go Wondergel cushion, which is the low-priced end of this product line, and it also works well. For many people I\'m sure it would be sufficient, but for people who have serious pain issues, go ahead and buy the top of the line. I\'m glad we did.<br /><br />A word to the wise: if you live in a hot climate, DO NOT leave this cushion in the car! Excessive heat will degrade the gel and cause it to lose its shape.<br /><br />The only downside I\'ve found: the shipping to SO high! We paid $22.70 for shipping, and I don\'t understand why. Climate controlled, maybe? Miracle Cushion cushion could do a better job of explaining the high shipping charges.<br /><br />All things considered, this cushion is a superior product, and I would not hesitate to recommend it.',B004CUHJSK,AGOUZE5QIIT4SGJTRY2UFLCSLG5A
