5,'Best. Yoga. Mat. Cleaner. EVER!<br />I have two yoga mats. One is an elcheapo that I got at a box store. It stays in my office for when I work out at lunchtime.Typically, I take it home and toss it in the bathtub with some bleach and soap because I\'m not all that concerned if it falls apart. However, my fancy expensive yoga mat is a different story. I\'ve been trying to wipe it down after uses because there is nothing worse than smelling &#34;feet&#34; in child\'s pose. Today I cleaned the mats. They smell so fresh and lovely. No residue and I didn\'t my foot or hand grip. It even made my mat feel &#34;softer&#34; to the touch. If you on are the fence, do it!  Buy this mat cleaner!',B00XQBHJOU,AFBFHDSFYFPUE6YAD4ZIT4BMJSSA
