5,'After using whey protein for more then 5 years I can admit this is the best tasting and most easy to digest protein I have ever had and am happy making the switch. I mix it with chocolate soy milk and there\'s my desert for the day! The consistency at the end is a little strange but I still prefer it over the thickness of a normal whey protein. No bloating or nasty protein after taste thats stuck in your mouth all day. Overall awesome product so far, can\'t beat it with the great taste and amount of aminos your still getting while staying away from high processed proteins.<br />From 5 stars to 1 back up to 5!<br />I got one tub that did not meet my normal expectations for this brand and changed my review from a 5 star to a 1 star.<br />Customer service was excellent after contacting them to try finding out what changed that made the protein unbearable to drink and after communicating with them via email they assured me they do their best to have high quality products. I was able to get another tub that has the delicious flavor I originally loved! Needless to say, I am back to enjoying this great protein and plan to purchase again!',B071ZHN45S,AGF6DKQ7OCIUUGMQKHUVIEXJWZ7Q
