3,'Love a lot of the products by Peak Performance. This one I’d love to return though, but seller policy won’t allow it! I love that it’s nearly 100\% organic, but it is INSANELY sweet (for my personal taste). I realize though, that having been Keto for nearly four years, and trying to stay away from too much sugar alcohols, it might just be my tastebuds sensitive to sweet. I’m not sure what the need was to add 1.5g of carbs in the form of Erythritol, when there’s also Monk Fruit, but I was willing to put up with such a small amount. However, I’ve had to dilute it down to not even a quarter scoop per 20fl! Having to do that, I’d only be getting the series amount of Matcha, if I drank it multiple times during the way watered down. I’m sure many will find this delicious, but my guess is that if you’re looking for the matcha experience you might be used to just drinking matcha, you won’t be happy. Not much left of a matcha taste... (Sidenote: there IS a scoop included. Maybe the review that mentioned that missing just happened to be one where it was missing). Like I said, great company with a lot of great products, but this one is not for me and I’m definitely not happy about the no returns policy!!',B079SXYFQ1,AHIQSSQZR24AREZSMABB37ZMSRWA
