5,'Have been using several brands of cotton for a few RTA’s ( cotton bacon, ctn threads, wotofo) and was looking for a more cost effective option and came across this and figured I would give it a try.<br />The cotton is super soft but seems tough so had no issues pulling thru a mesh coil on a GV Zeus X mesh deck but did have to double up as it’s only about 3-3.5mm and need 5-6mm as mesh wicking has to be tight but I’m not running the GV mesh coils so don’t have to go 6mm plus.<br />If I’m not wasteful  should be able to get 16-18 wicks out of the pack so not to bad, it’s honestly less than say cotton bacon or similar as one has to pay that PACT fee and this coming from Amazon you don’t.<br />Currently I’m running a wotofo .18 mesh coil at 55 watts on a juice from Monster Lab and have had zero issues, the wick on priming seemed so absorbent and I checked it at mid-day and still good and juicy on the wick and no dry hits.<br />I have a few more decks to try it in with other juices so hoping to see good luck and if so I will get a good stash of it as so far it’s great..',B079QH8TLJ,AHJMIKGIY2TBXQ6GTU5EYIDRL4FQ
