4,'My 3rd night with the rings and I was able to keep them on my hands wearing gloves over them to sleep.  They kept slipping off.  They are bulky and a little uncomfortable, but I fell asleep so fast.  It was like I took sleeping pills, but I did not take them.  I just put the rings on and I felt like I had to go sleep, the feeling when you take sleeping pills and your head feels like it needs to sleep becuase it is slighly dizzy.  Thats how i felt when i put the rings on.  I woke up feeling rested and ready to take on the day.  I usually up tired.  I feel a tingling through all the way up my arms when I put the rings on.  I do not know the effect they have or if it works.  I dont know if its a placebo like people say, but I dont care.  I like them.  The first 2 nights, they kept sliding off my fingers so I could not feel their total effect.  The third night, i was able to keep them on, and it made a difference to my sleeping.  I slept well.',B000VV1GOM,AHGIZPCDLZBSHAOJ3B6KCPCDEZ3A
