2,'PQ Wax Ear Plugs for Sleeping - 12 Small Reusable Moldable Noise Cancelling Sound Blocking Reduction<br />The white ear wax is usable and reusable and  works great as a sound blocker.  One square of the white wax can be split in half for use in each ear.  Because the white wax is wrapped in plastic there is no waste, you can rewrap the wax in the morning.  The pink ear wax leaves a sticky residue on your fingers and anything else it touches.  There is waste with the pink wax as it is rolled in a cotton wrap.  The cotton wrap sticks to the wax and you have to have patience to unwrap it in order to remove as much wrap as possible without wasting the wax.  Because of the sticky residue I never even tried to sleep with the pink wax in my ears.',B08D8M37Z5,AGWKWYG65W6VU2GXAP32AKKK5CWA
