5,'I had initially needed scissors just to stop myself from going to the salon for a simple touch up on my hair. My hair is extremely long and thick, and while it is really hard to maintain and sometimes annoying, trimming and upkeep are what keep it as healthy as possible. I was very impressed with this purchase. The scissors are very well made and as soon as I received the package I began to experiment. I first started with my split ends and the scissors literally glided through where I needed to cut. The thinning scissors were a little intimidating because I am not an expert but I watched a quick YouTube video and I am stunned at the difference. I cut in total about an inch and a half and honestly good quality salon scissors make a huge difference. Of course not being an expert you just have to triple check everything is even and how you want it to look. The package also comes with two clips to part and section your hair which is great especially when your hair is as long and thick as mine. It also came with a small comb. Overall very impressed with the quality and I look forward to using them from here on out.',B093PFTPKW,AH7YPI5C2T2VJDDF4PM2PGNRS7YQ
