5,'I purchased 30+ oils and products from Wisdom Product Co., and very please with quality and services. I\'m a novice in mystical world and learning. As a student, this co. is a source for products that doesn\'t break my budget, and send me to the poor house (I\'m already there).<br />I not yet able to grade the oils or product to be superior by magical results, only by apparent of workmanship. I think it is largely depend upon the skills of the practitioner on how to use the products.<br />Compare 14K gold Plated talisman listed for only $2.95 versus $10. from other sellers; 2\" 14K gold Plated money tree at $2.50 (3 or more at $2.25) versus $10. > $14. from other sellers.<br />On my next paycheck, I will get a bunch.<br />Highly recommend this Wisdom Product Co. to anyone who is on a budget like me.<br />Thank you for making these products available tot he public at such affordable price.<br /><br />3/10/2014 It works! Like many of you out there, I\'m having a hard time with the crashing economy. I have $2.92 left in my bank account. I used the oil in the mojo bag, and carried it with me every time get out of the house. In less than one month, my former employer (multimillionaire) who cheated on me on every pay check , sent me a small check (unwillingly). Not much, but it will allows me to get by (frugally). I think this is the beginning of good things to come. My $ earned finally comes! It is small for now, but I hope / wish that the magic continues to work for me, and wheels in a big one before the year end. I\'m keeping my finger crossed!<br /><br />For a couple bucks, there is not much to lose. Highly recommend it -- I got 800 times in return! Hope all of you out there, having tough times, get a break like I did, and hang on to your faiths. Good luck everyone.<br /><br />Ben T. Shimabukuru<br />Descendant of the House of Venus.',B00A7CNS0A,AFFOHUOFTIKEJNR2P5Z4MSF2KP3Q
4,'Much  more comfortable to use than our old one. Fabric is soft and hearing element works great.<br /><br />Only con is that it\'s flimsy so it needs to be repositioned each time you move.',B07W5ZXYY6,AHHS5FULF2RZI47MGZNTECECGDQQ
5,'This is a great pillow and much more than a pillow, it is therapy!! It is constructed really well..very high quality and really beautiful. I was really amazed. I noticed the first time using it that it makes you relaxed, calm. It allows you to fall asleep in a very relaxed state. My greatest benefit is: I suffer with chronic migraine disease; Since I have received and have been using this pillow, the incidence of migraines has reduced by about 80\%!! This at a time when they had been particularly bad. Now, I\'m not saying everyone with migraine will get the same results, but this is what I am experiencing. The pillow is a little different to get use to. You really have to work with it and try placing your head in different positions on it to get the right and most comfortable position for you. The great thing about it is that you can actually remove the covering and place it on a pillow of your choice if you can\'t adjust to the pillow it comes with. This is a great advantage. Personally I found that placing my head high up on the pillow is most comfortable for me and as an advantage the pillow also fully covers my neck and shoulder blades (scapula). This is helpful as I have had major disc surgery in my neck and I notice my neck feeling very relaxed when laying on the pillow. The pillow as a therapy is based on solid science. Negative ions are great !! If you are going to get this pillow it\'s a great idea to do a little research on the net and read about the health benefits of negative ion therapy, also read about what the crystals in this pillow do, what their vibrations are about, what crystal therapy and energy and vibrational healing are all about. It is very interesting and we are learning so much today about alternative and complimentary health care, especially related to energy healing modalities. Energy healing is the coming new Frontier in medicine and health care and those of us who study and embrace it certainly know why.  I highly recommend this pillow as a therapeutic modality. Again, you must take time to get use to it. It\'s not like sleeping on a traditional, soft pillow, but the therapeutic benefits are well worth the time it takes to get use to using it. Hope this review helps.',B01NAXDO1T,AF3MBNRDHTW5NLRPMIYWKX4FQMIA
