1,'First of all, I’m very upset that L’Oréal has seen fit to discontinue the Clairasonic!<br />I have always used the Deep Pore brush on my face! I’ve actually used facial brushes of every type since I was 6 yrs. old! No joke! So when I found out these cleansing machines were discontinued, I figured I needed to buy more brushes! Bad idea! These brushes are not at all like the Deep Pore brushes that I use to buy! They are very very soft almost like a baby’s hair brush! It’s also fuzzy, like the bristles are all frayed! There’s just no way these brushes will really clean deep pores! I would send them back, but there is no other choice! I’ve had my brush for over 12 years & so far it’s still working great! I also know it won’t work forever, so I’m disappointed all the way around about these brushes! In my personal opinion, All the other brushes look totally & completely the same...soft & fuzzy! The brushes are way to soft so they more or less just flatten out on your face while using them! But you gotta do what you gotta do! I’m dreading the day my Clarisonic finally breaks down! There’s nothing else that’s comparable! I’ve looked at others but they are “cheesy”! I’ve had cheesy automatic face brushes that bog down when they touch your face & almost stop spinning! I’ve thrown several of that type, away! It’s sad that such a great product has been discontinued!',B08D6F8J3Y,AHW7CLHOQPVHSRMFGU5KLU45DKAQ
