5,'I am 72 years old and the doors locks were replaced at my husbands mortgage company. I can’t open the door lock at all.  So I buy 5 different things to attach to my keys to see which one works the best.  It wasn’t even close.  This one is the BEST -  I am never locked out waiting for someone stronger to let me inside.  It is sturdy and actually had directions..  yeah- think about it....It actually showed up with directions.  I leave it in my car and when I get to work, I open the door and leave it on my desk until I am ready to leave.<br /><br />I am not worried about a broken key in the lock because I used to keep twisting and pulling and still couldn’t get in.  Now it is effortless.  And this one fits office keys where the other key attachments I purchased ONLY FIT ROUND HOUSE KEYS.  This one fits All keys.',B00ETA8SY2,AFBCWKU6JYWS237IH2CKEPDHGQOQ
