4,'As a long-distance hiker, I have some pretty gnarly calluses on the balls of my feet. The bad thing is, I get blisters UNDER the calluses, so I can\'t pop them.  So I\'m trying this product to get rid of the caluses.  Nothing else has worked.  This actually has taken off layers and layers of dead skin.  I love that part!<br /><br />But now that I\'ve removed most of the dead skin, I\'m having trouble differentiating between healthy skin and dead skin as I use this, especially since it\'s so hard to see the bottoms of my feet as I work on them.  I wish this product had a auto-detector so I wouldn\'t run the risk of removing live skin. Or maybe there could be another attachment such as a small round head to get into those smaller callus areas that are still left.<br /><br />Overall, I\'m quite pleased with this.  I did go too deeply one time, but I think I\'m starting to get the feel of how to move this around to get the results I want, without being too aggressive.',B00FB3DHTC,AHCAD4BJHH23Y2ATNFRTXR5PZ2IQ
