5,'I am relatively new to DE Razor wet shaving, and have been experimenting with a lot of products.  Intitially shaving with no preshave, trying hair conditioner, Musco real Glycerin soap as recommended in Leisureguy\'s book and now the Edwin Jagger pre shave lotion.  I have yet to try the pre-shave oils but when I do I will add to review.<br /><br />First I must say that any pre-shave prep is better than none.  I found the glycerin soap was a great improvement to the shave over the moisturizing hair conditioner.  The Edwin Jagger pre-shave lotion though is amazing, astounding difference over the glycerin soap.  Virtually eliminating razor burn and allowing for a really good close shave.  Smooth through all three passes.  My new favorite, again I still plan on trying some oils, but so far I am very satisfied.<br /><br />Caution!  This product is very mentholated.  If you have sensitive skin or don\'t like the menthol feel on your face this product is not for you.<br />On the other hand I awoke this morning somewhat congested, and the pre-shave completely cleared my sinuses.<br /><br />Summary: I love this product.  Great pre-shave.  Don\'t buy if you don\'t like menthol shaving products.<br /><br />Update:  As I am one that loves trying new items and combinations, I have recently tried [[ASIN:B001G371IY The Art of Shaving Pre-Shave Oil - Lemon - 2 fl. oz.]], which worked well, but I didn\'t feel the slickness that I expected considering the thickness of the oil.  I then applied the Edwin Jagger Pre-shave lotion on top of the AOS oil and had a very amazing shave with little to no friction on any of my three passes.  Given many out there won\'t want to take the time, or spend the money, but as this is a review of products, I hope this is helpful.  If even for the occasional treat this combo is really nice.  If I have to use one or the other, at this point I like the pre-shave lotion a bit better.',B005CISDC2,AFWHM2I7T7DDWVYGOXD5PWLNXQGA
4,'i purchased this to replace a similar product i received as a housewarming present that lasted 3 years before i ran out! it works great - the plastic clings so well and it is so nice to use the sliding cutter rather than trying to tear off a piece.  i am going to give these out as housewarming gifts to others as long as i can find them for sale.  the price on amazon was great too - about $30 compared to $40 that they are sold for at my local wholesale club store.  i gave it 4 stars rather than 5 because when i received it in the mail the plastic slide guide was broken - looked like it had been crushed by the weight of the roll of plastic, but i would be surprised if every box had the same problem.',B001OID26G,AFNUIHDHYDXNYMXM3M5ZV3V32BTA
5,'I was prescribed this brand by a naturopath and have been taking these fruits & greens for months now, I’m a mom of 5 kids and really notice a difference with energy, especially if I run out and don’t have it for a few days. My skin also looks healthier.  The chocolate mint is my favorite of all the flavors.',B0170ORFZQ,AEL3LB7THVG553MEKQQHCP2YZNYA
