5,'This back scrubber is great for those hard to reach places. My arms are just not long enough to reach the exact center of my back and that has always annoyed me. With this back scrubber that is now really easy to do! It feels nice to use and makes you feel really clean. One side is soft and fluffy like a wash cloth and the other side is loofah, so it’s a little bit rough but not too abrasive. The loofah side really helps exfoliate your skin. The handles on the back scrubber are really strong and I don’t see myself having any problems with them in the future. It seems like it is going to last a really long time. Make sure you rinse well and hang it up to dry, so all the moisture comes out of it.<br />I received this product at a discount in exchange for my honest review.',B010L1Z80O,AGS4SPLKU5H6FPB4T6AYYEC4UZGQ
