5,'I was honestly a little skeptical as to the quality of these insoles, but after using these in a horrible pair of boots while backpacking for a week, I can honestly say that these are an incredible quality for the price.<br /><br />I used to have sore feet after just a couple of miles, but with these, my feet weren\'t sore after 50 miles. Highly recommend.',B07PW7GDJY,AHEFYDQU5DCJQMUMHCDPK4W5AFOQ
5,'I bought this product on the recommendation of my coworkers.  This summer has been ridiculous with the rain and overabundance of mosquitoes.  Every time I go outside at work or to exercise I end up getting eaten up.  For whatever reason, I just must really smell good to mosquitoes! I got to the point where I was afraid to leave the house because the bites were becoming more numerous and the itching was severe.  I initially purchased an \"Off\" brand product, containing DEET, which works really well- but boy does it stink!  I did not like smelling like that all day and was desperate to find something else.  I gave the Avon product a try and am very pleased with the results.  This smells more like sunscreen and is not strong in the least.  As long as I put it on, it has protected me from the mosquitoes and my number of bites has drastically decreased.  Since it is a lotion, it is much easier to apply to specific areas such as arms or neck without getting it everywhere- and you are not inhaling half of it like with the spray on products.  Really, the only downside is that you seem to have to apply this more frequently than the DEET containing products.  About every 4 hours if you are going to be outside in mosquito rich areas.  I believe the directions say about every 2 hours, but I found you can go to 4 as long as you are not swimming or getting wet.<br />  Highly recommend for anyone that seems to be a delightful dish to a mosquito.  The sunscreen is just a bonus.  It is easy to use and once it dries you don\'t feel oily or greasy.  Thank you Avon!',B0001ZWPI4,AEOU5FCCQOGGLLAAQB6QWCTWD6DA
5,'This kept my Meds cold for 4 hours at least.  I was thoroughly impressed.',B0089SFJLU,AGFGY7QMXVXBVHFS2F6YJNPER46Q
5,'[[ASIN:B002IA0XNE Breast Enhancement Cream]]<br /><br />I bought this product based on some of the rave reviews I had read but like everything else I wasn\'t expecting much. I\'ve currently only been using it for about two weeks and so far I can say this honestly.<br /><br />1.) It smells nice though its a little on the runny side.<br /><br />2.) This wont deliver any instant results.<br /><br />I\'m about a AA cup and so far I\'ve noticed some fullness at the sides of my breasts but nothing dramatic, I haven\'t went up a cup size or anything but I have seen a little improvement so I\'m going to keep at it and hope for the best. If you\'re looking for INSTANT results this isn\'t the product for you. But if you have some patience and about $31 dollars a month then you could see results after a few months. So far I love the product but it just works slowly but I am seeing a bit of a change so it was certainly worth the purchase. I plan on adding the drops to my next purchase and we\'ll see if that helps but I will certainly update on the Natureday website since it does work.',B002IA0XNE,AFF3C5NBEQEME7KL5OBIZK7XIFGQ
