5,'The Unigear Pill case works great for keeping me on track for taking my pills each week.  I like how I can put my pills in so easily for morning and night for the week ahead.  The pill container looks great and is so easy to use.  The purple and blue colors look awesome!  I really like how night and day are 2 different colors.  I am so happy I will be able to not forget my pills each week.  All I have to do is check the case and see if my pills are still in there.  I like that you also get a pill chopper because I do have a pill that I need to take a lesser dose of.  This splitter works great and cuts the pills in the correct position. I will be able to use this for a very long time.  The case is well made and very strong. The case arrived at my house in perfect timing as stated at checkout. There was not any damage done to packaging or product. Unigear makes great products and this is a perfect example! I would recommend this product to everyone. I received this product at a discount in exchange for my unbiased review.',B018NFBSCM,AF3PRXFZ4SIATCM2Z67AZLGLLLLA
