5,'I am so happy that I waited and shopped around for this callus remover before buying a popular brand. This callus remover works as well, if not better than the leading brand named ones. I received it in the mail and tried it out right away and my feet felt amazing! It comes with two different attachments and a cleaning brush, one attachment is for rougher calluses and the other attachment is for smoothing. My feet are very sensitive due to neuropathy and I work on my feet all day, so calluses are a regular thing for me. I am so happy with this callus remover, I can file off my calluses and feel like I am getting a massage at the end of a long day. I have tried name brand ones and they were not soothing like this one is. I would highly recommend this callus remover for anyone that needs some foot tlc!<br />I love writing reviews on all of my online purchases so that I can hopefully help other online shoppers. I am a regular online shopper and I am always looking for the best deal and quality products for my family. I occasionally receive a discount on some products, in exchange for my trial and my opinion of said product. My opinion is not effected my the discount. I am always honest in my review with products. I hope my review helps future shoppers.',B00US7DS5E,AEHS6G2CYQZIYZYE366UQR7RVPGQ
