2,'Lovely &amp; comfortable concept. I had a apair of these but they mysteriously “disappeared” so I saw this great deal for 2 sizes, 2each at the same price I paid for 1. NOPE, they not very sturdy &amp; they don’t cut very well. I know they are called clippers, but I want/need &amp; would like for them to cut the nail all across, not clip &amp; chip leaving the ends of the nail pointy, sharp &amp; raggedy. Using these took much longer time, I had to use other clippers to complete the job. 2 things mostly irritated me, 1st when they did clip (not chip) the nails, the nail was stuck in between the clippers &amp; it took minutes to get it out, finally I used tweezers to pull it out. 2ndly the nails were so badly clipped, I had to cut them much much shorter than I like. Maybe I received an irregular pair, but I’m not going to bother with returning them. I’m not anxious about trying the toenail clippers, but I will update my review if they work better. I would not be upset if these magically “disappear” too.',B072L2F2NB,AFQKJGINGACO3SGACHEVAQV6GEIQ
