4,'For the price, you get a ton of these, so they\'re great to apply when you know you\'re going to need them. They stay in place for a while and are comfortable while they\'re still on. The adhesion isn\'t great between the glue and the pads themselves, so after a few days of (oily, German-skinned) use, the pads and glue separate leaving a sheet of glue behind on the nose of your glasses, which is surprising, since I would assume the adhesion failure would be between the glue and my glasses. This film is easy to remove and easier to replace, so I\'m still very satisfied with this purchase, but it\'s definitely a short-term fix on my quest to find a long-term one.',B07P4LYSRY,AE5BPDKJCJSW45KCKLIPU4BJGYYA
