5,'I use this machine for sleep, but you can use it for anything: office, baby\'s room, or to study with.  It really drowns out any outside noise like the TV, snoring, birds tweeting, etc. You can twist the sides and turn the top to change the sound/volume. Make sure you keep it on a smooth level surface since any tilt will change the sound to a \"motor\" sound- not the white noise sound that you were hoping for.  There is also a card in the package to register your product through the mail or online.',B000LQI2S0,AE6M6UG656KZGEUF6YSZWEBCQCUA
