5,'A great lip balm that\'s not too oily or overly scented. The multi-use of the balm is so great, especially if you\'re caught in a tight spot. An awesome product for military personnel and/or first responders, or even campers, hence all of the uses besides moisturizing your lips. I am not a huge peppermint fan, but the scent (even flavor if it gets in your mouth somehow) is not overpowering. Lasts a long time, and made in the US with all natural ingredients. It also has an option of keychain attachment for better containment. Stellar service by the provider. Overall, highly recommended!',B07Q6SHHXJ,AGRS737I23DBLXVQDU2VHXRUA2MA
