5,'I am a recent college graduate, and now full-time Web Designer in a large corporate environment. My job requires that I sit from 8:30am - 5pm everyday creating website mock-ups and coding them.<br /><br />Though I have been provided with a pretty ergonomically-sound office chair, I wanted my sitting experience augmented without replacing the chair itself.<br /><br />After conducting a couple hours of research, I concluded the Wondergel Extreme cushion was the best option on the market.<br /><br />What makes the Wondergel Extreme worth it:<br /><br />1) It really does make sitting for extended amounts of time more doable. I can sit the entire day, and only have to get up for bathroom breaks and lunch.<br /><br />2) It won\'t cave in permanently from use like memory foam, or pop like air cushions.<br /><br />3) The sleeve that comes with this cushion makes it that much easier to transport the cushion.<br /><br />4) The gripping texture on the bottom of the sleeve actually does keep the cushion in place (doesn\'t slide around).<br /><br />From my research, this type of cushion made the most sense logically.<br /><br />I say go ahead and purchase this product!',B004CUHJSK,AHYIOGOUI6URK266AT5FTOKJXOTA
