5,'im a 48 year old female, who suffers from 2 degenerated disk, with athritus. upon awkening every a.m. im barely able to walk, til around 10 or 11 a.m. we have changed our mattress 4- times,to no availe.  i also have taken much pain meds to treat the condition i currently have. after trying the mattress pad for one night i was able to get out of bed pain free. shocked with disbelief that a mattress cover with magnets could do so much, i have had the pad for one full week, and the pain in my back doesnt start to even bother me until after 1 to 2 in the day, and the level of pain, having been a 10 is now down to about a 3. and it isnt every day. im amazed, shocked, and relieved that i have found comfort and rest, as well as help. this sounds crazy, but i was worried i might be crippled later in life, the pain was so bad. i highly recomend this mattress cover, but be sure to get the one with 12800 on the magnets with ceramic magnets. you will be as shocked and pleased as i am.',B0012XDGA0,AFXTEC2EHG4RIDED2KBPJQWJJT2Q
