5,'[[VIDEOID:16524c62fecf10bb8e4b63f5592bdc3d]] I originally got this because my mom likes to drink and she takes it too far. I myself do not drink and I stay as far away from alcohol as possible.<br /><br />Before I could get the chance to use this breathalyzer my mom passed away. With that being said Alcoholism is a disease and the alcoholics need a lot of help love and understanding to get through this.<br /><br />I have looked the breathalyzer over and my kids wanted to try it out so I let them and of course it showed that they have had nothing to drink lol.<br /><br />I hope that this tool can help someone to keep an eye on whom ever they care about and keep them from over doing it.<br /><br />The Cymas Breathalyzer has a big easy to read LCD screen and the instructions are so easy to follow.<br /><br />The machine takes 3 AAA batteries and they are not included.<br /><br />The mouth pieces for the machine are on the back and it comes with five of them.<br /><br />I was given this breathalyzer at no cost/free to test it and try it out in exchange for my honest and unbiased opinion/review of the Cymas Breathalyzer.',B01GQ0ZQKG,AHQUUOXWU34PSHKMEWB7XXQJ2ZGA
