5,'I got these toenail clippers to use on my moms toenails.  You can see by the included picture that her toenails are thick and in horrible shape and this is the better foot.  These clippers made the job of trimming her nails much easier.  Yes, we did soak her feet for a while in warm water with some added vinegar prior to cutting her toenails but these clippers made the job a lot less effortless.<br />They were a good size and easy to hold/grip and with the exception of a couple of places on the really thick part of her big toe they were easy to squeeze together and actually clip the toenail.<br />They also have a clear soft plastic (almost like a soft silicone) cover that will protect you from the point on the blades when these are not in use.<br />Since they are stainless steel they will be easy to clean if I need to use them for someone else in the family.<br />I did receive these at a discount for leaving an honest review and I appreciate this opportunity because I now have a great pair of clippers that I would totally recommend to anyone, especially if they have really thick toenails.  Great purchase!',B01HRS3CAC,AEAXLKNJNV227SXPO6NNC6TGFRHA
2,'The orange ones were painful and I couldn\'t even get them to fit in a way that cancelled noise.<br /><br />I haven\'t tried wax ones.<br /><br />The gray silicone \"suction\" ones work best for me, but they don\'t stay in and I bought to wear while sleeping. I still use them here and there (hello winter plows and sidewalk shoveling - scrape, scrape, scrape....), and they work best if you to use q-tips before putting them in because any remote oil on your skin will make it so the suction let\'s go in a short period of time or with any even minor movement.<br /><br />Wish I really liked at least one of the three. The wax I\'d be hesitant to reuse too many times which is why I didn\'t try them because I was looking for a solid set of earplugs to have indefinitely. So review stands the same even if wax ones work well for swimming/sleeping noise cancellation.',B07H2ZXC2R,AGT3Q32LH7XWW7KHBIE3SOLN3DMA
