1,'As a regular Amazon buyer, i have come to expect a certain minimum level of quality from the products that i buy online through them.  These sponges disabused me of that notion and reminded me of the old adage, \"Caveat Emptor\".  Lately i have been unable to find the Scotch Brite brand name wand refills in any retail stores, so i resorted to ordering these through Amazon.  Do not make the same mistake that i made.  They\'re not cheap.  They are absolute junk.  They arrived and i immediately put them to use.  Before i had washed a dozen dishes, glasses and pans i had gone through four of sponges!  They simply fall off of the wand while you are using them.  The glue that they use (or don\'t use) must be water soluble.  Do yourself a favor....order the name brand Scotch Brites.  They may wear out but they don\'t come apart after a few minutes of use.',B089615TP7,AFR6JGHIRHP66QDRN7JM6XHZBDDA
