5,'This arm elevation cube has allowed me to sleep and rest after significant hand surgery.  The cut of the foam allows for friction-free positioning of the arm/hand in an upright (above the heart) elevated position which is critical to reducing edema.  Importantly the shoulder position is very, very comfortable reducing the risk of injury/strain to the shoulder/neck area.  The hospital gave me a different cube which hurt my neck and shoulder and prevented me from sleeping. I called the company, Vidacura, and they were soooo nice.  They shipped it to me that very day expedited at no extra cost.  I am so grateful because I believe this product has helped the positive outcome of my surgery.  Also, because it is so comfortable, I was able to reduce the amount and duration of pain meds.  I am scheduled to have carpal tunnel surgery on my other hand and will use the cube again.',B006OXK35Y,AGXOMJXQK57L26AYBEI32T54375A
4,'I just ordered this product and I am not sure what to expect. I\'m a 24 year old male, about 6ft tall, and about 185 pounds. I have been deployed for 3 months now working 12 hours a day 7 days a week, I have been eating healthy, and working out about 6-7 times a week. In 3 months I went from 208lbs to 185lbs with good diet and P90X/Running. I seemed to have hit a plateau now that I can\'t get past. I may be at a fairly comfortable weight, but I still have a bit of a gut and good amount of flab/loose skin im trying to lose. I started a heavy lifting routine lately and I have been doing a lot of high rep ab work. I hope this product will help me tighten up my core and lose my love handles. I noticed some of these reviews here look like bullcrap, but my review will be legit. I will post my progress after a week of use.<br /><br />Today is Day 4 using the product. Very good results thus far. On day 1 I took 1 pill in the morning with breakfast and felt a the energy boost within 10 minutes. It does seem to be a good lasting energy for about 6 hours or so. Since Day 2 I have been taking 1 pill at 5:00am and then another at 11:00am since my work day is 12 hours everyday. I haven\'t had any problems going to sleep since I don\'t go to bed until 8:00pm. I am mainly trying to burn off stubborn weight, but I actually probably had more water weight than I thought. I went from 184 down to 180 in just 3 days! By the way I weigh myself at the same time every day to ensure accuracy. So far so good I am hoping to see more visible results along my midsection, maybe I will be able to see my 6 pack that is hiding under flabby loose skin from weight loss. I will continue to report my status.<br /><br />Day 4 Post work out im down to 179lbs! Today was Back & Biceps and 20 minutes of cardio. I found myself sweating a TON today so be cautious of dehydration. If you use this product and then workout in he morning make sure you hydrate plenty before bed, even enough to make you have to get up and pee in the middle of the night.<br /><br />***** For Those Looking For A Meal Replacement / Post Workout Shake *****<br />[[ASIN:B001N4A4T4 Meal Replacement Drink Mix Extreme Chocolate 40 pckt]] Perfect meal replacement for slimming down without compromising protein or taste!<br />240 Calories<br />2.5g Total Fat  (4\%)<br />1g Saturated Fat (4\%)<br />0g Trans Fat<br />20mg Cholesterol (7\%)<br />370mg Sodium  (15\%) Average<br />1,290mg Potassium(37\%) *Nice!*<br />3g Dietary Fiber (11\%) *Could use more*<br />38g PROTEIN  (76\%) *Thats Badass*<br />2g SUGAR ***WHAAAAT!? AND IT STILL TASTES GOOD?!?!*** You betchya tastes better than a dozen other products I tried.<br /><br />It is about average price on Amazon you may be able to find it cheaper elsewhere. This stuff tastes great even with JUST water and it is very filling. I get this stuff for free while I am deployed with the military. I lift and do 20 minutes of cardio 4x a week and do straight fat burn / cardio / ab work the other 3 days a week. Drinking 1 of these an hour before workout and directly after my workout is PERFECT. I eat 6 meals/snacks a day about 300-350 calories each meal. This has helped me cut down the initial weight.<br /><br />Hope this helps good luck!',B002R2GVUM,AHRDEHO5VTMQYTRDIUTKYWRZTUXA
