1,'Update 7/12/2017:  I wanted to use this last night but it stopped working.  Last time I used it was 2 weeks ago.  Tonight it wouldn\'t turn on at all.  I changed the batteries and even tried using an external power supply.<br /><br />I had very high hopes for this item.  But I changed my rating from a 5 to a 1.<br /><br />The item itself has a cheap look to it..  Almost reminds me of the old bakelite plastic of yesteryear.  While it\'s not what one would call sophisticated, it does the job admirably.<br /><br />I have a 110 gallon tank that\'s nearly 3 feet deep and this reaches the sandbed easily.  It\'s not a high power motor, but then again, you don\'t want something with that much force.<br /><br />Detritus, plant matter, uneaten food, droppings and even discarded crayfish shells were easily vacuumed up.<br /><br />If there\'s one feature that I\'d like to see on this is a vacuum hose so I can get into hard to reach areas that a 30&#34; wand cannot.',B01EWNJAEC,AH7O7LLFEFH7QSBNW2ALJNNU56MQ
