1,'took one.... ONE, on a Friday night... everything went great, then the next day: bloodshot red eyes, stuffy nose and for some reason, it depletes you of some nutrients so my body was sore. I know what youre thinking: maybe he\'s out of shape! ... NO. I work out 3 times a week and run 3 miles at least twice a week, Im 160 at 5\'6\" so Im at 15\% bodyfat. Im in good shape for 47 yr old. Saturday I was useless because I was still sore all over, went for a brisk walk at the park and BOING! stubby shows up so people stare; Im embarrased, but at night, its all good in the sack. Sunday went to the water park... BAD IDEA, yea; use your imagination. Had to force myself to think about mutant ninja turtles in battle for their lives to make stubby go away. Monday red eyes are finally starting to subside, Tuesday have to put eye drops (gets the red out) to function and my vision is sensitive to light.... how? idunno. Wednesday, back to normal?  Thursday felt better and promise to return the demon candy. I\'ll stick to ashwaganda, longjack, and nitrix oxide mix. works every time with no side effects.  Any ways... good luck boys.',B0958R2T6S,AGMHEQTIQJH7RCNYCN35NJ7EDXPQ
