4,'[[VIDEOID:f0fe9dabda1afeff36c9e78a4647de0c]] This device is so cool!  I love the way it feels on my teeth while it is cleaning them.  The toothpaste has a slightly minty feel to it and as the brush vibrates and cleans, it releases the minty, tingly feeling into my mouth that is quite refreshing.  I like the cleaning mode the most because it really vibrates and I can feel my teeth getting clean although it doesn\'t seem to run nearly long enough to get the job done.  It comes mostly fully charged but does seem to charge quickly and holds a charge for days.  It is really easy to charge, clean and use with just the click of a button.  It has a light that comes on while working and each different setting (cleaning, massaging & whitening) has its own frequency so you can tell which one you are on at all times.  I love it so much, I find myself using it several times a day.  I am using it right now as I type this review out because it can be used hands-free which is my favorite feature, besides the vibrating and the minty fresh feeling.  Although I will admit it is a bit large for my mouth and if I use too much toothpaste, it begins to make me drool a bit but neither is enough to make me not want to use it.',B08CZ3LP5G,AE7P3G7DWP3VVFKOK2H2PPTK2TOA
