3,'so i got these extensions about, two days ago, on thursday. they arrived within 10 days, which was A LOT earlier than the estimated delivery. i was very happy about this!. the extensions were NOT the color shown. they were more of a strawberry blonde, and the clips were different. they were a different color but the type of clips were the ones with the teeth, which i like! the whole color difference isn\'t a big deal to me. they are very thin and there are only a couple of strands of hair that made it to 18 inches. I\'m very easy to impress so this isn\'t a problem. also i only purchased these to bleach them and dye them for an under color or high light. so they served their purpose. but if you were looking for length or thickness these are not the extensions. the fact that only few hairs reach 18\" looks very natural so that would be a plus when looking to blend extensions. so...thats my review. great shipping, thin hair, good clips, off color, but thats okay, OH and they took to the dye VERY VERY well. i though since they were an off blonde, the color blue i was going to dye them, that it was going to show up green, but they are very blue and very beautiful. i was also very happy to see that the price went up right before i bought this set haha. alright, so the extensions are good enough for me! you might not get what you wanted out of them, but you\'ll find another purpose for them. :)',B008HZ521C,AH734AYLFRATR4HF5I3E655W4NUQ
