5,'I have been looking for something to give me a boost of energy, due to my personality disorder and depression, it can be very hard to get motivated. I take one in the morning, and I feel a boost a natural alertness, not like drinking coffee and feeling that buzz, no, it feels like such a natural energy like I nothing was even taken but I have motivation. I have even taken it in the afternoon, or the evening and I still get that energy boost but without being kept up all night.<br />I\'m also on some medications for my personality disorder and my Dr. said its ok to take it with these Forskolin pills and I haven\'t noticed any side effects. Everyone\'s bodies do react differently so these may not work for you like they do something else.<br />a side note- I haven\'t even tried but I have lost weight since taking these. The only thing I\'m doing different is moving more and I\'ve lost 8lbs since March 31st when I first started these. Also, my portion size I can eat has gotten smaller. I used to eat 2 full burgers from dairy queen. Yesterday I couldn\'t finish one.<br />I hope these help you like it\'s been helping me.',B08B1HRVDS,AHYGXOQJSRRITNPJ7UI57MRWNKJA
