4,'I have used this supplement before with amazing  results and this time...I really didn\'t notice anything that amazing.  Now that could be because I am on a new prescription and I am not feeling the effects because the prescription  is counteracting it.  Which is what I  believe to be the case.<br />Now I  do have to manage acute pain every single day.  I had forgot why I was taking the Hyaluronic Acid for until now it is begining to make sense.  I had been using this every single day until about a two weeks ago and ever since then I have had so MUCH joint pain and muscle pain I almost made another appointment with the Orthopaedic Specialist that has been relieving my pain  with injections.  Now I know why I started to get these pains out of nowhere two weeks ago.  I cannot go without this supplement.  I HAVE BEEN  IN SO MUCH PAIN FROM MY KNEES because I didn\'t take this.  It really works.  I do like larger doses than what this Pure Science Hyaluronic Acid With MSM has.  At least 100 mg of H.A. and 500  mg min of MSM.<br />I have Osteoarthritis in my spine and in my knees and that is why a lot of people take H.A.<br />People take MSM by mouth or apply it to the skin, mostly using it to lessen inflammation.<br /><br />They take MSM to try to relieve pain or swelling from:<br /><br />Osteoarthritis or rheumatoid arthritis<br />Bursitis, tendinitis, or tenosynovitis<br />Osteoporosis<br />Muscle cramps<br />Scleroderma<br />Temporomandibular joint (TMJ) disorders<br />Headaches or hangover<br />Premenstrual syndrome<br />Inflammation in eyes or mucous membranes<br />People also apply MSM to the skin to try to treat problems such as:<br /><br />Scar tissue or stretch marks<br />Wrinkles<br />Wind or sun burn<br />Wounds, cuts, or abrasions<br />Or they may take it to try to treat gastrointestinal problems such as:<br /><br />Chronic constipation<br />Ulcers<br />Diverticulosis (a bowel disease)<br />There is a whole range of other reasons people take MSM. This includes obesity and liver problems, high blood pressure, high cholesterol, gum disease, snoring, infections, lung problems, Alzheimer\'s, HIV, and cancer.<br /><br />  Since I wasn\'t quite sure if it was working or not I did not submit my review in the 14 days I was asked.  However,  I cannot just spit out a review when I\'m not finished with it yet.  Now that I am I do recommend this supplement to anyone that is diagnosed with any of the disordered listed in this review.',B01GZYPYXC,AF5J2TFXJ6VIRI3P6YN7Q75YGCVQ
