4,'This is a set of 4 brushes with each coming in their own little travel case.  I personally use a sonic-type toothbrush per my dentist\'s recommendations but use this brush for in-between cleanings and to apply my fluoride gel.  The brushes look very different as to what I am used to using but am pleasantly surprised as to their performance.  The brush is easy on my teeth and gums and provides a good cleaning in between my electric brush.  The handles are easy to hold and are actually a little shorter than my regular manual brush.  This seems like a decent set of manual brushes for me for those in-between tooth and gum brushing as they are easy to hold, keeps toothpaste easily on the brush and makes my teeth feel just as clean as my regular bristle manual brush.  Would be great for traveling.  Glad I gave these a try.  I would make sure you rinse these well and leave air dry.',B0BNWKL5TV,AH64AK6EDWL6EQZ65IZLL77QMYSQ
