5,'This review is for the Renpho rechargeable sleep machine. It\'s a really nice size and every time I see it I get the feeling of a well built product. It\'s also just pleasing to look at. I think it has 10 LEDs but you can barely tell because it just looks like one light ring around the top. You can choose between probably 7-10 colors, have them breathe, or have it cycle through all RGB colors. The sounds are high quality and the speaker was suprisingly good quality because I hooked this thing up to my bluetooth BOSE speaker and they were the same loudness.<br />I really think Renpho chose the right speaker quality and size for a sound machine, which makes me happy.<br /><br />I also think Renpho hit the sweet spot with size. It\'s honestly the perfect size and weight for traveling and the fact that it is rechargeable is really cool. The user manual says it lasts 7 hours on a charge. I can\'t vouch for that as I have only used it on the auto-off feature which shuts it off after an hour. Plus most users will use this at home and keep it plugged in. My only gripe with this is that the volume knob sometimes skips a click (you turn it one or two clicks without any change in volume).<br /><br />Overall, this thing is extremely functional and looks very good.',B085KZJ3J4,AFNJMYBSHJY7N3BKM747QDW4EVKA
