4,'Disclaimer: This review contains adult content.<br /><br />This dildo is a nice 7&quot; toy to play with. Not too long, not too short, but just right. The dildo does have a thick suction base I did try to use in the shower but it kept popping off I\'m not sure it my direction was off or if it didn\'t want to hold very well. The dildo has a very realistic look with a nice veiny ribbed shaft and a realistic head. The dildo itself did not have the same natural feel of a penis or the floppy squish of a silicon dildo, it was a bit tough although it does allow for some flex to it. The dildos head is very solid and rough so the lip on the back end of the tip rubs on my g sport with force to push me over the top. This dildo isn\'t going to melt or wear down with cleaning like others I have owned because, it has a thick durable coating that I think reasons with the toy being little on the stiffer side. I don\'t mind my toys being stiff so this toy brought great orgasms during self play and couple play and it washed up nicely on the end with no areas to trap bacteria.<br /><br />I did recieve this dildo suction cup toy at a discount/free in exchange for my honest and unbiased opinion/review after using the product.',B00QMTU9YU,AER3BQZ74PGUT7F2LMYXZFTI6X2A
