5,'This is a telescoping back scratcher. It is wonderful at what it does. The little metal finger-like protrusions on the hand-shaped end-piece, do an excellent job of scratching at all angles. The unit extends easily and retracts easily, but not so easing that it retracts while I\'m using it. It is convenient to stand up in a pen-holder, alongside my pens, at my desk. I love it and it really does earn those five stars. Of course, with this type of metal design, you don\'t want to use it when wearing a knit sweater or anything made of delicate natural silk, but, for all other garments, it is as fabric-friendly as any I\'ve found. Good luck finding what will work for your needs.',B07HLCGCHY,AEULD6UDDD7XSH2HXR2L6TNRHSNQ
