5,'I love this product so much. I have been suffering from Fibromyalgia/CFS for years, and I really rely on the Macs Team\'s Red Maca powder to help me get some control over my mental abilities and focus. I also find that it really helps my energy levels, and helps me to all around feel a little more like a person again. I try to take a day off every week, and I definitely know if I miss more than one day. It is an adaptogen, so it can sort of go where it is needed (to some extent) in order to help your body out.<br /><br />The taste can vary slightly from batch to batch, but no matter what it is DELICIOUS. I have it in my smoothies for breakfast basically every morning. It sort of has a really sweet almost Carmel flavor, but without that thick sort of earthy taste that I hate about Carmel. It really tastes amazing, and I cannot recommend that someone try this product enough. It is really one of the most important supplements/powders that I use.<br /><br />But if you need even more convincing, or are just looking for more information, head over to the Maca Team\'s website. It is really informative, and they\'re customer service is awesome about answering questions.',B00G6D0I6G,AFW4LRQMVMOKYJN77ANWOQ25IRQQ
