5,'I like all it’s features. I found it very comfortable, easy to breath in, and the adjustable ear pieces I wonderful. I spent way too much money on masks since this whole pandemic started this one is working the best for me. I have the least problem with my glasses fogging with this mask and any of the other cloth masks I’ve had.<br />The wire strip at the bridge of the nose is wide enough and long enough to really make a custom fit to your face. Feels like it’s gonna hold up a long time.<br />That doesn’t mean you won’t have any fogging at all. When it was very very cold out and I went inside to warm buildings, I still had to use a little bit of anti-fog spray have my glasses. But it’s still better than every other mask I’ve tried.',B08N4H1CZB,AG2PTY4C4XMIVRNIKILYLSWSV3HQ
