5,'This sunscreen is wonderful! First, I\'m very sensitive to scents and the smell doesn\'t bother me at all. It\'s a very light and enjoyable scent. Second, my daughter has a more of an olive/tan complexion and this product is great because it\'s not white like other sunscreens, so it blends into her skin well and doesn\'t stand out like other lotions we\'ve used that make her look ghostly. Third, this sunscreen really protects your skin. I have never had my daughter get burned or irritated skin. Finally, I love that it\'s a mineral based lotion free of chemicals that other companies pack into their sunscreens. I would highly recommend this product.',B002ES6Z0K,AGFNZUP4BWGD3YXSUBS5NNLXP7CQ
