5,'These clippers are, if anything, over-engineered. Nice wooden handle inserts, staked with brass rivets like high-quality cutlery. Perfect alignment from the tip through the cutting surfaces. Smooth, polished stainless steel. Very good build quality. Almost presentation-quality metal container, with cutout foam insert for safe handling and storage.<br /><br />What more could you ask of humble toenail clippers? Oh, yes - they\'re nice and sharp, too.<br /><br />I can find nothing to complain about with these, so I\'m giving them all 5 stars. They\'re so much better than the ones you buy at the drugstore or get in cheap manicure sets. Get \'em - you\'ll like \'em.',B08GXBD3B6,AEBAJCFJ43BVA7U2RZ6LZ5GAVYLQ
