5,'I like this Glucosamine Gold Gel. I was very excited to try this.I have a lot of arthritic pain in my knees, hips, hands, feet and toes and I am always looking for something natural for the pain. This is a large 7 oz. tube and should last quite a long time. This contains not only Glucosamine but Indian Frankincense, and Horse Chestnut. It is for using on your joints and is also an anti-inflammatory  and can be used up to six times a day. It also increases blood flow and helps to reduce swelling.  It does not have a bad odor, in fact it smells pretty good to me. It\'s not greasy feeling and won\'t stain your clothing. I\'ve just been using it for about 10 days and I really feel like it is making a big difference in my pain and stiffness. If you find this review helpful please comment below.<br />I received this at a reduced price for my honest review and I am very impressed with this Gel!',B00YGODCCE,AGZ6XREO67IOI6XKJRCQORE7PRBQ
