1,'I bought this scale 19 months ago which is important to note.  For the last 2 months the scale would not work when I stepped on it.  I had to open it up and reinsert the batteries.  After doing this many times I decided to contact Mosiso because this appears to be a design flaw.  You should not have to reinsert the batteries every time you use it. Here is the response I received:<br /><br />Hi  Qinyue<br />We are sorry to hear that , could you please take the batteries out and then reset them ?  Please put the battery in a bit tight to make sure it will not loose again.<br />Kind regards,<br /><br />Lucy<br />Mosiso<br /><br />When Lucy thanks for no help at all.  Did they offer to fix the problem? No.  I guess I missed the warranty by one month.  I won\'t buy there crappy products again',B00JRF4THY,AEJMCK5WAR36WZ7YKG5VN6ONMDHQ
