5,'This stuff was amazing. With some light scrubbing, the floor mats and carpets in my 2004 car look and smell brand new. These were in terrible condition, too. It’s a convertible and the top didn’t seal correctly for about 2 years so the inside was constantly damp. The floor started to grow some mold and smell- gone. There was hydraulic fluid from a leaky cylinder in the convertible top on the floor- gone. Any semblance of dirt- gone. I used a fabric brush on the tougher spots instead of the attached brush, but I did use the attached brush on some spots and it did the job. I also vacuumed everything immediately following the application and light scrubbing.  If you are willing to spend a little bit of time, this product will restore your car floor mats and carpets to like new condition. I actually took my shoes off to drive the car it looked so good.',B003WJCX92,AHLLGC5TK77MP7HGGKF5CJ4VV2GA
