5,'There\'s nothing more agonizing than these night cramps. I would get up howling, frozen with anguish and pain. Nothing helped, and no one in the professional world had any suggestions. It was one of those you\'ll just have to live with it situations which made me feel incredibly helpless. And whenever I feel that way I start complaining to whomever will listen. One night I was having cocktails and heard myself getting into this complaining mode again and, frankly, I was getting sick of it. But then someone said o - just take this Caleb Treeze stuff and you\'ll be fine. O right! Well, I did and it works. No more cramps. I take a sip before going to bed - pre-cramps and that\'s it. Thank you Caleb! Who knew the explosive taste of vinegar honey and whatever else is in your concoction could do so much!',B00CZDMLZM,AFX2PRBV6ZMWPX5L4GSGJEOA4APA
