5,'Bought this on a lightning deal. Because my wife volunteers on a farm regardless of weather, the hot sticky summer days require proper hydration. I was spending twice as much on the 2 well known brands but looking at the ingredients in Junp I decided why not get more for less. The ingredients are much more than just sugar and salt, and I appreciate that. We all know hydration is the key to life, but proper hydration is key for focus, endurance, and muscle control. Flavor is good, it does take a few seconds more to dissolve but it does dissolve fully even in ice water. Those complaining about the scoop... put it back in the way it was sent to you, handle first. And don\'t get worried if you hit something hard while scooping. It\'s not a clump, it\'s a freshness/moisture absorber pack which is truly appreciated if you\'ve ever had to chisel a chunk of your bulk mix Gatorade after its been open for a few days in a humid summer. Definitely buying more, and trying more flavors.',B08MB6H5CL,AE5XBEWOJXKB2OIXSNI4HVFQGQDA
