4,'I always think cotton balls I buy are too large, and I usually pull them in half before I use them.  That\'s why I like these.  They\'re small cotton balls that don\'t skimp on the cotton, and the perfect size for me to use.  It seems like they recognize this too, because usually packs of cotton balls come in 100, but this one comes in a pack of 200.  It\'s the same size bag as well, so it does seems as if each cotton ball is half the size of a normal cotton ball.  I haven\'t had any issue with usage either - it takes off nail polish with nail polish remover pretty easily and also doesn\'t painfully stick to scrapes and cuts when applying medication.  Small but mighty cotton balls indeed.',B08C5D944Z,AGVXF5ND44UD7TMCNWSULANVLT4Q
5,'I am a huge fan of lemon essential oils and have been using this a ton! I made homemade spray for the toilet to hide icky bathroom smells and it works wonderfully! I also mixed it with some peppermint oil, dish soap and vinegar to make an awesome smelling floor cleaner! It has a very strong lemony scent a lot like lemon juice, it\'s not sweet smelling, it\'s more tart if that is what you\'re looking for, but it\'s great for cleaners! It also comes with a very nice glass dropper which is much nicer than those crummy plastic ones! I would definitely recommend it. * I received this at a discount in exchange for my honest and unbiased review',B00O92P0KU,AGL5CWZNLS63ODNTJSTKRUK73KPA
