5,'I bought this chair for my father-in-law, who has had a lot of health problems recently. These problems leave him weak and tired. I thought this would be extremely helpful for when he stays here with us.<br /><br />This bath/shower chair is one of the easiest to put together that I have ever seen. I literally had it put together in 5 minutes and I did it without reading the instructions. It comes with everything you need; and best of all, no tools needed! The construction of the chair is solid and it seems made with quality materials. I have no fear of it breaking easily or tipping. It fits in our standard size tub perfectly and the height is adjustable. This will be a great help to my father-in-law and will hopefully make him feel comfortable enough to enjoy a long shower if he so desires.<br /><br />This product was received either at no or low cost for review and inspection purposes. No compensation for a positive review was provided. All of my reviews are based 100\% off of my experience with the product and I never guarantee a positive review.',B00VO8G3GC,AGIBNRDGNYYXYZTAVO3TZIRQ7KHQ
