5,'It gives more of a wave thenn a curl. Conair was $100 at Kohls so I am glad this is half the price!.<br />Similar results, it just sucks up your hair like spaghetti and spits out a wave.<br />Hold it longer for more of a curl then wave.<br /><br />I have really super long hair.<br />Doing all of it took me around 10 minutes, so take that into consideration whatever is faster for you, automatic or traitional iron.<br />A traditional iron takes me half more of the time. So this saved me time. Also take little bits in at a time.',B01FLYITJS,AFGWR3MJYJRE36F4UQR7HD5G6QSA
5,'This is a MIRACLE worker!!!  Have you ever had a crayon go through the wash!?!? AHHHH!! This gives me nightmares! I’ve ruined too many clothes when a crayon has somehow snuck it’s way thru the wash and dryer.  I have been pleased with how BIZ was working on our very dirty clothes.  It was mostly getting all my newborns blowouts cleaned without having to pretreat, and was impressively cutting thru grease, grim and food stains from my other busy messy kiddoes.  But I’m hands down sold on this miracle worker after this week.  I had a RED crayon go thru the wash and the clothes sat in a sad pile for a week bc I just knew I couldn’t get them clean.  In the past I’ve tried every trick google has had to offer without any success.  I thought, well what the heck let’s give BIZ a go.  Let me preface that there were jeans in this load that had red crayon melted ALL over them, gym shorts that had it melted in every fiber.. BAD!  So I threw them in, no pretreat, ran the load and WAM BAM!  The clothes came out perfectly clean! Like seriously NO RED CRAYON ANYWHERE!!! Say What!?!?  I’ve shed tears over loads that we’re ruined from crayon and now no more!! I won’t ever panic about messes with BIZ around!  This is a must buy for sanity sake!  Thank you BIZ for making me one happy clothes washing Mama!',B00NNDD1N4,AEUHW7YAAWQD7ILSI3M652JSAECA
