5,'I love this heating pad! I use it daily for my back, legs, and shoulder and so far I have zero complaints. The pad itself is large (it covers my entire back and then some - I’m 5’2 tall), very soft, and can bend/mold to the body area you need it for. The amount of heat it puts off is just right. When you first turn it on it is at its hottest but I notice it cools off a bit. Or it could be that my body becomes used to the temperature? And there is a noticeable difference between low, medium, and high. I really like that it has an automatic shutoff after 2 hours because I tend to fall asleep with it on. I’ve only been using it for a month so I cannot speak to the longevity of the product. I’ve used more expensive heating pads before and this one works just as well, if not better, and is softer (and better looking if that matters to you).<br /><br />Customer service is superb, which is hard to find these days. There was a malfunction with the 1st heating pad that was shipped to me and I responded to an email from customer service. A new heating and was shipped to me within 2 days and I didn’t have to return the old one. I cannot day enough good things about this product or the company. I HIGHLY recommend!!',B0778J7MF7,AE2ELTVG4XLIN7AW6LC5W4O2247Q
