4,'The picture is a little misleading it looks like you only get one support sleeve but it is a pair. I use these support sleeves in the morning if my ankles hurt or sometimes I wear them under my regular socks if I feel that I need a little more support during the day. They do make my shoe fit  little tighter since the sleeve is made of  a thick fabric. The box says the sleeves are made of bamboo yarn, spandex and latex thread they are elastic and easy to slide on. I haven\'t left these on for more than 2 hours at  time. They provide good support but leave a indention in my calf after awhile. Over all I like the support it gives and the color but I can feel a little tight at times.<br /><br />This product was sold at a discount in exchange for my honest and unbiased review.',B01ER1APNO,AF34DKDCBW7BAOMRPNMA2SECJDJQ
5,'I\'ve been using Sarralone for about 15 months. It has worked wonders in my struggle to manage some really harsh physical pains. This particular brand is the one I first purchased from Amazon and it had decreased the amount of capsules in the container and the price is a few dollars more than my first two purchases, but when it\'s what you need and you know it works for you, you do your best to come up with the money.',B0013LR76A,AGNPSX2KQSPBKJHQO4BBMNO2OXGQ
5,'This gel is interesting in that it does not lather but instead leaves a thin layer on your skin.  It does offer a smooth shave, but is not a 100\% protection against razor burn.  I believe it has reduced my razor burn though, which is a welcome relief.  I like the aroma of the oils and other ingredients as well, and it has a bracing/refreshing feel.  It is twice what you would pay for a can of drug store stuff, but in my opinion is worth it.',B00027DGSE,AHIKF24ROTG6XMKWBTCNPRB7C55Q
