1,'This is worse than crutches. The handles get ripped out of tou hands when you hit a small bump or pebble. The whole thing also tips to one side when you\'re using it on flat surface. I had to return this because it was not safe to use.',B07S4CGHCM,AFENXHWPBTEVEGNHFRMXIN6DSF3A
