4,'I\'ve been using this in the morning before my morning run. I think it helps with my energy level and maybe a little with weight loss.<br /><br />It seems to be a good product and pure but I would be more reassured if it were organic.',B08L7RZTTY,AGNURT6BJA6DDBXSIIRHPN5AG5CA
3,'I was looking for a powdered Egg Nog drink to wash down fruitcake with. When I came across Spiru-Tein, I thought that is was just Egg Nog drink mix. Normally I don\'t use any soy protein supplements, because I once read an article about nutrient blockers, and don\'t trust unfermented soy products. When I opened the container, the scoop was buried in the powder, and I wound up digging it out with a measuring cup. The first time that I used it I put it on top of water with powdered milk, and had a problem mixing. The second time, I put the water on top of the mix and had no problems mixing. As I was looking for a beverage mix (not a protein shake), my opinion might not be very helpful for people evaluating protein shake mixes.<br /><br />  The consistency was less than great. I didn\'t hate it, but it was disappointing. The flavor was lackluster at best. Mixing was difficult for someone who has to make the product from water with powdered milk. In conclusion, Spiru-Tein is a beverage for when nothing else is available, when Egg Nog is concerned.',B00028PM30,AEVYEXWH4KG4FP4UXU6MOZACK6LA
5,'This is a simple digital scale to use. It has a sleek, clean design and the large LCD display is readable without having to squint or bend down.<br />But what I especially like is the simple &#34;on&#34; feature - no need to press or step on any button or switch - just step on the scale and you get your reading. The scale seems very accurate and is on par with my gym and doctor\'s office. It is also very well constructed, durable and looks good with any decor.<br />This is a good value and I am very happy with my purchase..',B00JRF4TGK,AFBLBHZPHEI3LN5WKJGOUACDPJXQ
