5,'If you have never tried Monukka raisins I highly recommend them. I had never heard of them until they showed up in some organic snacks that I purchased online.  They are sweet and full of tiny crunchy seeds that make them very delicious.  I\'m not a big raisin fan but these are far better then \"regular\" raisins. The ones in the organic snacks were plumper (less dried) then the Vivapura ones but both were excellent.  I will be buying these again.',B00ET8NX1W,AHOM677S27YEU23AJMHCVOE7EYTA
