5,'Already rated the liquid Biz, use it in the washer.  Like the powder to soak my bread cloths.  Because I usually butter the tops of the bread then wrap it in the cloth the cloth gets greasy.  I pour some Biz in a bucket, don\'t measure, then add really hot water, push the cloth down with the handle of a wooden spoon and let it soak overnight.  The next day rinse the cloth well, if all the stain hasn\'t come out  I repeat the process, let dry  Then wash as normal and hang to dry.  With bread cloths I do not want to use the dryer.',B00NNDD1N4,AH4XKZYFKPNC2DHVFJLI7W67TZYA
