2,'I was super excited to start using these hair and nail gummies and getting more of the vitamins and minerals my body needs...however, what the product description doesn\'t tell you is that you\'ll be getting a whole lot more than just beneficial vitamins and biotin in these gummies. Of course, these are mostly sugar, but they also include artificial color Red #40, which research has proven is linked to ADHD and other neurological disorders and is carcinogenic. I simply can\'t reconcile what health benefits I might receive from the healthy ingredients in these gummies with what detriments the other ingredients may cause, so suffice to say I won\'t be taking these regularly, if at all.<br /><br />I did try one, though, to affirm that they do taste good (let\'s face it, nothing with sugar in it tastes bad) and the texture is fine. If you don\'t mind all the sugar and Red #40, I\'m sure you\'ll enjoy these gummies!',B09YK1YPTQ,AEUSDP65VCFMFATYJPSOAFZJDOFQ
