5,'This is a really easy to use and nice quality blood pressure monitor. The instructions were needed to figure out how to switch between the male/female user but it was as simple as holding the “set” button 3 seconds until it flashed, then clicking “mem” once to switch. After clicking “Set” again it goes through setting the date/time as well to store historical information for reference. Once setup and on the right mode it was easy to put the cuff on and take a measurement. Hitting “Start” and then relaxing with your arm flat with your heart it took about 30 seconds to complete the entire reading. I’ve always been just under the 120/80 and this came in right as I would have expected. This will be great for me to use to keep an eye on the blood pressure of my aging parents, as they’ve been recommended to do so but have been too stubborn to do it regularly. Now I have my own device when I check up on them.',B0B911MPB8,AERRN4REXN4QGV2JO55IZK3CEEWA
