5,'[[VIDEOID:d13a4b89f811eab55a0a3d81fd7bab83]] Liquid Chlorophyll has vitamin B, D, & E, calcium, and potassium, which are key for healthy hair and nail growth. As a busy professional, I don’t always have time to get my greens in, so I add this to a daily shake and it’s been very helpful! Just one dropper in your shake, water or juice is all you need!',B093993CTC,AEBTHBAHHW4MKTUZDNSDTWW2VSAQ
4,'What we received<br />We received a near square medium duty clear tape sealed plastic package, measuring 9” x 11\" x 2\" weighing in at near (10) ounces. Folded within was the footrest/bed.  Inserts were included inside, that gave basic instructions.<br /><br />Too small<br />I was really excited to receive this, from when I opened the package to when I started to open this up. However, my spouse had to do a mock trial and said in theory this appeared a great item, however, disagreed on its practicality and whether the steward/stewardess would allow this to clutter the row. Point acknowledged, but how about the tray? That’s down. So, we would have to be taking this off and on depending on the vagaries of the attendants and bumpiness of the ride. Because it did seem a little unstable.<br /><br />Quality<br />Seems sturdy and durable enough.<br /><br />Would I select this again.<br />I say yes, my spouse said no.<br /><br />Rating<br />Based on the totality, I compromised and allow a weak four (4) stars while my spouse said lower.<br /><br />Gifting<br />Would be okay for gifting, although no tags, the packaging was simple and it kind of looks like a commodity item that was bought on the cheap.<br /><br />Value<br />In hindsight, and now having this in-hand, having this priced at near $50 is too high. A price less than half of that would be an idea to consider giving this a try.<br /><br />Measures<br />Measures near 32” long and 18” wide. The average leg room is 31” on a plane<br /><br />I hope my thoughts were informational.',B0BMLLRX6H,AEDVEEUD4NZX7NYETDDN5N3HBJEA
