4,'I\'ve been taking the pill daily for about 6 weeks now. Is it working for me? Somewhat, but I still need a little more time to see the full results.<br /><br />My last monthly acne breakout only lasted 6 days instead of the usual 14-21 days. My last period was also slightly shorter, with a lighter flow (instead of 2 weeks of constant heavy flow). There has been no noticeable change in my weight, bloating, energy/fatigue, PMS, etc yet.<br /><br />The flavor is nice. I take this supplement last because it tastes the best.<br />The chewable pill is a decent enough texture (read as: not chalky).<br />I never had an upset stomach after taking the pill, even when I didn\'t take it with food.<br />However, the powder from the pill made my throat feel like it was burning almost every single time.<br /><br />I\'m considering switching to a non-chewable supplement to avoid the throat/nose burning sensation.',B085Z62GDP,AHVQ6WR5MHPTHXXWWWW7G34XWILQ
