5,'Amazing flat iron, huge upgrade from the one I currently own. I have long, medium texture wavy/frizzy hair and most flat don\'t stay hot long enough to do my whole head. I end up waiting for the iron to reheat up a bit between hair segments :( Not the case with this iron, which heats up to 450F (or anywhere in between for custom temperature which you can see at all times through a small clear window even while using, making sure hair doesn\'t fry), and it heats up quickly too (about 10-15 seconds)! The body is slim, making straightening close to the roots super easy. And the smooth fiberglass plates glide along hair, with absolutely no tugging or snagging. The iron spins on the cord so it doesn\'t tangle while using. And the iron comes with two hair clips, a protective glove and a cute carrying case to boot! I received this item at a discount for my honest review.',B01KVUGAQ6,AF5ZP2AWM674RYGHIKBYDH2MYL5Q
