5,'This lint roller works great at removing the cat hair from my clothes....something that is always a problem when you have 5 cats!  They are very sticky & work so much better & faster than the sticky sheets I\'ve tried.  The 2 extra rollers come in handy when the one you\'re using is full & you\'re not done....just pop a new one on & keep going!  Just rinse off the fur collected on the roller & when it dries, it\'s just as sticky as before!  I even bought a set as a gift for my sister.  Highly recommend & would not hesitate to buy again!',B078Z9ZN7F,AGKGTMFF6IN3RHVP2NN4WJ55ANKA
