5,'This is the best energy spray on the market! Those who gave it a lower mark most likely didn\'t read the instructions.  One serving is 5 sprays, but you can play around with it.  Start off by only using one spray and see how you feel.  I do one spray in the morning but do 5 sprays in the afternoon when I need it most.  Spray it under your tongue and hold it for a minimum of 10 seconds.  If you don\'t, it won\'t be absorbed and you won\'t get the full effect.  Also, this product doesn\'t contain cyanide like all other energy products on the market!',B00404KSB8,AH4JYJWHYYVDPEQTIVIAF4RG5LHA
