5,'... but it works! It has a really strong smell that lingers. It smells of tea tree, eucalyptus, and peppermint predominantly. I happen to like those smells so this stuff works for me. It\'s far better than foot odor in my opinion and I like the fact that it lasts awhile. I use it on my feet after exercise and it works right away. After spraying it in my shoes and letting it dry, it completely replaced the bad odor with those of the oils. This stuff has earned a permanent place in my closet and I will spray my shoes regularly. I like it and recommend it.',B01LYCSJM8,AH52452NXXPKFMO66MPSF5NFNUHA
