5,'So far so good. I have an issue with our city water being too salty but works fine with distilled just a pain to heat it, but not a flaw of the product. I love that it come with the belt. Helps relax during a session. I paid for these treatments for far too long. Then quit for a year and now that I\'m back I didn\'t realize how much it helped my joint pain. I\'m moving much better painlessly. I actually rolled my ankle a year ago and wasn\'t able to wear heels without it hurting and after 3 treatments with this machine. I wore them last again.',B0793NH6M6,AFJ6R67WXZV7MDTQWN4UF6AE2B3Q
