5,'This is our 2nd MinusA2 Rabbit Air.  We also have one of their smaller units as well.  We love them.  Our son has allergies which have gotten worse with the airpulltion in the city we recently moved too.  Our first purchase of the smaller unit we put in our son room.  He\'s sneezing and coughing went away at night.  But would ramp back up in the morning.  So we bought a large MinusA2 for our main level....and this one for the lower the lower level.  We choose the artist series so it was a little more decorative in our living room.  But our other is just a plain white one.  We live in a quad level home so we hope to place one on each level in time.  A normal person not sensitive to allergies could probably get away with 2 in a regular size house.  Our son\'s health has drastically improved with the air purifiers in our home.  REALLY HAPPY!!',B005EIGN5E,AFL3C7I3VQIUJ7BMNZXYTYET47NQ
