5,'I rarely open advertisements and in fact run from them, but this one pulled me right in saying it is ideal for IBS sufferers. I\'ve tried so many probiotics over the last 10 years and some worked a little, but this one is the first to give me the ability to eat things that send me right to the toilet. I haven\'t been able to eat anything with garlic for the last decade without running to the toilet as well as refried beans, and this is seriously the first time I digested without my intestines wanting to explode. So I say with total confidence that this probiotic-enzyme combo really works. I still will continue eating a whole food plant based diet, but it\'s really good to know I can eat out with family or friends and not worry about where the nearest toilet is. This has given me so much peace and I think anyone with IBS should give it a try.',B07TWJ66W6,AGJ3FGTLXJGRJ3RFTBDRQDGD2LEQ
