5,'I used to work for Zee Medical and handled all the restaurants and auto dealerships in West Palm Beach, FL. People would see me coming down the road and wave me down to get pain aids. They said they used to work at an auto dealership or restaurant etc and used then for all sorts of pain. To remove headaches, migraines at times, stomach ache (with food) severe back, hip, leg, shoulder and neck pain. But many said there was no better medicine for hangovers. I wouldn\'t know, never had one but would grab a Pain Aid if I did.<br />They have regular Pain Aids,, Extra Strength and Back Pain Aids. My husband and I use 2 Back Pain Aids with 1 extra strength when heading out on a trip to be in a car traveling a long time, helps prevent pain and keeps us awake. Yet I can take at nite for pain and sleep like a baby. We would not be without them. Reason for being on this site today. I usually buy direct from ZEE MEDICAL CO.',B002C6467S,AGV7H5IH44VE7ZDYUC6X3XNFBVZQ
