5,'I\'ve been looking for a product that removed dead skin cells without causing irritation. This is it.  In addition, it opens the pores up so your anti-wrinkle/moisturizers actually penetrate into the skin where they can be absorbed. When I looked at the ingredients (Glycolic Acid, Bilberry Extract, Sugar Cane Extract, Sugar Maple Extract, Orange Fruit Extract, Lemon Extract, Willow Bark Extract, Cucumber Flower Extract) I was surprised because each ingredient alone is warranted for the face and used in peels. Wow, I\'m giving myself a mini peel every day. :)<br /><br />Cell turnover has increased.  If I miss a day or night cleansing my skin feels rough.  Your face is smooth after using this product.<br /><br />This is an awesome product with excellent ingredients.  I found it by accident on Amazon and am so happy I bought it.  It works wonders.',B000VEMWB0,AHCPXNFAPAUV6CDRNELKXBPDUNUA
