1,'I purchased this scale one year and a half ago. I knew it was not made for precise measuring, it was very cheap and my expectations were not very high, but still, this scale doesn\'t do a basic job. Over the months, I had to make sure the needle was pointing to zero every time I was using it (even if it was quite frequent, at least twice a week). But now the needle simply refuses to stop on zero. It stops on +1 lbs or -0.5 lbs but it\'s impossible to get it to stop on zero. Then when you step on it and step back, the needle indicates a whole new number all the time varying from +2 to -3 lbs... It is completely useless and frustrating. Unless you just want a vague idea of how much you weigh or your luggage weights, I would not recommend buying this product.',B0011ML42E,AHXCVFEYIH4FC472TFJ5APSNVGPA
