5,'This set includes 4 different type of ear plugs the blue ones are the softest the do have a good amount of noise canceling effect hit not as much as the others. I was surprised when I opened the large box to my surprise they dwelt very soft and easily molded into another shape. With this set you are supposed to squeeze into a triangle and then insert into your ear it feels a bit odd but work amazing for what I needed. I live in. A small place and my roommate is hard of hearing she always has the tv up almost all the way she turn it down she can’t hear it and. To make matters worse she sleep with the tv on😔😩.so today wheni got home after work I tested them out to see if they wear with keeping or not and my oh my I sleep like a baby of course I still could hear the tv but the noise was dramatically decreased. The only issue in was having was not inserting them in far enough to actually work once I corrected that it worked like a charm. Best purchase I made this year!!!!',B07Y2FVS74,AG6VVKIHSUMPTXVXNJJZCT4TNF7A
1,'This product did not deliver on it\'s promises. Flavor is just so so and tastes like watered down fruit punch leaving a chalky aftertaste. No matter how much you shake your shaker bottle the product doesn\'t fully dissolve. Pumps were not noticeable and focus was less than what I\'d get if I had a Redbull or Monster as a pre-workout. Left me with a ridiculous energy crash after 30 minutes of consumption. My wife noticed the same thing happened to her. I don\'t recommend this product.',B07C37X5DF,AGGMMBUVBEIJABFSXWFL3HT2CCHQ
4,'First of all, a warning - the cloth bleeds color (mine was black) so rinse in vinegar or other way to set the dye.<br /><br />I purchased the extra large and it really was extra large, too large in fact so I hand washed it in hot water and dried in the dryer on high heat. It did shrink down and fit comfortably on my face, from the bridge of my nose to well under my chin and cheek to cheek. I’m 6’ and have a long narrow face and no beard. For the price, it’s a decent mask, but only two thin layers, which when held up to bright light allow a small amount of light to show through, so a filtering layer would certainly enhance the filtering effect. The open side of the inner layer would allow for the filter, but there is no way to keep it in place except the shape of your face and the stiffness of the filter. It is very comfortable to wear and the ability to drop it off and hang from the neck strap is a nice feature.',B08BWBQ3T3,AFFBVPUTQE2DFICNVRHXPMAUYQOQ
