5,'I bought this set first for my 14 year old daughter who is dealing with acne.  She loved it from the get go and gushed about how much better get face felt and looked after using the cleaning brush.  Her acne was visibly improved.  She hadn\'t tried the lotion sponge but her reaction when she did is what made me get a brush set for myself.  She LOVED the way it left her face feeling when she put on her face lotion with the sponge and after trying it I\'m a convert as well.  I really like all of the attachments actually and I really appreciate that the unit is waterproof and I can use it in the shower.  I don\'t use the body brush much, but I do use the pumice stone, face brush and sponge.  The unit is nice quality and generally looks and feels good.  The added case is nice, but I haven\'t had a use for it.  I would recommend.',B00S7KFZTG,AEEO5G2NOCXIVRMYEXNZF4LX62BA
