5,'I liked this more than I thought I would. I\'m on the computer and on my cellphone all day at work and that constant hunching over has created so much tension on my cervical spine. This tension has cause a slight realignment of my neck. I\'ve gone to the chiropracter numerous times and he suggested a neck hammock or any cervical traction device. I just never followed through without because I thought it was a gimmick. I got this about a week ago and have been using it a couple of minutes every day. Usually first thing in the morning right before meditation and then right before bed. I have to say that I have actually noticed a difference and my neck and my trapezius muscles have relaxed. In turn, this has also caused a reduction in my headaches.<br />I really recommend this product whether you are having issues or as a preventative.',B08P8913N3,AGN25TTAARQGYP7GADIAIKPBORHA
