4,'I\'ve been fighting with tendinitis in both elbows for several months and my doctor had provided me with a wrap similar to these but for $35 and the quality is good but it\'s started showing some signs of wear and I wanted another one for my other arm.  Received these yesterday and they are pretty comfortable and seem fairly well made and probably as good or better than the one I have.  However, my first impression was that it could be bigger around as I had a little trouble putting it on.  These were bought under my wife\'s Amazon account but I am 5\'11\" and about 185 pounds and my forearms are only about 11\" diameter and while these fit, the straps only overlap by a 1-3/4\".  So, someone larger and with bigger forearms may have some trouble with them being large enough but they\'re probably good for around my size and smaller.  I do like the width and the added padded area (features my doctors version doesn\'t have) as it does seem more comfortable and gives more support around the injured tendon, so I\'m hopeful that it will hold up well and help with my injury.',B07PRT669L,AGDMMNUR5C3BWKK36ZV35QZ6AGAA
