1,'I purchased this product on its high praise in reviews and promotion by the likes of Doctor Wallach, who I highly respect. However I haven\'t found it to be all that great over other supplements. It\'s all chemical based, like thousands of other products on the market and when you take it the results are also much the same, poor lingering taste and discolored elimination. (which says to me that most of the nutriments are passing right though)  I\'ve heard the acclaim about weight loss and improved energy, but I\'m not looking to lose any weight, I just need the vitamins. I highly doubt I will purchase this product again, since it\'s rather expensive and really doesn\'t deliver the results I was looking for. I\'m highly disappointed however that such high profile people promote this product and give it such high praise. Maybe its just not right for me, I leave it to others who find it acceptable and consider that I wasted my money.',B007DZQCKC,AGCSLVWFUQU6VXVVGK5YUPPOTGFQ
