4,'I really like the options on this tooth brush. I\'ve seen some reviews mention the smaller brush head and not liking that but I really appreciate the smaller size. It\'s not hard to use on my teeth. I use the sensitive setting because I tend to brush to hard and cause damage to my gums/teeth. I LOVE the timer part where it tells you to switch every 30 seconds. I never brushed long enough before and now this makes sure that I do. My teeth feel SO clean! Less plaque and easier flossing since I started using this tooth brush.<br /><br />I DON\'T love the lotion of the power button. I have turned it off accidentally a few times while maneuvering the brush around my teeth. I wish it was more of a \"switch\" or you had to press and hold it in a moment so it isn\'t as easily pushed in.<br /><br />I got the purple color and its very light purple and not an obnoxious color at all. I like this brush a lot I only took away a star because of the power button issue. The price seems good. It was about $30 when I got it but seems to have various sales over time so watch the pricing to get a good deal.',B0BDGN82S7,AG7YXCJCP4XJ2I2GBJKUUU3HEONQ
