3,'After using these batteries for about a year or less now, I am having second thoughts on them.<br />I originally went with this brand because of all the opinions of others,  but after about 8 to 10 months now, I have had to discard roughly 25\% of them because they would no longer take a charge. Kept showing up in the charger as non-existent(null), which means they are no longer any good.<br />What I primarily use them for is in lawn solar lights, maybe that is just not a good environment for these batteries, I don\'t know for sure.  I have also used them in other things and I have noticed that they seem to lose power much quicker than another brand I also use.<br />I gave them a 3 stars rating because they do work, but not all they\'re cracked up to be. I would have felt good with a one or two star just the same.',B00478GE1U,AH3RKLCMOHQZDXE4DUN4AEJOOGZQ
