3,'The product is great!  That’s why I ordered it.  Received the two bottles of goop in a plastic bubble wrap bag.  Now what do you think happened.  There was soap all over the bag from the soap leaking out of the bottles.  At least ship the bottles in a box with packing material.',B09RGY6YJF,AGA5BPZYCW7NSENCDE5GT35S6EPQ
