5,'The jet have enough power to push the water around on a large tub. I set it up for my wife and also setup her Kindle to stream the movie \"About Time\" which show a run time of 2 hours and 3 minutes.  She actually watched the whole movie with this product on and running and the suction held up well even after the water has been drained.<br /><br />I believe that the complain about the suction is due to improper installation. One of the suction was also folded a little when I first got it out of the box same as some of the comments I have read from other reviewers but it did not give me any problem after I have it installed in the tub.<br /><br />Tip to have a strong suction.<br /><br />1. Make sure that the surface is flat and clean.<br />2. Wet the wall and the suction prior to installing.<br />3. Push the suction flat into the tub wall making sure that there was no air inside the suction cup.  If properly installed, the suction cup should be flat and not cone shaped. If there is air inside the suction cup then it will give up with the weight of the product or when the jet turned on.<br /><br />Note: When you have a properly installed suction, you will not be able to just pull the jet spa from the wall. The only way to remove the suction is to peel the suction cup 1 at a time.<br /><br />This jet spa keeps the foam from the foam bath that my wife added in the water.  I did not see any difference between the jet stream mode and the bubble mode. It seem to just push the water around at the same rate. We have it set to bubble so I guess that is what keeps the foam from the foam bath soap working the whole time but it could be the same if we leave it at jet stream mode.<br /><br />I did not see any cleaning procedure on the manual but after my wife\'s use, I clean this by filling one of my kids bucket with clean water and submerge the bottom part of this product letting it suck the clean water from the bucket and spit it out to the tub. I did this about 4 or 5 times.<br /><br />I left the product hanging on the wall for more than 24 hours to make sure that all the water have dripped and the filter dried up before putting it back in the box for storage. 2 of the suction was still holding up after over 24 hours of the product just hanging on the tub wall so I could say that it is built to hold the device during use.',B002Y6KWJC,AHTBHC7IPWLQZXMTOKRKZX2XPZHA
2,'We purchased two of these in the medium size, overall they were great. However, we ordered additional ones and they sent us some large ones instead. They are far too big and cumbersome. It would seem that the small size difference between the medium and large wouldn’t be a big deal, but for daily use it’s actually a significant downgrade.  The small size don’t fit enough pills.',B07HY9RX22,AH2ZOEXV3MZ5ALNFFUNZ2WGGYEIA
