4,'[[VIDEOID:3e0c0c87aafe7c256a16b888c1209700]] I waited to post this review until I went In For my quarterly periodontal this week. What prompted me to buy this in the first place was the dental hygienist recommendation to purchase an electric toothbrush and after shopping around this is the best deal in the market. What’s even better is my hygienist didn’t need to use a water pik and just used a dental instrument to clean my teeth as there was hardly any tartar buildup after using this for 3 months. She even recommended that I come in 2x a yr instead of 4x a yr so thereby saving evening more $$ for copays etc. this toothbrush works great and I couldn’t be more pleased with the results. It will give the big guys like sonic care and oral B a run for their $$$....now my doughter wants one!!',B07MG4GZWW,AFPVJ6WBKHOJJI6JGG53PQM3SYIA
5,'Wow - new favorite all natural sleep enhancer.  I trust herbs to take me down and bring me back up without any residual grogginess; this one did just that - I woke up refreshed and not at all groggy!  What I don\'t trust herbal remedies to do is to take you far enough; this one did just that, and I was transported into never-never land easily.  I slept soundly and, when I got up to go to the bathroom, wasn\'t jarred out of it, but readily fell back to sleep.  Great dreams, which I remembered.  Keep it around for when the body or brain are too buzzy and I can\'t settle down.  Excellent, recommended product!',B00Q3Y4O8Q,AHKWY35T7WSHU55TYJSBLQX5WLIA
