5,'I\'m so excited to write this review for the Care Guys suede and nubuck cleaner! But as they say, a picture is truly worth a thousand words! (Please see attached photos where I have before and after side by side.)<br />First let me start by saying I picked my favorite suede clogs that have seen me through the past two winter\'s worth of east coast snow, rain, and mud. These shoes have been very kind to me but the wear was really evident and I thought they were ready for retirement. I\'ve tried cleaning them before with a damp washcloth but they would always pretty much dry looking the same. I honestly can\'t believe that they look as good as they do after just one time using this cleaning kit. Everything you need to clean your suede or nubuck is included and it couldn\'t be easier. I followed the directions and the results speak for themself. I always wanted to get this particular shoe in a lighter shade but was always worried about staining and dirt. Knowing now that there is a cleaner made specifically for this type of material that\'s gentle and effective I won\'t hesitate to change things up a bit. I truly hope you can see in the photos how much better the shoe I cleaned looks. I hope this helps you in freshening up your shoes too!!',B074TDTXWY,AEVICAPFFUAG22APKGF5ORLXLENA
