2,'I have only ever seen these types of \'basket\' lens cleaners to be used with hydrogen peroxide solution, which, with other baskets, neutralizes after 6 hours and are perfectly comfortable to place in the eye in the morning. This is not that! I guess the other types of baskets have some sort of \'platinum neutralizing disc\' inside that reacts with the solution.<br /><br />I went in this morning to put them in, and burned the hell out of one of my eyes.  This is not a feeling I would want anyone else to experience, so please be warned!<br /><br />I don\'t see any other reason for a kit like this. Swishing them around doesn\'t clean the proteins off my lenses. But it is very cute and fun to use, just for me, useless. I will be returning.',B07V5YSTC6,AESBRX5YQG2BPSLP5F7HCKXDWFGA
