3,'I got this pillow because I have coccyx pain sometimes, but also needed a seat cushion for hard dining room chairs where I do computer work etcetera.<br />Well I can\'t provide an accurate review because, being a relatively short woman when I sit on this my feet don\'t touch the floor! Then uncomfortableness of not having feet touch the floor is compounded when trying to sit comfortably on a contoured cushion.<br />That being said, it feels like a high quality cushion (indeed a cheaper material would probably compress more and perhaps &#34;fit&#34; me), and I can feel the cooling layer. I want to like it and am pretty bummed I can\'t use it.<br />So my husband got a new cushion instead he said he likes it and it\'s a step up from the old couch cushion he was sitting on in his hard chard (that\'s not saying much though). My husband says to point out he doesn\'t think it would work comfortably in anything but a hard seated chair.<br />This product was given to me at a discount in exchange for an honest and unbiased review.',B0157DCK70,AEPXNR7GSSJC7OJULK6FRQEHDFRQ
