4,'Cricket powder is a great way to get all the benefits of a high quality protein source that is both environmentally friendly and sustainable.  We tried cricket powder in smoothies and used it to replace up to about a third of the flour in home-made pumpkin muffins and chocolate espresso banana bread and it worked well.  The smokey, nutty flavor of the crickets is softened by the fruit flavors and the dryness of the insects is negligible when blended with such moist ingredients.  My teenage son loves carbs and this provides a sneaky way for me to get more protein and fiber into his diet!',B010VU7GPA,AEP5AZCFGCTU6QP2SFI5BYTJJZMQ
