5,'First off, this bag was alot bigger then I thought (Around half the width of a pillow).  Product came quick and on time.  Capsules top/bottoms came separated in different sealed bags.  All bags are vacuum sealed.<br /><br />Current issue was that some of the capsule ends had slight bends in them from other tops/bottoms pressing against each other.  However this did not effect my production and no greater amount was used, the pills went together just fine and stayed together.<br /><br />Another weird thing was when I was sifting the pills into my pill maker (100 at a time) some fell through getting stuck in the bottom around the pills (this was only for the pill bottoms meaning they may have been slightly different size then my last gelatin ones).  They did not cause any issue with making the pills and I just tossed the 3 afterwards.  It may have also been that I had to adjust the height on the pill bottom machine (which I will watch for next time).<br /><br />Note to everyone, try to go for vegetable capsules when you can as you don\'t want some people to not try your supplements because they have they caught the veganism bug.  Keeping your audience as big as possible.<br /><br />One thing I would am going to enquire about is a certification of analysis on the pills to use for legal production',B00N81GLPG,AFPKKUOYWS5VTXPTHEG4C2763ZBQ
