3,'This design holds the ice pack firmly on my shoulder.  It\'s much easier than trying to hold the pack there by hand for 15-20\' .  The quality of the product is lacking in two respects.  The velcro at the end of the strap needs to be a larger piece so that the strap remains firmly secured and really grips the front strap.  After a short time of use it does not stay attached very well.  It keeps coming loose.  Also the velcro closure for the ice pack could simply be eliminated in the design.  It is not needed.  The ice pack stays in the pouch just fine without using the closure.  I purchased this in September and this velcro doesn\'t even work anymore.  Overall this gets the job done.  It just needs some improvement.',B01MR6QQBB,AETYJKXEW4LHV7NBVOMC3WNAQEKA
1,'Product Identifier Mineral Oil (Duoprime Oil 70) Other Means of Identification White mineral oil. Lubricant, process aid in plastics, release agent in food processing, rust and preventative in food processing machinery.<br /> How is white mineral oil made?<br />Most often, mineral oil is a liquid by-product of refining crude oil to make gasoline and other petroleum products. This type of mineral oil is a transparent, colorless oil, composed mainly of alkanes and cycloalkanes, related to petroleum jelly.<br />What Are Side Effects Associated with Using Mineral Oil?<br />Lipid pneumonitis if ingested in reclined body position.<br />Fecal incontinence.<br />Intestinal malabsorption.<br />Impaired absorption of fat-soluble vitamins.<br />Rectal discharge of mineral oil.<br />Anal itching and irritation.<br />Abdominal cramps.<br />Nausea.',B00Q39T6NO,AHRNTGLHORNSCWQATN5GUYWKDMAA
