5,'This is an odd thing to leave a review for… But I have to say, I really like this lube. I love how smooth it is, and it really does a great job of getting things all ready to go. It’s not at all irritating despite it having a slight vanilla type of scent to it, and it’s safe on and for all the necessities. I’ve never had to use too much of this either, and it feels very close to the real thing. Not watery and not too thick. Plus, it’s free of all those nasty chemicals. I’m a fan.',B08J7Y2KZP,AFTJRHDLIZZSW3PBDL3TTSHBQI2A
5,'I\'ve ascribed to the primal/keto lifestyle for about two years and while I\'ve tried a bunch of the primal kitchen products I hadn\'t invested in any of the supplements until I saw this bundle on Amazon. I\'ve tried variants of all of the products by other brands and I\'ll touch on all of them briefly.<br />Primal Fuel - Tastes amazing with close to zero protein flavor and, in my opinion, no aftertaste to speak of. Good combination of vitamins and minerals, satiating, excellent meal replacement.<br />Master Formula - One of the BEST multi vitamins I\'ve tried. 12 capsules a day but I\'ve yet to find a product I trust the quality of with so much packed in. Conveniently packaged in easy to grab travel ready packs.<br />Primal Probiotics - I felt the difference in how well I handled different foods while taking these as well as a general improvement I\'m overall health. The benefits of healthy micro biome are extensive and these definitely help with improving your gut.<br />Primal Sun - This vitamin D supplement is not like I thought, a white powder in a capsule as opposed to a liquid in a gold colored gelcap. No complaints<br />Primal Omegas - These are pretty potent and aren\'t too large. There is a little bit of fish burp but I found it to be far less when taken in the middle of a meal and even without food, it\'s not that bad and doesn\'t last long at all.<br /><br />Final assessment, I would absolutely purchase any of these products individually and the fact that all of these products are available in one bundled package at such a great price just ups the value. Try this bundle, you won\'t be disappointed.',B06X3W3Y4S,AFF4QJ4IHTXR5VFQV65OE4LBGS4Q
