5,'Don\'t understand how people say this doesn\'t work.  For me it\'s been a gamechanger!  The more middle-aged I become, the less my contacts are working out for me and I find myself wearing my glasses more than I have in more than 30 years.  Wearing glasses is bearable because of Nerdwax.  This stuff keeps my glasses from sliding all day - I commute to work and my glasses stay put, I bend down to pick something up and my glasses stay put, I exercise and my glasses stay put.  I have found this stuff to be amazing! (and I have very oily skin and sweat a lot!)',B00O0CK2UM,AH563O2IYIRLNHCBEVFU3RXO6FXQ
