4,'When I first opened the dog grooming set, I was skeptical. Even thought everything was nicely packaged.  It came with three attachments and is battery operated.  It also came with a brush to clean the attachments. It also came with a cord to charge. First I charged the trimmer for twenty four hours.  The batteries were powerful enough though.  I am not a professional groomer although I have groomed Doodles and Maltese multiple times. 74 The trimmers worked very nicely with our Maltese. And are great for that in between grooming appointments.  I used the trimmers around my doodles faces and they worked well. Not as good as the professional clippers that we have. Doodles have more coarse hair then our Maltese.  I  am afraid to try to use the clippers to do a full shave because the last I want to do is burn out the clippers. Heavy duty clippers ( professional) should only be used for a full shave. I bought these with the intentions of cutting around their eyes, beards, and in between their toes. 176 The trimmers work perfect for these areas. Again, I am not a professional groomer, and I am not used to cutting or filing down our dogs nails. Luckily we have dogs who loved to be groomed and pampered, so our dogs will just sit on the couch with their paws on a towel in my lap while I filed their nails. Again the filing tool worked great for our little Maltese. As for the Doodles it seemed to take way longer and did not seem powerful enough. After filing my dog Thias nails for ten minutes on one paw, I really could not notice too much of a difference between the filed paw and not filed paw . I would personally recommend this product to anyone who has furry animals for maintaining their animals nails or for small trims.  The attachments are extremely easy to take off and put on. The package it small enough that it is great for traveling or compact storage.  The product is extremely easy to clean. 346 If you are afraid to file or trim your dogs nails because you are afraid of hurting them by filing the nails too short then the filing attachment will work perfectly for you. I personally would  start to feel nauseous while trying to file or trim our doggies nails but with this attachment it is impossible to file the nails too short. 409 The little grips on the side of the tool make it safer to trim without your hands slipping and then you end up with a chunk of fur missing. I do feel that the batteries worked way stronger then the charged system. The trimmers also were not as loud as other clippers that we have and have used in the past.  Our professional clippers are so loud that they scare our Maltese and we are not able to calm him down enough to even let the clippers get near him. The sound freaks him out so much. With these clippers the sound is so soft or low that he doesn’t even stress out.',B08X75VSJ8,AGYWS6ARVNGDVNLYIJD53IGUSRWA
