5,'I hurt my back and hadn\'t been able to work for a week.  Saw this and loved the pocket for the included hot/cold packs. Thought that was a great idea and makes it alot easier to ice or apply heat. Ordered and paid extra for 2 day shipping because I needed it ASAP.  I\'ve been using it constantly for 4 days now.  Great support and the ice & heat are great, although I haven\'t been able to use the heat pack because I don\'t have a microwave. I am 5\'7&#34; and about 150lbs, and my measurements were on the end of the medium size so I thought I should order a size up, and it seems to be a good fit. Love the extra adjustable straps on the sides, makes it feel secure. Everything seems to be great quality & company/customer service is wonderful! Thank you!',B072JCNLQ4,AF7V4OPEM47T2XCLDBQF7FWGYUGQ
5,'I have bought several of these devices now. My biggest complaint is that the most common design of these leaks and breaks within a couple months, no matter how much the device cost. I bought this one because it uses a different design standard. I\'m glad I did!<br /><br />THIS ONE DOES NOT LEAK. Furthermore, I don\'t feel like there is any chance of it breaking and leaking in the future. It\'s the only one I trust enough to carry in my purse so far.<br /><br />These are useful for SO MUCH. Prepping your skin for lotions and oils, dampening masks and treatments a bit after they\'re applied to help them work down deeper, setting face makeup and eyeshadow, refreshing and reactivating your skin in the middle of the day when it starts getting dry under your makeup or skincare product, reducing inflammation, and probably way more that I haven\'t thought of yet.',B08CN7PPBB,AFOA2HTRX44FROMC3WKNJD74UALA
