5,'I have used many sleep masks in the past and with every single one, I would take them off in my sleep. Never had I made it through the night with it still on my face. So.... when I read all the wonderful reviews about this mask, I ordered it, although honestly I was only cautiously optimistic that it would be as great as the reviews said it would be. Well, it arrived quickly and when I opened it up I didn\'t see what was so great about it. It was definitely thin and soft..... just like the reviews said, however, the strap that holds it on felt like it was going to slip right off my head while sleeping. HOWEVER..... when I went to bed that night, I put it on. It was soft, and light and really really comfortable. When I woke up in the middle of the night to get a drink of water, it WAS STILL ON!!!! I hadn\'t taken it off in my sleep like I\'d done with every single other night mask. I got some water and went back to bed. I turn a lot in my sleep and I thought that since it was so soft and silky it would turn and twist on my head. IT DOESN&#34;T!!!! It stays exactly where it is supposed to be. And here\'s another thing that is so wonderful about this mask. The strap doesn\'t bother the top of my ears like all of the other ones do. With the masks that have straps made out of elastic, they feel like they are digging into the place where the top of my ears connect to my head. (Sorry I don;\'t know what to call that part) This mask doesn\'t do that at all. Well, I\'ve been wearing it now for about a week and I LOVE LOVE LOVE it!!!! It\'s silky and soft and thin and comfortable. It stays in place and I NEVER take it off in my sleep. When I wake up in the morning it is still exactly where it was when I put it on the night before. I\'m tempted to buy a bunch of them just to have in case they company ever decides not to  make them any more. And, if I could give this make 10 stars.... I would. I highly recommend it to anyone who wears or wants to try wearing a sleep mask!!!',B01MSIPA81,AGREZW2BG3NOTCG5I2IZWAZESZLQ
