5,'You have to be patient, you will not get long lasting results overnight. Consistent use over a long period of time will get you results. Very short term results can be had immediately but after removal, the nipple will return to its normal size in a bit.<br /><br />Some tips: Be gentle when twisting to apply suction, if you overdo it you can break the top thin plate on the spindle.<br /><br />Use a lubricant, like Burt\'s Bees Moisturizing Lip Balm. Apply to both the areola and the nipple. It will help create a better seal and moisture the tissue.<br /><br />Don\'t rush things, applying too much suction can cause blisters and/plasma leakage. Start with low suction and short application time. Increasing each in increments. If you increase the suction, consider decreasing the application time and then begin increasing the application time until you increase the amount of suction.',B07HVD2SJ2,AHAXXOC4J6D7QUYEVIX6UAWZBQAQ
