5,'I love these TruVision Readers.  I ordered the +2.00 and they are work great.  I am constantly forgetting to put my readers back in my bag or I leave them somewhere and can\'t remember where they might be.  So, I love the fact that this set came with three pairs.  I also appreciate the little fabric pouches with which they came.  I can keep a pair in the glove box of my car and one in my bag and still have one left over for when I loose a pair!<br /><br />The glasses seem to be made very well quality wise.  The lenses are nice and clear.  I love the fact that TruVision has so many different magnifications available.  I saw magnifications on their list that I don\'t think I have seen in stores.<br /><br />I received this item at a reduced price in exchange for my honest, unbiased opinion.',B00T3NTIY4,AF3Y52TUQPCNOZW7GI3XGGJJFZTA
5,'I have had hay fever symptoms for years and thought it was related to candida. Well, I got so sick I completely went off sugar and starchy carbs for way  over a month. My symptoms continued to get much worse. I felt better when I was eating sugar and carbs.That is when I realized it was the histamine.<br /><br />I had been thinking that maybe I had a problem with histamine. I read an article about it and thought maybe there is something to this. So I went and bought Swanson\'s Daosin and took it for two days and for the first time in years my eyes stopped itching and running, I stopped sneezing and blowing my nose. I had a red rash around my eyes always, now it is gone. I don\'t have to buy a giant box of kleenex every week now. I don\'t have regular migraines anymore. I take it with foods I know sets this off. Sometimes I have to take two at a meal if I eat several foods that are high in histamine. I really don\'t want to be without this.<br /><br />Taking anti-histamines over the counter are so toxic that I got more sick than just putting up with the symptoms. This stuff really works if histamine build-up is your problem, without the side-effects. It doesn\'t just cover up the problem, it takes care of the problem.',B006FV62YG,AGPVBP55ISOFZCT6634HZWSYVFZA
