5,'First, the product.  It\'s fantastic.  Forget Shout, forget every other stain remover you\'ve ever used -- this stuff is phenomenal.  My daughter is a stain magnet as well as not being toilet trained.  You can imagine what I have to wash, especially since we use cloth reusable wipes.  Add to that the fact that I like to dress her well, and I\'ve got a problem - nice, durable clothes that will last if only I can keep them clean.<br /><br />So far, Grandma\'s has gotten out dried blood, road grease on the back of a favorite pair of pink leggings, innumerable grass stains, every variety of art supply you can imagine, washable or not, ink and more.  I spray it on clothes and I pour some in to use as a prewash on really stubborn loads.  I couple it with Oxyclean for additional punch.  It\'s saved a lot of clothes and a LOT of money.  Plus, it smells great - a bit lemony and soapy.  Can\'t beat that.<br /><br />The one thing I will point out is, that while the seller does deliver in a very timely fashion, they also charge almost a buck more than WalMart does for the same product -- and you can get free delivery, if not so fast, if you order this amount from them.  Be aware and price compare, as always on Amazon, where ripoffs abound.',B074MQKN4B,AHUJT72I2TLW7QJKQUQX55RUBBBA
