3,'Clif makes some other health, energy, endurance recovery bars, and some are decent.  Unfortunately, this is just barely edible for me, and since I\'d not crave it at all, I\'ll probably give most of the rest away.  The ingredients are fine, non-GMO, some antioxidant, tocopherols, and a high protein content.  It\'s also a bit caloric, but at least not in a totally bad way.  The taste just isn\'t there, and I don\'t like the mouth feel, it has a limp chewiness, no crunch and while you can make out some of the flavors, none of them tells you to come back for more.  Not recommended.  Clif makes better products than this.',B07NLYP5LQ,AGDQCJWEQ5D4LRTWNYR4BUG54N7Q
