5,'Okay, went a bit crazy with the mix, went 2:1(2 water, 1 solution) and sprayed it on the transom of my boat to test it out, what an amazing difference this stuff makes! You can clearly see the difference between non-cleaned and the sprayed area in the first photo. What\'s amazing is a couple of coats with this stuff and washing it right off, no scrubbing, no scraping, no nothing but just spritzin\' this stuff on and washing it off, the second photo is the outcome!<br />A word of caution, do NOT do this in your shop!!! Wet the floor before I started, yet it still stained it. I\'ve since removed the stain with a bit of scrubbing, but you can see what it does to the ground. Do this somewhere you don\'t mind making a mess of the area!!!',B01M5CNZYU,AGZVFNO3AKBXM6WPACAY2KQC3DHQ
