5,'I have been taking Mucuna Pruriens with pure beet root juice, along with daily vitamins and fish oil for overall brain function.  I decided to add this to my regimen to see if it would help.  Within three days, the results are amazing!  I\'ve got great energy and my mental clarity is that of when I was in my 20\'s.  It\'s like clearing 20 years of brain fog!  Now mind you, I do take double the dose (2 in the morning and 2 in the early afternoon).  I did notice I have to take mine with food, or else I experience something close to a Niacin flush.  Also, I do have my morning coffee with breakfast,  but I feel that\'s negligible.  I\'m super happy with this product!  If anything I would just additionally supplement with more Rhodiola Rosea, as there is only 50mg per capsule.  Will buy again!!!!!!!!!',B07HY4Z3T7,AEMTRWSFHE7WUMBJWVQPZOLUL3WQ
