1,'Worked for a week, was reading as it should end of day weighed 190 plus or minus 1 lbs. Weighed in the morning butt naked, 187.6 lbs sounds right after using toilet. Next morning says 264 lbs, then 256 lbs, tried again said 235 lbs. Changed batteries, Née Energizers says 135 lbs, 156 lbs, then everytime I step on it it would fluctuate and read blank or couldn\'t make up its mind, 135, 155, 144, 182, blank. Tried again fluctuated 184, 165, 153, 136, 142. Must be very cheap materials, tin wires, made in China Tofu manufacturing. Very shotty electronics, my old Skool needle scale is 10x more reliable, says 187 in morning, 190 to 191 at night after all the food and drink I had for the day. I check it with that scale 4 times in the morning still says 187, night 190 to 191 and I thought this Youbure thing would be cool for digital read out...better as a glass Frisbee to the recycling bin. Hahaaaa..Don\'t Waste Your time or money on this product. They need to redesign it with quality electronics and use copper wires with quality materials to make it worth purchasing in my opinion!!!',B08K4CCS2L,AELXSV3KRKAOJKC5F354ZLGPL6SA
