5,'I\'m really loving this razor. There\'s so many to choose from nowadays - up to 9 heads! This one is a solid 3 rotary head shaver that outperforms a most of the 7+ head shavers.<br /><br />It feels really well built, has a nice weight to it, sits well in the hand with a rubberized grip, is IPX6 (shower friendly) waterproof, and holds a charge nicely.<br /><br />The kit comes with an extra rotary head assembly but I\'ve read in other reviews (which I will echo here for visibility) that SH90 heads are compatible for the future.<br /><br />Overall this kit outperforms many shavers I\'ve used and is a complete kit that will last a long time with the replacement heads and is perfect for home or travel.<br /><br />I HIGHLY recommend this one.',B0BG2GPWWD,AGCVXELZH5RVDCSU3LTL75BX6UQA
