5,'Finally a sweeper that picks up resistant dog hair! Our dog has hair that seemed to have powerful anti-cleanup powers. Short of vacuuming it up every day, regular Swiffer dusters would not pick it completely.<br /><br />A friend told me about fleece dusters, and how they worked well for her. Found these Xanitize fleece dusters and thought I\'d give them a try.<br /><br />And it\'s true, the fur clings to the fleece fabric!!! I am so happy with these!!! They glide across the floor smoothly and pick up fur and dirt in one swoop. They\'ve ended my morning sweeping frustration. If you haven\'t tried fleece, I highly recommend it.<br /><br />The 5 pack is great, because I can toss one in the wash pile and have a clean one to go for the next day. Thank you Xanitize!',B01GDFE3OY,AE5U6C4URTQFOFIIG5SL3MEAVMFA
