4,'On its own this mask would be useless *but* with a filter insert it’s the best I’ve tried so far with my glasses. Despite not having wire on the nose bridge, the soft fabric and adjustability make it easier to manipulate. With a filter it seals snugly around my chin & feels great. The pocket for the filter is just big enough to keep it in place without shifting. I just ordered four more for my son to take to college along with enough filters to last the semester. Because it can hang comfortably around your neck well below your chin you won’t be tempted to set it on a public surface/desk etc when eating & drinking (which I see people doing and it is so counterproductive!). I usually don’t write reviews but this exceeded my expectations.',B08B7RRTF4,AF76QAA3MU2M6CCSBE7UTOLD5NYA
