5,'i use this for really dirty, stinky stuff....goat marked clothing, hunting camp gear....i love it! i used to use tide, because nothing worked as well, but i felt bad about the ground water pollution, esp. the well....so i found a recipe for zote; grate 1/5 bar into washer, add 1/4 cup each of laundry soda and borax. this works for full, really dirty load of laundry. costs pennies, works SO MUCH BETTER THAN TIDE or any other laundry soap. it has a strong, but pleasant soapy-flower smell if you use too much. its not bad....i keep a cheese grater for the zote in the laundry room. some people say to grind it all at once, but it works best to grate it as you use it. takes about 5 seconds to grate enough.i will never go back!!!',B01CZBT7MI,AEJYXH6D2B22PQI7M4QFJVYI5BSQ
