5,'I grow my own loofah but it take a few months to dry after the growing season so I am all out right now.  It pains me to have to purchase it but this brand took me by surprise.  I really like that each loofah comes with a nice thick rope to hang it while not in use (you get 2 in the pack).  They also come with a suction cup to stick to your shower (or shower door) to hang them on.  It did smell different than the ones I grow.  It had a grassy scent to it.  It\'s not over powering but noticeable when I put it up to my nose.<br /><br />I only use loofahs for my feet.  I rub the end of the loofah on my bar of soap and go to town.  They work great at removing dead skin that builds up to create callouses and tough heels.  They were firm but not stiff as a board like some loofas are.  They get a little bet softer when you get them wet.  Ive had some in the past that were hard as a rock!  All in all I love these!<br /><br />*I received this product as a promotion in exchange for my honest review. I was neither paid nor sponsored for my opinions and all thoughts reflected in this review are solely my own.',B00MKAWHOK,AHYRGYQVH2SYTIU7HJHYOVD34EQA
