5,'This is really a nice little kit.<br /><br />I have to admit I was a bit reticent about engaging in self-dentistry, but after my 1st use with this kit, I see no reason not to do some minor cleaning on my own.<br /><br />The kit comes with a nice assortment of tools, all well made.  The ultrasonic cleaner has 3 modes, and the gentle cleaning mode does appear effective, yet also unlikely to do any damage.  I do recommend reading the instructions as there are a handful of important and helpful tips in there.<br /><br />It charges up in just a few hours, and comes with a nice cap to keep it sealed and clean between uses.  The cleaner doesn\'t make a lot of noise, and you won\'t know it\'s on until it touches your teeth and there\'s a very gentle sensation.',B0BNDGLHYQ,AGFONSSSU4VCKUHHBDLKKR7FAR3Q
