2,'So I got this brush with the following in mind... I don\'t really like straightening my hair or using a lot of heat on it BUT I generally wake up with an overall disheveled look and like the idea of just &#34;brushing my hair&#34; with a straightener. I was so excited when I got it yesterday and last night I plugged it in and brushed away! Unfortunately my excitement was short lived. when I got it, the packaging was fine...but then I saw the brush and the plastic was kind of like plastic you\'d see on your kid\'s toy car... not the highest quality. Ok. I can look past that. It\'s not like it was $200...<br /><br />I plugged it in and let it heat up. Immediately I did like the LCD display and that it has a F and C toggle for the temperature reading. There are buffer bristles if you will so you don\'t scald yourself. I never felt the heat directly on my head at any point.<br /><br />Now, I did read the directions before I started use so I noticed that the included pamphlet says not to use the brush at the highest setting for more than 15 minutes or you will overheat it - con: it doesn\'t have a safety turn off or overheating feature. Also, when I started brushing, my hair would catch and pull... a good 20 hairs or so were sacrificed.<br /><br />All in all I really didn\'t &#34;get&#34; the product. I felt like it was one of those things like an extra kitchen appliance, It\'s interesting to have but really just takes up space. The only major feature (which I\'m still trying to decide if it\'s worth it or not) is it does work great for my bangs. They\'re short so they didn\'t get caught and they straightened my bangs beautifully, just not the rest of my hair.<br /><br />I will say this as my final thought, I have long hair (almost down to my waist) and it\'s natural 99\% straight and very healthy. If you\'re looking for hair on the product package (sleek and super straight) as advertised, you\'re not going to get it using this brush. That look comes from a flat iron. If you\'re looking for something that will help tame the frizzes and fly aways this product  will work.<br /><br />I received a discount on this product in return for writing a honest review.',B019SO9LHG,AFKL6BQSRS3YENQVBTZACMQE6SKQ
