1,'I am a big fan of OttLites and have owned several, but this was a bust.  First of all, you can only use it for books that are about 200 pages or less which is very limiting, but the worst part is the light.  It\'s very weak.  If you\'re trying to read in a dark room, it\'s certainly going to be of help, but if like me, you have poor vision and need excellent light to help you read, this isn\'t it.<br /><br />A better way is to get a regular bookstand, and then behind it on some type of stand, put something like the OttLite L139AB Task Lamb which gives powerful lighting.<br /><br />Back to the drawing board on this one.',B003IE8UOS,AH34TZLZXBFKAFKBS3NH4P33M5SQ
