5,'Since the dr who did my colon cleanses for my colonoscopies went out of business and there were no other places to go,I was in a panic. I am unable to swallow the liquid to clear ones bowels for colonoscopies,for I immediately throw up and with no place to go for color cleaners,I went to the Internet to see if there was another option. Happily I found the colonic board for at home use which I had no idea even existed.....it was wonderful and completely cleaned me out along with my ten day prep. The first six days I did the mayo clinic low fiber diet,then the last four days before my colonoscopy I did a clear liquid only diet along with three colon cleanses during those four clear liquid days. The at home payed for itself for the sessions at the Drs was around 100 dollars each,plus organizing the office hours schedule,especially the day of the colonoscopy has been really hard. The board is sturdy,easy to clean and fit well in my very small bathrooms. I am so grateful someone invented this and really loved the books on the colon...I learned so much and am blown away. Thank you so much :) one very happy customer',B003KM3VMY,AG73LUAFAP2BWZQK3R2NPSDI225Q
