5,'INGREDIENTS:<br />Let me start with what I feel is the most important factor, the ingredients!  A lot of pre-workouts list all of the right ingredients but have minimal quantities, not this one!  This has all the essential ingredients needed for an effective pre-workout and not only that but with PROPER quantities!<br /><br />FLAVOR:<br />On top of that it also tastes really GOOD! I\'ve tried several flavors and haven\'t had one that I didn\'t like.  So far watermelon is my favorite, taste just like the watermelon jolly ranchers!<br /><br />PRICE:<br />And the kicker...it\'s one of the CHEAPEST pre-workouts I\'ve come across!  I\'m confident that you\'re not going to find a better QUALITY ingredient pre-workout that also tastes GREAT for a better price than this!<br /><br />A bonus is that you can get it with or without caffeine with the exact same ingredient list!<br /><br />Wish I would have found this one sooner and if I could rate this higher than 5 stars I would!',B075ZPY6DB,AHHGJFXEZPCW3STCC7WR7NKEUWWA
