1,'I HATE THIS BRUSH!!!<br />My other one--which I LOVED fell in the shower, and the head came off. After a few weeks of forgetting to purchase a new one, I saw this fancy one, and said, &#34;what the heck?&#34;. Bought it, excited for an upgrade ((I assumed it would be because it\'s almost double the other one)).<br />Boy was I wrong.<br />I only used the small face brush, but I know I won\'t be using this anymore, as I\'ve ordered the original brush.<br />The bristles are TOO LONG AND TOO SOFT to do anything. They don\'t really get into your skin, and don\'t buff away dead skin. Also, because the bristles are so flimsy, the brush splashes water and your cleanser EVERYWHERE. Once you turn on the spin, it\'s splashing. You have to add your product to your face first, then use the brush... and even then--make sure to keep your eyes closed, because soap and water will go there, too. Pressing the on/speed/off buttons suck! The spin stops in between pressing...<br />ugh.. I just can\'t with this brush. Waste of money. Just glad that the other one arrives today.',B01B4FQXG4,AH5DGCVG5AHGX4VBWCTYW7PRLBDQ
